msgstr "이런 상태에선 베리가 열리지 않을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING"
