msgstr "어떻게 된 게 실물보다도 더 괴상해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO"
msgid "This sculpture is pretty beefy."
msgstr "꽤나 든든한 조각상이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Very statuesque."
msgstr "그냥 조각상 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a stone bishop."
msgstr "돌로 만든 비숍이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "The chess pieces are moving themselves!"
msgstr "체스 말들이 스스로 움직이고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY"
msgid "It looks nice, doesn't it?"
msgstr "꽤 괜찮은 것 같지 않아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT"
msgid "We have a winner!"
msgstr "우승자가 나왔습니다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON"
msgid "It would probably make a great scratching post."
msgstr "아마 발톱 긁는 용도로 아주 좋을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
