msgstr "뭔가 지느러미는 게 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER"
