#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT"
