msgstr "너 참 귀여운 고양이 같이 생겼구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "I must collect more... for research!"
msgstr "좀 더 모아야겠어... 연구 목적으로 말야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "What on earth is that thing!"
msgstr "세상에 저건 대체 뭐야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "It's really fancy for a deer antler."
msgstr "사슴뿔치고는 정말 화려하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
