msgstr "되게 날카로워 보이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "It's amplified with electricity."
msgstr "전기로 증폭되었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "A breakthrough in culinary science!"
