msgstr "입냄새 증강에는 일등이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
