msgstr "완벽하게 노릇노릇해졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
