msgstr "매일 가는 것."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE"
msgid "What an ugly little house."
msgstr "참 못생긴 오두막이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1"
msgid "Any science in there?"
msgstr "거기에 과학이 있긴 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2"
msgid "I could use some stuff."
msgstr "물건이 좀 필요한데 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS"
msgid "These are edible mushrooms."
msgstr "이건 식용 버섯이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC"
