msgstr "저거 버섯이야? 혼란스러워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED"
