msgstr "스위치가 고장났나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC"
msgid "There's a neat little switch that turns it on and off!"
msgstr "켜고 끌 수 있는 스위치가 달려 있네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET"
