msgstr "로봇 내장이잖아! 짱이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC"
msgid "That WX is full of surprises!"
msgstr "WX 얘는 아무리 봐도 놀라워! "

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY"
msgid "A hardworking delivery buddy!"
msgstr "부지런한 배달부 친구야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT"
msgid "Scott sure likes to explore!"
msgstr "스콧은 탐험을 참 좋아하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP"
msgid "Stay out of its way, Woby!"
msgstr "멀리 떨어져 있어, 워비!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC"
msgid "That's not a toy apparently."
msgstr "딱 봐도 장난감은 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC"
msgid "It's harder than a stale dog biscuit, Woby!"
msgstr "이거 오래 묵은 네 간식보다도 단단해, 워비!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET"
msgid "Kinda mushy now, but that's okay!"
msgstr "좀 질척하긴 해도, 먹을 만해졌어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER"
msgid "This must do something reaaally neat, Woby."
msgstr "이건 분명 아~~~주 대단한 용도일 것 같아, 워비."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC"
msgid "Wonder if WX wants all this stuff back."
msgstr "WX가 이 안에 든 물건을 돌려달라고 하려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER"
msgid "Should I start carrying something like this in my first aid kit?"
msgstr "응급 처치 도구에 이런 것도 가지고 다녀야 하려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY"
msgid "Is that a ghost in there, Woby! Amazing!"
msgstr "저 안에 저거 귀신인가 봐, 워비! 죽여주네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC"
msgid "Aww, who's a good little robot?"
msgstr "오구, 우리 꼬마 로봇 착하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING"
msgid "Aww, who's a good little robot?"
msgstr "오구, 우리 꼬마 로봇 착하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING"
msgid "Aww, who's a good little robot?"
msgstr "오구, 우리 꼬마 로봇 착하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM"
msgid "I guess it's taking a nap."
msgstr "낮잠을 자나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED"
msgid "What is it boy? Do you have something to show WX?"
msgstr "왜 그러니? WX한테 보여줄 게 있다고?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER"
msgid "Ooh, I think it studies the monsters!"
msgstr "우와, 괴물들에 대해 배우는 건가 보네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER"
msgid "That sure is handy! Or should I say clawy! Get it, Wobes?"
msgstr "일손이 늘었네! 일-집게가 맞으려나! 뭔 말인지 알지, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO"
msgid "What do you think it does, Woby?"
msgstr "뭐에 쓰는 물건일까, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "With this on, I'm invincible! Right?"
msgstr "이게 있으면 난 무적이야! 맞지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "Is it supposed to feel warm?"
msgstr "원래 따뜻한 기운이 나는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "Y'ello to you too! Okay, that was bad."
msgstr "나 모두에게 인사하노랑! 그래, 좀 별로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "It never hurts to have a little star power."
msgstr "별의 힘이라고 해 봐야 나쁠 거 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "That's not good..."
msgstr "이러면 안 되는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I should offer it something, but what should it be..."
msgstr "뭔가 바쳐야 할 것 같은데, 뭘 줘야 하나..."

