"though..."
msgstr "비팔로 의상 설명서인 것 같아! 일부분이지만 말이야..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST"
msgid "It's pretty hard to teach a beefalo \"sit\" and \"stay\"."
msgstr "비팔로에게 \"앉아\"와 \"기다려\"를 가르치는 건 많이 힘들어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "This looks easy enough to put together."
msgstr "조립하기 꽤 쉬워 보이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
msgid "My mom has one of those! It looks a bit different, though."
msgstr "엄마도 이런 거 가지고 계셨어! 조금 다르게 생기긴 했지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM"
msgid "Now to put it together!"
msgstr "이제 조립하자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "Let's win some prizes, Woby!"
msgstr "우리가 상 타자, 워비!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
msgid "It can't be that much harder than pitching a tent."
msgstr "텐트 펴는 것보다 어려울 리는 없겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of supplies..."
msgstr "물자가 아까워..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I think I need to offer it something for it to work."
msgstr "뭔가 바쳐야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we get, Woby?"
msgstr "뭘 얻어볼까, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "Hey! I was going to use that!"
msgstr "아! 나 쓰려고 했는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "A good sense of direction is important for survival!"
msgstr "좋은 방향 감각은 생존에 필수적이지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "You'll never be a Pinetree Pioneer if you can't follow directions!"
msgstr "방향 감각이 없으면 소나무 개척단이 될 수 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better start training my carrat."
msgstr "내 당근이쥐를 훈련시켜야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "I... reacted too slow... to put the fire out..."
msgstr "이런... 반응이 너무 느렸어... 불을 못 껐네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "By the time we're done, my carrat will be ready for anything!"
msgstr "훈련이 끝나면 내 당근이쥐는 뭐든 대처할 수 있을 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "These reflexes could save your life in the wilderness!"
msgstr "순발력이 야생에서 목숨을 구해줄 수도 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "Maybe I'll put it over here... no, over there!"
msgstr "저기다 놓을까... 아니다, 저기 놓자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "Does that look like a fire pit?!"
msgstr "저게 화덕으로 보이냐?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "I've never been a coach before!"
msgstr "난 코치 맡아본 적이 없는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "Hustle, hustle! Coaches say that, right?"
msgstr "헛 둘, 헛 둘! 코치들이 이렇게 말하지 않나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "Do you think we should put it over there, Woby?"
msgstr "저기다 두는 게 좋을까, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no!!"
msgstr "안 돼!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "This is very serious training equipment."
msgstr "아주 진지한 훈련 장비라구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "Aww look at him jump!"
msgstr "아아, 저 뜀뛰기 좀 봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "I'm great at putting things together!"
msgstr "난 조립하는 걸 정말 잘 해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "A good race needs some planning."
msgstr "좋은 경기는 계획이 필요한 법이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "Should it go there... no, no, maybe over there..."
msgstr "이걸 저기다가... 아니, 아니, 저쪽이 나을지도..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Someone sabotaged the race!"
msgstr "누가 경주에 훼방을 놓았잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "First one here wins!"
msgstr "먼저 들어오는 사람이 이기는 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "Yes!! Good job little guy!"
msgstr "좋아!! 잘 했어, 꼬마 친구!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "We'll be back for a rematch, {winner}!"
msgstr "한 판 또 붙자, {winner}!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "What if the race just went on forever?"
msgstr "경주가 절대 안 끝나면 어쩌지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "Let's start this race!"
msgstr "경주를 시작하자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "Woby, help me look for a good place to set this up!"
msgstr "워비, 놓기 좋은 곳 좀 찾아 줘!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Why won't everyone just use the fire pit?!"
msgstr "왜 아무도 화덕을 안 쓰는 건데?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "He just needs some more training. We'll get there!"
msgstr "훈련이 더 필요해. 어서 가자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "Woah, all our training paid off!"
msgstr "우와, 훈련의 결실이 보여!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "Do I get a badge for having the best carrat?"
msgstr "우량 당근이쥐 배지 같은 것도 주나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "I never knew skills could be measured by weight."
msgstr "능력을 저울로 잴 수 있을 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Mystery seeds!"
msgstr "수수께끼의 씨앗이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "Not knowing what they are is half the fun!"
msgstr "안에 뭐가 들었는지 모르는 상태에서 여는 것도 나름 재미있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "That's gotta be the fanciest anchor I've ever seen."
msgstr "여태껏 본 것 중에 제일 빛나는 돌이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "I've got all the supplies ready to build an anchor."
msgstr "닻을 지을 물자가 모두 준비되었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "I guess that's it then."
msgstr "이제 다 끝났나 보네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I think it wants something burnt."
msgstr "뭔가 탄 걸 원하는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we make, Woby?"
msgstr "뭘 만들어 볼까, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "A dragon boat needs a dragon paddle."
msgstr "용선에는 용노가 있어야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "I'll steer us straight to the finish line!"
msgstr "결승선까지 편히 모시겠습니다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "It's probably a good idea to add a steering wheel."
msgstr "타륜을 다는 건 좋은 생각일 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "I always wanted a rocking horse!"
msgstr "예전부터 흔들목마 가지고 싶었는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "I need to practice my gallop!"
msgstr "달리기 동작을 좀 연습해야겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Now that's a dark horse!"
msgstr "흑마가 됐네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "We need to gift the gift horse something first!"
msgstr "선물 주는 말에게 우선 선물을 줘야 해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't look it in the mouth, Woby!"
msgstr "입 안에 들여다보면 안 돼, 워비!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "That's some serious horse power!"
msgstr "말 힘이 장난 아니네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "It's joust perfect, Woby! Get it?"
msgstr "정말 창-의적이야, 워비! 뭔 말인지 알지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "We'll have his head on a platter!"
msgstr "접시에 머리를 바쳤어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Well, at least the worms are enjoying it."
msgstr "뭐, 그래도 벌레들은 좋아하는 것 같네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "Who ate all the good parts?"
msgstr "살 많은 데는 누가 다 먹은 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "It's nice to have a little extra firelight!"
msgstr "등불이 좀 더 생기니까 좋네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "Don't worry, Woby and I will find some kindling for it."
msgstr "걱정할 거 없지, 워비랑 나랑 불쏘시개 주워 오면 돼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "I'll have it set up in a jiffy!"
msgstr "얼른 설치해 봐야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "It's nice to have a little extra firelight!"
msgstr "등불이 좀 더 생기니까 좋네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "Don't worry, Woby and I will find some kindling for it."
msgstr "걱정할 거 없지, 워비랑 나랑 불쏘시개 주워 오면 돼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "I'll have it set up in a jiffy!"
msgstr "얼른 설치해 봐야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "All fighting should be done with pillows."
msgstr "모든 싸움은 베개로만 해야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "It's okay, everyone is wearing their safety gear!"
msgstr "괜찮아, 다들 보호구 끼고 있잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it set up in a jiffy!"
msgstr "얼른 설치해 봐야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "Time for a dessert break!"
msgstr "디저트 먹을 시간!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "Is that what the moon tastes like?"
msgstr "달에서 이런 맛이 날까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "It's so jiggly!"
msgstr "완전 탱글탱글해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "They're not marshmallows, but they're still pretty good!"
msgstr "마시멜로는 아니지만 꽤 맛있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste of good supplies..."
msgstr "물자가 아까워..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "That's a hungry-looking rabbit statue."
msgstr "배고파 보이는 토끼 조각상이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we make, Woby?"
msgstr "뭘 만들어 볼까, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "It's rude to hit people with gloves. You might start a fight!"
msgstr "사람을 장갑으로 치는 건 예의가 아니야. 싸움 날 수도 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Went up like a giant matchstick!"
msgstr "커다란 성냥이 돼 버렸어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "It makes me happy too, Woby!"
msgstr "나도 기분이 좋아, 워비!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "Light it up, post to post!"
msgstr "등불 등불마다 환하게 밝히자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Looks like someone forgot their fire safety."
msgstr "누가 화재 안전 수칙을 안 지켰나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What should we feed it, Woby?"
msgstr "뭘 먹여야 할까, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm squirming with excitement!"
msgstr "이거 점점 흥이 벅차오르네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
msgid "Woby, watch out for that worm!"
msgstr "워비, 저 벌레를 조심해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "This is exactly why learning fire safety is so important!"
msgstr "이래서 소방 안전 교육이 중요한 거지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I know a lot about dogs, but what do cats like?"
msgstr "개에 대해서는 잘 알긴 한데, 고양이는 뭘 좋아하지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Come on Woby, let's make something!"
msgstr "자 워비, 뭔가 만들어 보자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "That sure is a mystery!"
msgstr "이건 정말 수수께끼인걸!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "I think I'm doing a good job!"
msgstr "내가 잘 하고 있나 봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "Something must be bothering it."
msgstr "불편한 점이 있는 게 분명해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "Maybe it would be happier if it wasn't all alone?"
msgstr "혼자가 아니었으면 더 좋아하지 않았을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "I think it needs a story or two to cheer it up!"
msgstr "이야기 조금 들려줘서 기분을 풀어주면 될 것 같아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "I should probably do some weeding."
msgstr "아무래도 잡초를 좀 뽑아야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "Do you think it needs some water, Woby?"
msgstr "물을 줘야 할 것 같지 않니, 워비?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "Maybe it needs some better soil..."
msgstr "더 좋은 토양이 필요한 것 같아..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "I think we might've planted these too close together, Woby."
msgstr "아무래도 너무 가까이 심은 것 같아, 워비."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "I don't think it likes this weather."
msgstr "이 날씨를 안 좋아하는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "It's not looking so good..."
msgstr "상태가 좋지 않아 보여..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Hurry, stomp it out before it catches fire!"
msgstr "서둘러, 불 붙기 전에 밟아서 꺼야 해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "I sure wish I had a flashlight."
msgstr "손전등이 좀 있었으면 좋겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "I sure miss mom's scrambled eggs..."
msgstr "엄마가 해 주신 스크램블 에그가 너무 그리워..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "Mmmm, tastes like a perfectly toasted s'more."
msgstr "으음, 잘 익은 스모어 같은 맛이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "Oh well, we can just try again right? Right...?"
msgstr "이런, 다시 할 수 있는 거겠지? 그치...?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "Darnit! It's uh... a bit crispy..."
msgstr "젠장! 이거... 좀 탔네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "Huh. I thought that would go alright together."
msgstr "흠. 저렇게 하면 잘 될 줄 알았는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "Aw, do we really have to leave?"
msgstr "아, 꼭 가야 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE"
msgid "Didn't I see Goodfeather around here? I could have sworn I did..."
msgstr "차칸기털 그 양반 여기 어디 있지 않았나? 분명 봤던 것 같은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN"
msgid "Oh botheration! Looks like this was a waste of time."
msgstr "아이고 이런! 시간 낭비였나 보네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
msgid "Ugh, I should come back sooner... or maybe later."
msgstr "윽, 좀 있다가 돌아와야지... 나중이든 금방이든."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "It would be quite a short game, not that I'd mind..."
msgstr "게임이 좀 짧겠는데. 내 알 바는 아니다만..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "There's nowhere to hide around here."
msgstr "숨을 곳이 없잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid ""
"I think I've spent quite enough time wrangling these tiny terrors today."
msgstr "이 무서운 놈들 다루느라고 시간 잡아먹기는 충분히 잡아먹은 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid ""
"Could I pick the lock? Locks and clocks are only a letter apart, after all."
msgstr "자물쇠도 딸 수 있으려나? 자물쇠나 시계나 둘 다 기계장치잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "Hmph. Picky, aren't we?"
msgstr "흥. 거 참 까다롭기는."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "Gone already? Time sure flies when you're having fun."
msgstr "벌써 간 건가? 맨날 좋은 순간만 금방이라니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "It belongs to the automaton."
msgstr "기계 녀석 물건이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
msgid "I don't have time to fuss with the merms."
msgstr "어인들이랑 헛짓거리 할 시간 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE"
msgid "I've no time for bears who don't listen."
msgstr "내 말도 안 듣는 곰한테 버릴 시간 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW"
msgid "I can't just run in empty-handed!"
msgstr "빈손으로는 경기를 못 뛰지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER"
msgid "Ooph. That is far too strong."
msgstr "어유. 방금 건 너무 독한데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW"
msgid "I need you to look at this, time is of the essence!"
msgstr "와서 좀 봐봐, 시간이 없단 말이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I feel the darkness coming for me... I need more time!"
msgstr "어둠이 찾아오고 있어... 시간이 모자라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "It's so much fun, maybe I should go back and do it again!"
msgstr "이거 재밌네. 되돌아가서 다시 해 볼까봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "Maybe in another timeline."
msgstr "다른 시간선에선 가능할지도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION"
msgid "This is taking forever."
msgstr "한 세월이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I can't divide my time between any more pets!"
msgstr "애완동물이 더 생기느라 시간이 쪼개지면 안 돼!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "I'm going to pull a muscle if I try grabbing that from up here."
msgstr "이 높이에서 뭘 주우면 팔이 결릴 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON"
msgid "Wait a tick, wasn't I already following one?"
msgstr "잠깐만, 나 이미 따라다니던 녀석 있지 않았었나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE"
msgid "Oh come on, you want these worms don't you?"
msgstr "아니 좀, 이거 먹고 싶은 거 아냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
msgid "I'm burning!"
msgstr "나 불타고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's already carving it."
msgstr "누가 이미 조각하고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.GENERIC"
msgid "It'd be too risky."
msgstr "너무 위험할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.NO_TELEPORT_ZONE
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.NO_TELEPORT_ZONE"
msgid "The timestream here is too unstable... I shouldn't risk it."
msgstr "이곳의 시간의 흐름은 너무 불안정해... 함부로 시도해선 안 되겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.REVIVE_FAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.REVIVE_FAILED"
msgid "It looks like I was too late..."
msgstr "아무래도 좀 늦었나 봐..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.SHARD_UNAVAILABLE
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.SHARD_UNAVAILABLE"
msgid "There's too much wobble wibbling the timestream."
msgstr "시류에 요동이 너무 심해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.WARP_NO_POINTS_LEFT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.WARP_NO_POINTS_LEFT"
msgid "That's enough backtracking for now."
msgstr "일단 역행은 이 정도면 충분해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "I'm not meeting a fiery demise for a change of clothes, thank you!"
msgstr "옷 갈아입겠다고 불타 죽을 생각은 없어서 말이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Now's not the time."
msgstr "지금은 때가 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "Would you hurry it up a bit in there?"
msgstr "거기 안에, 좀 서두를 수는 없어?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT"
msgid "I thought I'd hitched up a... must've been in a different timeline."
msgstr "나 이거 잘 묶어둔 줄 알았는데... 다른 시간선에서 그랬었나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR"
msgid "Oh botheration, it hasn't grown enough hair yet."
msgstr "아이고 이런, 털이 아직도 안 자랐네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL"
msgid "Fully charged."
msgstr "완충됐어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE"
msgid "There's not enough charge."
msgstr "충전이 모자라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "It's too small to measure."
msgstr "측정하기 너무 작아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "Too small. I guess I shouldn't have picked it so early..."
msgstr "너무 작아. 너무 일찍 따지 말 걸 그랬나..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "I thought I'd already put... ah, I must've done it later."
msgstr "이미 넣은 줄 알았... 아, 나중에 했던 게 분명해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "Waiting is so tedious!"
msgstr "기다리는 건 너무 지루해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "Hold on... these are the wrong plans! What a waste of time!"
msgstr "잠깐만... 엉뚱한 계획이잖아! 시간 낭비 하고는!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "These won't fit together."
msgstr "안 맞아들겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY"
msgid "This might not be the best time..."
msgstr "그러기 좋은 때는 아닌 것 같은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "This is no time for cooking."
msgstr "요리하고 있을 때가 아냐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "I should've gotten here sooner."
msgstr "좀 더 빨리 왔어야 했는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "It's out of my reach."
msgstr "손이 닿지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT"
msgid "I can't. Someone left a hat there."
msgstr "안돼. 누가 저기다 모자를 놨어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's decorating it."
msgstr "누가 꾸미고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING"
msgid "Its time has run out."
msgstr "갈 때가 됐구만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH"
msgid "Nope. It's plenty tall."
msgstr "아니. 이 정도 높으면 족해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE"
msgid "That's right, it's dry. I'll try again later."
msgstr "그래, 마른 땅이네. 나중에 다시 해 보자고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "I'll have to be patient... just be patient... I can be patient!"
msgstr "참아야겠어... 참자... 참을 수 있다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "Could you hurry it up a little?"
msgstr "좀 서두를 수는 없어?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "Oh! I forgot to check if there was anything still inside."
msgstr "아! 안에 내용물 있는지를 확인 안 했네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE_POCKETWATCH.ONCOOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE_POCKETWATCH.ONCOOLDOWN"
msgid "It needs a bit of time to unwind."
msgstr "시간을 되돌리려면 시간이 좀 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED"
msgid "Missed! Bad timing..."
msgstr "놓쳤잖아! 타이밍 참..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "Hm. I can't quite remember what it looks like..."
msgstr "흠. 어떻게 생겨먹은 거였는지 잘 기억이 안 나네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "Whoops, almost gave the plants sea water!"
msgstr "이런, 하마터면 식물에 바닷물을 줄 뻔했네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "Ha! That would be like trying to use a pinion for a wheel!"
msgstr "하! 휠 자리에 피니언 다는 꼴 하고는!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC"
msgid "Next time I'll choose the right one."
msgstr "다음 번엔 올바른 걸 골라야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "I was hoping this timeline might be different."
msgstr "이쪽 시간선은 좀 다를 줄 알았는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "Please stop what you're doing, this is important!"
msgstr "하던 거 그만하고, 중요한 게 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "It's not coming back. Maybe this time that's a good thing?"
msgstr "살아나지를 않아. 이번엔 그래서 다행인 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "I'll just come back later. Or earlier."
msgstr "좀 나중에 와야겠어. 좀 전에 올 수도 있고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
msgid "It needs something that will fit into this small slot..."
msgstr "여기 이 작은 구멍에 들어갈 만한 게 필요한데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "Maybe in a different timeline..."
msgstr "다른 시간선에서나 해야지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "I'm having deja vu... didn't we already make this? Or will we..."
msgstr "데자뷰가 느껴지네... 이거 만든 거 아닌가? 만들 예정인가..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "Oh what luck, someone already made food ahead of time!"
msgstr "운도 참 좋지. 누가 미리 시간에 앞서서 음식을 만들었네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm, nope. That's not going to work."
msgstr "흠, 아니야. 소용 없을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "Oh. My mistake, I thought you were a friend of mine."
msgstr "이런, 실수. 내 친구인 줄 알았네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "I'll have to get one of those horrible logs..."
msgstr "그 무서운 통나무를 한 토막 가져와야겠네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "Whoops, almost put that in the mushroom planter."
msgstr "이런, 하마터면 버섯 재배기에 넣어버릴 뻔했네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "It won't grow here. I'm not wasting any more time on it."
msgstr "여기서는 자라지 않을 거야. 더는 여기에 시간 낭비하지 말아야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL"
msgid "Please. That would be like trying to put a pendulum on a watch."
msgstr "나 참. 이건 회중시계에 시계추 다는 격이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "This isn't going to work if I can't see the moon."
msgstr "달이 안 보이면 제대로 작동하지 못할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY"
msgid "Odd, I could have sworn I could speak monkey at some point."
msgstr "이상하네. 분명 어느 시점에 원숭이랑 대화를 할 수 있었는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY"
msgid "I need something that fits perfectly, or the mechanism won't work."
msgstr "딱 들어맞는 게 필요해. 그렇지 않으면 기계는 작동하지 않을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "Well... that was a waste of time."
msgstr "뭐... 시간 낭비였네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "Please. That would be like trying to put a pendulum on a watch."
msgstr "뭐하는 거야. 회중시계에 시계추 다는 것도 아니고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "I'm not wasting one more second trying to work with this material."
msgstr "이런 재료로 작업하겠다고 시간 쓰기는 1초도 아까워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "I need something that fits perfectly for the mechanism to work."
msgstr "정확하게 들어맞는 물건이 있어야 기계장치를 작동할 수가 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "I'm not putting my life in danger for a game!"
msgstr "게임에 목숨까지 걸기는 싫거든!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "It kind of reminds me of my old workshop... a pigsty."
msgstr "뭔가 옛날 작업실 생각나네... 완전 돼지우리였지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "It's getting dark. Maybe another time."
msgstr "날이 저물잖아. 다른 시간대에서 해야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY"
msgid "I don't care what her title is, it's no excuse to keep me waiting!"
msgstr "지위니 뭐니 상관 없고, 내가 왜 기다려야 하는 건데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Oooooh can't you sleep any faster?"
msgstr "으으으. 좀 더 빨리 잘 수는 없는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "I can't fit anything else in there."
msgstr "다른 건 못 넣겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT"
msgid "As whimsical as that would be, there isn't enough space in my pocket."
msgstr "엉뚱한 건 둘째치고, 주머니에 공간이 부족해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN"
msgid "It isn't ready yet? Botheration, even tiny trees take ages to grow!"
msgstr "아직 준비 안 됐나? 아이고야, 쬐끄만한 나무 한 그루마저 세월아 네월아네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE"
msgid "I wonder how the magic from this world might affect it?"
msgstr "이 세계의 마법이 이 물건에 어떤 영향을 미칠까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "I could've sworn this was the right gem."
msgstr "분명 맞는 보석 같았는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
msgid "Oooh, now this is a puzzle..."
msgstr "으으, 완전 뒤죽박죽이 됐네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "I don't have time to wait around!"
msgstr "기다릴 시간이 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "No, no, I'm doing this out of order!"
msgstr "안 돼, 안 돼, 엉망이야 엉망!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "If you want this, you'd better drop something fast."
msgstr "이거 가져가고 싶은 거면 빨리 물건 좀 내려놔 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "You couldn't sleep a little faster, could you?"
msgstr "좀 더 빨리 잘 수는 없는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "I don't have time to wait around!"
msgstr "기다릴 시간이 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "No, no, I'm doing this out of order!"
msgstr "안 돼, 안 돼, 엉망이야 엉망!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "If you want this, you'd better drop something fast."
msgstr "이거 가져가고 싶은 거면 빨리 물건 좀 내려놔 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "You couldn't sleep a little faster, could you?"
msgstr "좀 더 빨리 잘 수는 없는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE"
msgid "I'm pretty sure I've seen this before. Or maybe I will see it soon?"
msgstr "전에 봤던 게 분명한데. 나중에 볼 게 분명한 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER"
msgid "Fine then, keep your secrets to yourself!"
msgstr "됐어, 비밀을 숨기고 싶으면 숨기든가!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM"
msgid "This should buy those merms a little more time."
msgstr "이거면 저 어인들이 좀 더 오래 버티겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY"
msgid ""
"They have no interest in listening to me, and I have no interest in them."
msgstr "내 말엔 관심도 없네. 나도 쟤네들한테 관심 없지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED"
msgid "Wait, I already did that!"
msgstr "잠깐만, 이미 한 거잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD"
msgid "I don't have the patience to deal with a mean-tempered beefalo."
msgstr "내가 성질 나쁜 비팔로를 다룰 만큼 참을성 있는 사람은 아니라서."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF"
msgid "What am I forgetting? Something's ringing a bell..."
msgstr "내가 뭘 까먹는 거지? 뭔가 종 울리는 거였는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER"
msgid "Come on now, trot your way over here."
msgstr "어서, 빨리 이리로 와."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.1"
msgid "Ohhh botheration!!"
msgstr "아이고야 진짜!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.2"
msgid "Why can't this sail just lower properly when I tell it to?"
msgstr "돛도 참 그냥 곱게 내려오면 어디 덧나나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.3"
msgid "Ack! I think I pulled something in my back!"
msgstr "악! 이러다 등골 나가겠네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED"
msgid "Did I already pick this one? Yes, I'm pretty sure I did."
msgstr "내가 이미 이걸 골랐었나? 그래, 확실해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT"
msgid "I can join in later. Or maybe earlier."
msgstr "좀 나중에 해야지. 아니면 전에든."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE"
msgid "Oh botheration. I was going to use that, you know!"
msgstr "아이고 이런. 내가 쓰려고 했던 거란 말이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING"
msgid "Wake up! There are places to go, things to be done!"
msgstr "일어나! 어디 가서 할 일이 좀 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid ""
"I will not meet my end trampled beneath the hooves of an angry beefalo!"
msgstr "화난 비팔로 발굽에 짓밟혀 죽게 될 수는 없어서 말이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.CAVE"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOFULLMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOFULLMOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NONEWMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NONEWMOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOTNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOTNIGHT"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR"
msgid "Ha! That would be like trying to use a wheel for a pinion!"
msgstr "하! 피니언 자리에 휠 다는 꼴 하고는!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF"
msgid "It takes too long to cook a fancy meal."
msgstr "고급 음식은 시간이 너무 많이 든단 말이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr "흠."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE"
msgid "I forgot it would be empty."
msgstr "비어있을 수도 있단 걸 깜빡했네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK"
msgid "I knew it was stuck."
msgstr "안 빠질 줄 알았지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES"
msgid "It won't fool me this time."
msgstr "이번엔 절대 안 속아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE"
msgid "Please hurry up, I need that!"
msgstr "빨리빨리! 필요한 거라고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1"
msgid "Wait a minute... I don't remember my carrat looking like this."
msgstr "잠깐만... 내 당근이쥐는 이렇게 안 생겼던 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.2"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I grabbed the wrong carrat."
