msgid "How wonderfully efficient!"
msgstr "정말 놀라울 정도로 효율적이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING"
msgid "How wonderfully efficient!"
