#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
