msgstr "두려우면서도 아름다워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT"
