msgstr "네가 안 그리울 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
