msgstr "너한테 뭘 좀 만들어 줘야겠구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep well, petite oiseau."
msgstr "잘 자, 작은 새야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
