#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "Reduced to cinders."
msgstr "잿더미가 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "This odd training ground will suffice."
msgstr "이상하게 생겼지만 이 정도면 충분하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "Feel the warrior's spirit within you!"
msgstr "그대 안의 전사의 혼을 느껴라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "A trial of endurance."
msgstr "인내의 시련이로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "A waypoint to guide our vegetable beasts."
msgstr "우리의 풀짐승을 인도하는 거점이로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "A waypoint to guide our vegetable beasts."
msgstr "우리의 풀짐승을 인도하는 거점이로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Alas, it is no more."
msgstr "아아, 더는 없구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Who shall claim this noble victory?"
msgstr "누가 고귀한 승리를 거머쥐게 될 것인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "The day is won!"
msgstr "오늘의 승리를 쟁취했다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "{winner}'s vegetable champion has seized victory."
msgstr "{winner}의 야채 투사가 승리를 거머쥐었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "This shall mark the race's end point."
msgstr "이로 하여금 경주의 끝을 표시하리라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "We shall see which vegetable beast prevails!"
msgstr "어느 풀짐승이 이기게 될지 목도하세!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "The race cannot commence without it!"
msgstr "이것이 없이는 경주를 시작할 수가 없지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Naught but ash."
msgstr "그저 재일 뿐이로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "You are not yet ready!"
msgstr "넌 아직 준비가 되지 않았다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "This beast will serve me well in the coming battle."
msgstr "다가오는 전투에서 나를 잘 따를 수 있으리라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "We shall see just how strong my veggie beast truly is."
msgstr "나의 풀짐승의 진정한 힘을 보리라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "It's time to put my veggie beast to the test."
msgstr "나의 풀짐승을 시험할 때가 왔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "I care not for growing vegetables."
msgstr "난 채소를 기르는 데에 관심이 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "The rarity of these non-meats doth not impress me."
msgstr "고기가 아닌 이상 그 귀함은 나에게 아무 상관이 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "May it grip the sea floor with all its strength."
msgstr "전력으로 해저를 붙잡을 수 있기를."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "I will craft the finest ship in the land!"
msgstr "세상에서 가장 뛰어난 배를 지으리라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It is done."
msgstr "모두 끝이로구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It demands an offering of charcoal."
msgstr "숯을 바치기를 원하는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "A shrine to a fearsome firey beast."
msgstr "무시무시한 불의 짐승에게 바치는 사당이로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "I will swipe at the waves with the ferocity of a dragon!"
msgstr "용의 위엄으로 파도를 가르리라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Great dragon, steer me to victory!"
msgstr "위대한 용이여, 승리로 인도해다오!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "A vital piece of a glorious vessel."
msgstr "배에서 이보다 중요한 부품은 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "A fine chance for the younglings to learn the saddle!"
msgstr "아이들을 안장에 익숙해지게 할 절호의 기회로다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "The helm of a dauntless stallion."
msgstr "불굴의 종마의 투구로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "A shame."
msgstr "안타까운 일이로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What tribute dost thou demand?"
msgstr "어떤 공물을 원하는 것인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Doth this not sate thee?"
msgstr "이것이라면 만족하겠는가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "A swift charger to ride into battle."
msgstr "전장으로 빠르게 돌격할 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "This weapon was wielded by a revered warrior class."
msgstr "이 무기는 본래 존경받는 전사 계층이 사용하던 것이었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "A meaty feast!"
msgstr "고기 요리 만찬이로군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "'Tis fit only for the beasts."
msgstr "오직 짐승에게나 어울리는 음식이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "I shall consume it!"
msgstr "기꺼이 취하겠노라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "Let us feast by the rabbit's torchlight!"
msgstr "토끼의 등불로 연회를 여세!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "Its light burns no more."
msgstr "더는 타지 않는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "Let us set the rabbit torch alight!"
msgstr "토끼 등불에 불을 붙여라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "Let us feast by the rabbit's torchlight!"
msgstr "토끼의 등불로 연회를 여세!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "Its light burns no more."
msgstr "더는 타지 않는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "Let us set the rabbit torch alight!"
msgstr "토끼 등불에 불을 붙여라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Who will face me in the field of battle?"
msgstr "전장에서 내게 대적할 자 누구더냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "There art a battle underway!"
msgstr "전투가 진행 중이로군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "A test of might and bravery!"
msgstr "힘과 용맹의 시험이로다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "Bah! 'Tis naught but a meat-shaped veggie cake!"
msgstr "으윽! 고기의 모양을 한 채소 케이크가 아니더냐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "I do not trust whatever lies within."
msgstr "저 안에 채워진 것이 미심쩍군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "A delicious sight indeed!"
msgstr "참으로 맛있어 보이는 외형이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "A trio of tasty morsels."
msgstr "맛있는 조각이 셋이 엮였구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It must have displeased the gods."
msgstr "필시 신들을 노케 한 것이리라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What should be sacrificed to the beast's maw?"
msgstr "짐승의 아귀에 무엇을 바쳐야 하리오?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The rabbit seems pleased with my offering."
msgstr "토끼가 나의 공물에 기뻐하는 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "Who dares to face me in the ring?"
msgstr "누가 감히 나를 상대하려 들 것이느냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Must the gods taketh everything?"
msgstr "신들이시여, 전부 가져가셔야 했나이까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope she'll hold."
msgstr "잘 서 있었으면 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "Prepare thyself, for revelry doth await."
msgstr "어서 준비하라, 축제가 기다리니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "The shrine itself offered to the implacable gods!"
msgstr "신들께서 노여움을 거두지 않아 사당 자체가 바쳐졌구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "The worm doth demand a worthy sacrifice."
msgstr "벌레가 알맞은 공물을 요구하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The worm hath been appeased."
msgstr "벌레가 만족해하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
msgid "I shall send thee back to the depths, worm!"
msgstr "네놈을 다시 심연으로 돌려보내주마, 벌레야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It seems someone offered it a flame. I do not think it liked it."
msgstr "누군가 불을 바치려 했던 모양이군. 달가워하지 않았으리라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Perhaps it would enjoy a feather?"
msgstr "혹 깃털을 받으면 좋아할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Let the festive crafting commence!"
msgstr "축제를 위한 공예를 시작하세!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "It is an artifact of this realm."
msgstr "이 세계의 어떤 유물이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "The foul plant thrives."
msgstr "역겨운 식물이 번창하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "Something hinders its growth."
msgstr "무언가에 성장을 방해받고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "Perhaps it needs the company of its kin."
msgstr "동족의 동료가 필요한 모양이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid ""
"The feeble thing needs conversation to grow? Vikings thrive in stoic "
"silence!"
msgstr "대화가 있어야만 자랄 만큼 연약하다니, 바이킹은 금욕의 침묵 속에서도 잘 자라거늘!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "It seems to harbor resentment for its weed brethren."
msgstr "잡초 형제에게 분개심을 품고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "It thirsts for water."
msgstr "갈증을 느끼는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "You are unhappy with the dirt you have? Do not look to me to help you!"
msgstr "뿌리내린 흙에 만족하지 못하느냐? 도움 따위 바라지 마라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "This small patch of dirt cannot sustain all these non-meats."
msgstr "이 작은 땅덩이로는 이 모든 비육류를 감당할 수 없노라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "It doesn't have what it takes to brave the seasonal elements."
msgstr "이 계절의 풍랑을 버텨낼 능력이 없노라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "It is beset by multiple afflictions."
msgstr "수많은 이유로 고통받는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Flames will soon consume it."
msgstr "화염이 집어삼키려 하는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "Too dark, even for battle."
msgstr "싸울 수도 없는 칠흑이로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "Bones and all."
msgstr "뼈째 삼켜 버렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "It doth taste just like chicken!"
msgstr "닭고기 맛이 나는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "The god of the sky has been angered!"
msgstr "하늘의 신이 노하셨다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "Alas! If I'd only grabbed it sooner."
msgstr "아뿔싸! 더 일찍 확인했더라면 좋았을 것을."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "T'were not meant to be a meal."
msgstr "음식이 될 만한 것이 아니었구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "We shall live to fight another day!"
msgstr "우리는 굴하지 않고 살아남으리라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE"
msgid "I thought I saw that feathered charlatan around here..."
msgstr "그 허풍선이 놈이 여기 어디 있었던 것 같은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN"
msgid "It's vacant."
msgstr "비었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
msgid "Apparently he has more pressing matters to attend to."
msgstr "훨씬 중요한 일이 있는 게 분명하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "It seems we are lacking in participants."
msgstr "참가자가 부족한 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "This environment is not suitable for a fair game."
msgstr "이런 환경에서는 공정한 게임을 하기 어렵지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid "Playtime is over for now."
msgstr "일단 놀이 시간은 끝났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I shall have to find the key."
msgstr "열쇠를 찾아야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "No, that would be ridiculous."
msgstr "아냐, 우스꽝스러울 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "Finally. It looks like the birds have dispersed."
msgstr "이제서야 새들이 다 가 버렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "Robot junk."
msgstr "로봇 녀석 고철이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
msgid "Isn't that a job for the little toad?"
msgstr "그 두꺼비 꼬맹이가 할 일 아닌가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE"
