msgstr "시간날 때 말해주게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "The dead have no need of such things."
msgstr "죽은 사람에게 그런 건 필요하지 않겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "No sense giving them more than they can carry."
msgstr "들 수 있는 것보다 더 주는 건 말도 안 되지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Err... I'll let you rest."
msgstr "으음... 쉬게 두겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE"
msgid "That can already be made here."
msgstr "이미 만들 수 있는 거였군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER"
