msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE"
msgid "Not particularly creative."
msgstr "그닥 창의적이지는 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS"
msgid "Ah, now that might be interesting."
msgstr "아, 꽤나 흥미롭군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP"
msgid "Must he leave that lying around? I nearly ruined my shoes."
msgstr "꼭 이렇게 아무 데나 둬야겠냐고. 신발을 더럽힐 뻔했잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE"
