msgid "Ah, now that might be interesting."
msgstr "아, 꽤나 흥미롭군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT"
msgid "He'll shoot his eye out if he's not careful."
msgstr "이 녀석, 잘못해서 자기 눈이나 안 쏘면 다행이겠군."

