msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_STACKSIZE"
msgid "That robot needs to pull themselves together."
msgstr "저 로봇 녀석 자제 좀 해야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_TASER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_TASER"
msgid "That robot needs to pull themselves together."
msgstr "저 로봇 녀석 자제 좀 해야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC"
msgid "WX! Someone could stub their toe on you!"
msgstr "WX! 누구 발가락 부러지는 꼴 보고 싶은 겐가!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY"
msgid "Nice trash hauler."
msgstr "멋진 쓰레기 운반기군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT"
msgid "Oh, get lost already!"
msgstr "오, 좀 저리 가!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP"
msgid "I've got my eye on you!"
msgstr "계속 지켜보겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC"
msgid "I didn't want to play with it anyway."
msgstr "어차피 가지고 놀고 싶지도 않았어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC"
msgid "Not that I'd want to, but it's too dry to eat."
msgstr "먹고 싶지는 않지만, 먹기엔 너무 건조하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET"
msgid "Of all the things I've eaten here, this takes the cake."
msgstr "이곳에 와서 먹어본 것 중에 제일 어처구니없는 물건이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER"
msgid "I hope that's not what I think it is."
msgstr "내가 생각하는 그건 아니었으면 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC"
msgid "What do you mean it held more than my hat?!"
msgstr "내 모자보다도 더 많이 담을 수가 있었다고?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER"
msgid "Nerves of steel, that one."
msgstr "녀석 참 거리낌이 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY"
msgid "Stay back, you abomination!"
msgstr "저리 가라, 이 흉물!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC"
msgid "I feel like it's watching me..."
msgstr "날 감시하는 것 같군..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING"
msgid "Where does it think it's going?"
msgstr "어딜 가려는 생각인 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING"
msgid "Hmph. Good luck unraveling the mysteries of my creations."
msgstr "흥. 어디 내 피조물의 수수께끼를 잘 파헤쳐 보시든가."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM"
msgid "Something about it is just so temptingly kickable."
msgstr "너무 발로 차고 싶게 생겼군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED"
msgid "That constant blinking light is testing my patience."
msgstr "불빛 깜빡거리는 게 인내심 시험하게 만드는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER"
msgid "The little watcher is powered by a familiar source."
msgstr "저 작은 관찰자의 동력원은 익숙한 그것이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER"
msgid "That robot applies forces indiscriminately to take what it wants."
msgstr "저 로봇 녀석은 원하는 것을 가지기 위해서라면 무차별적으로 힘을 쓰는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO"
msgid "It makes me uncomfortable."
msgstr "뭔가 거북해지는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "This will make me stand out."
msgstr "이게 있으면 돋보이겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "I can sense magic in it."
msgstr "이 안의 마력이 느껴져."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "A conveniently color-coded place marker."
msgstr "알아보기 쉽도록 색깔로 분류하는 장소 표식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "With a bigger gem it would be so much more powerful."
msgstr "보석이 클수록 훨씬 더 강력한 법이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Pity."
msgstr "불쌍하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It will require an offering."
msgstr "공물이 필요하겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's get on with it then."
msgstr "그럼 어디 보지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "I've no need for such things."
msgstr "난 이런 거 필요 없다네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB"
msgid "This might be of interest to the judge."
msgstr "심사위원 녀석이 흥미를 보일 수도 있겠군."

