msgid "Not very friendly."
msgstr "별로 좋은 애는 아냐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "It looks warm in there."
msgstr "안은 따뜻해 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN"
msgid "It's our little onion friend!"
msgstr "우리 작은 양파 친구야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "She's a monster just like me!"
msgstr "나랑 똑같은 괴물이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "They're really good at hide and seek!"
msgstr "숨바꼭질을 엄청 잘해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "He gives the fuzziest hugs."
msgstr "안으면 아주 포근해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "You look like grandpa's cat!"
msgstr "너 할아버지네 고양이처럼 생겼다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "Father taught me how to take care of goats!"
msgstr "아빠가 염소를 어떻게 키우는지 알려줬었어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING"
msgid "A spider and an insect, what a pair!"
msgstr "거미와 곤충이라니, 끝내주는 조합이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "Gobble gobble!"
msgstr "호롤롤로!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "We're best friends."
msgstr "우리는 최고의 친구야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh, you look like you're having a grand time, flying about."
msgstr "와, 너 나는 거 되게 재밌어 보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "We all want a bit of freedom."
msgstr "다들 조금은 자유로워지고 싶어해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "That gingerbread guy has been here."
msgstr "그 생강과자 녀석이 여기 있었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "Maybe it's a monkey friendship bracelet?"
msgstr "원숭이들의 우정 팔찌 같은 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "We should be able to weave this, too."
msgstr "우리라면 이것도 엮을 수 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "Does anyone wanna play pirates with us?"
msgstr "누구 우리랑 해적 놀이 할 사람?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "I like me a lichen."
msgstr "난 내 이끼가 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Reeds, web, what's the difference."
msgstr "갈대랑 거미줄이랑 다를 거 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Squared rocks."
msgstr "네모난 돌이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey! We were just trying to help!!"
msgstr "야! 도와주려는데 왜 그래!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "He doesn't look like a normal pig. Or even a normal werepig."
msgstr "평범한 돼지 같지는 않아. 평범한 늑대돼지 같지도 않고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "Oh. That's why we don't play in the big junk pile."
msgstr "에구. 저래서 커다란 고철더미 속에서 놀면 안 돼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "Does he want to play with us?"
msgstr "우리랑 놀고 싶은 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "We don't think he's playing."
msgstr "놀자고 하는 건 아닌 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "We can't break through it!"
msgstr "부술 수가 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "We feel bad just leaving him like that..."
msgstr "저렇게 두려니 불쌍해..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "Scent of doom."
msgstr "파멸의 향기가 나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "Yuck! Dead stuff."
msgstr "웩! 죽은 거잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "What a senseless waste of firewood."
msgstr "어쩜 이렇게 장작을 낭비할 수가 있담."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "Only we can prevent forest fires."
msgstr "오직 우리만이 산불을 예방할 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Would a cool bandage make it better, Mr. Tree?"
msgstr "멋진 붕대면 괜찮아질까요, 나무 아저씨?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "My, what nice foliage you have."
msgstr "이런, 정말 멋진 잎을 가졌구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "What're you so mad about?"
msgstr "너 왜 그렇게 화난 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "We know many games!"
msgstr "우리 게임 많이 알아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "Is it a toy for us?"
msgstr "이거 우리 장난감인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "Reminds me of antique shopping with mother."
msgstr "엄마랑 골동품점에 갔던 기억이 나네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "Nice and bright!"
msgstr "밝고 예뻐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "We like it!"
msgstr "마음에 들어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It's gonna go out soon."
msgstr "곧 꺼지겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "They look sad."
msgstr "슬퍼 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "It's so bright for our eyes."
msgstr "우리 눈엔 엄청 밝아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "We can paint better."
msgstr "우리가 더 예쁘게 그릴 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "We don't feel like painting right now."
msgstr "지금은 그림이 아닌 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "Are we handsome?"
msgstr "우리 멋지지 않아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Did you change your hair? Looks good!"
msgstr "너 머리 모양 바꿨니? 잘생겼네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks soft."
msgstr "부드러워 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "He might be able to digest me!"
msgstr "어쩌면 나도 소화당할지 몰라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "We guess it's better this way."
msgstr "이게 나은 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looking at it makes us feel kind of sad."
msgstr "뭔가 괜히 불쌍하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "T-that's not good!"
msgstr "뭐-뭔가 불길해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Brrr, we don't like it chilly."
msgstr "으드드, 차가워서 싫어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "Aww, we have eight eyes and it doesn't even have one."
msgstr "에구, 우린 눈이 여덟 개인데 얘는 하나도 없네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "We have many eyes and arms to build this!"
msgstr "우린 눈과 팔이 많아서 금방 만든다구!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "Yucktastic."
msgstr "어우 역해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "Haha, weird."
msgstr "하하, 이상해라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "Don't hurt us and we won't hurt you!"
msgstr "우리를 해치지 않으면 널 해치지 않을게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It was once grass."
msgstr "원래는 풀이었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "It covers our biggest eyes, anyway."
msgstr "그래도 제일 큰 눈 두 개는 가려주니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT"
msgid "It keeps our fur from getting too wet."
msgstr "우리 털이 푹 젖지 않게 해 줘."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED"
msgid "You can't get us, water!"
msgstr "닿을 테면 닿아보렴, 물아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL"
msgid "Axe me a question!"
msgstr "질문 한 번 찍어봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV"
msgid "I can't wield that."
msgstr "난 휘두를 수 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "A pile of dirt. I bet it's hiding something."
msgstr "흙더미야. 뭔가 숨기고 있을지도 몰라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "Nothing nearby."
msgstr "근처에 아무것도 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "Lead and I shall follow."
msgstr "이끌어 주면 내가 따라갈게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "We are close!"
msgstr "가까워졌어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "Going the right way."
msgstr "바른 길로 가고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Something must be near."
msgstr "분명 근처에 뭔가 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a mystery."
msgstr "신비로워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "Looks like there's a hole for an oversized key."
msgstr "여기에 엄청 큰 열쇠에 맞는 구멍이 있는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "It's ready to go."
msgstr "갈 준비가 됐어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "Radical rod!"
msgstr "그냥 막대야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT"
msgid "We've decided we're going to be a dock spider now."
msgstr "우린 이제 물거미가 되기로 했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM"
msgid "We almost forgot the posts!"
msgstr "기둥을 잊을 뻔했네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "So many ruffles..."
msgstr "주름 장식이 너무 많아..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT"
msgid "We can help build it!"
msgstr "우리가 도울 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK"
msgid "It's got everything a boat needs!"
msgstr "배에 필요한 게 전부 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "I'm not sure I want to be in *another* belly."
msgstr "난 *뱃속의 뱃속*에 있기는 싫은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD"
msgid "Okay, we'll eat a salad."
msgstr "좋아, 샐러드를 먹자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "Oh, don't you just drag on."
msgstr "아, 용 쓰지 좀 말아줄래."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks like my old toy chest!"
msgstr "내 옛날 장난감 상자를 닮았어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "It's way bigger and better than my old toy chest!"
msgstr "내 옛날 장난감 상자보다 훨씬 크고 훨씬 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a fancy furnace!"
msgstr "화려한 화덕이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "What happened to your face?"
msgstr "네 얼굴에 무슨 일이 있었던 거니?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "Hot hot furnace!"
msgstr "뜨겁디 뜨거운 화덕이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "Warmish furnace."
msgstr "따스한 화덕이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "It looks suspect."
msgstr "의심스러워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "It looks tastier now."
msgstr "이제 더 맛있어 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Extra big and extra tasty."
msgstr "훨씬 크고 훨씬 맛있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "We could grow something with these."
msgstr "이걸로 뭔가를 기를 수 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "The front part's sort of scary."
msgstr "이거 앞 부분이 뭔가 무서운데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "Oh! Sweet and tasty!!"
msgstr "우와! 달고 맛있어!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "We like the tail!"
msgstr "우린 꼬리가 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "They don't weigh much for scales."
msgstr "비늘 무게는 비교적 크지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE"
msgid "We're not sure if we like that rock."
msgstr "저 돌 괜찮은 건지 잘 모르겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT"
msgid "A pointy helmet to match our pointy teeth!"
msgstr "우리 이빨처럼 뾰족한 투구야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK"
msgid "More of that scary rock..."
msgstr "그 무서운 돌이 더 있네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG"
msgid "Easy piece-y."
msgstr "누워서 떡 '목'었네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's getting all burned up!"
msgstr "활활 타고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "All burned up."
msgstr "다 타 버렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Chopped all up."
msgstr "다 잘려나갔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "They're fun to climb on."
msgstr "타고 오르기 재미있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "I just want to bang on my drum."
msgstr "그냥 북이나 실컷 두들기고 싶어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "We love finger food."
msgstr "우린 들고 뜯는 게 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH"
msgid "We didn't know bananas could grow outside!"
msgstr "바나나가 밖에서도 자랄 줄은 몰랐어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "Into the ground with you!"
msgstr "땅으로 보내줄게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "Into the ground with you!"
msgstr "땅으로 보내줄게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "Into the ground with you!"
msgstr "땅으로 보내줄게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "Into the ground with you!"
msgstr "땅으로 보내줄게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "Fuzzy!"
msgstr "보송보송해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "Into the ground with you!"
msgstr "땅으로 보내줄게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH"
msgid "Now nobody will hurt themselves on it."
msgstr "이제 아무도 밟고 다치지 않겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL"
msgid "It looks so easy when Mr. Wolfgang does it..."
msgstr "볼프강 아저씨가 할 때는 되게 쉬워 보였는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM"
msgid "Oh! It's so cold!"
msgstr "와! 엄청 차가워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM"
msgid "It looks so easy when Mr. Wolfgang does it..."
msgstr "볼프강 아저씨가 할 때는 되게 쉬워 보였는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN"
msgid "It looks so easy when Mr. Wolfgang does it..."
msgstr "볼프강 아저씨가 할 때는 되게 쉬워 보였는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT"
msgid "Mr. Wolfgang says it's for warming up."
msgstr "볼프강 아저씨 말로는 몸 데우는 용도래."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE"
msgid "It looks so easy when Mr. Wolfgang does it..."
msgstr "볼프강 아저씨가 할 때는 되게 쉬워 보였는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM"
msgid "Ouch! It's hot!"
msgstr "아잇! 뜨거워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "Pungent."
msgstr "고약하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "No sir, I don't like it."
msgstr "아니요, 전 이거 싫어요."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Eww... it has a bigger stink too."
msgstr "으으... 크기만큼이나 냄새도 더 심해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "We could grow something with these."
msgstr "이걸로 뭔가를 기를 수 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE"
msgid "It doesn't taste as good as it looks."
msgstr "생긴 거랑 맛이 딴판이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH"
msgid "Maybe it will help us tidy our things if we ask nicely."
msgstr "공손하게 부탁하면 우리가 정돈하는 걸 도와줄 지도 몰라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN"
msgid "We never kept our room this clean."
msgstr "우린 이렇게 방을 깨끗하게 치운 적은 없었는데 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "Strap some rabbits to your head, good idea."
msgstr "토끼를 머리에 두른다니, 좋은 생각이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "Fresh water-snake."
msgstr "신선한 뱀물고기야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "We could slurp this down."
msgstr "후루룩 먹을 수 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "Blech, eggplant."
msgstr "우웩, 가지잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "Mum knew I liked it braised."
msgstr "엄마는 가지는 튀겨야 맛있는 걸 아셨어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It's either extra eggy or extra planty."
msgstr "훨씬 둥글고 훨씬 풀 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "We could grow something with these."
msgstr "이걸로 뭔가를 기를 수 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER"
msgid "Will Abigail mind if we try some?"
msgstr "아비게일이 우리가 마셔봐도 괜찮다 할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT"
msgid "We like it warm and toasty!"
msgstr "따끈따끈해서 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Antiques are dumb, anyway."
msgstr "아무튼 골동품은 멍청해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Reminds me of antique shopping with mother."
msgstr "엄마랑 골동품점에 갔던 기억이 나네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "Nice and bright!"
msgstr "밝고 예뻐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks great!"
msgstr "멋지네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It's gonna go out soon."
msgstr "곧 꺼지겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "They look sad."
msgstr "슬퍼 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "What a senseless waste of firewood."
msgstr "어쩜 이렇게 장작을 낭비할 수가 있담."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "Only we can prevent forest fires."
msgstr "오직 우리만이 산불을 예방할 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "Would a cool bandage make it better, Mr. Tree?"
msgstr "멋진 붕대면 괜찮아질까요, 나무 아저씨?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Pines are always greener on the other side of the fence."
msgstr "늘 남의 소나무가 더 예쁜 법이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "What a senseless waste of firewood."
msgstr "어쩜 이렇게 장작을 낭비할 수가 있담."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "Only we can prevent forest fires."
msgstr "오직 우리만이 산불을 예방할 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Would a cool bandage make it better, Mr. Tree?"
msgstr "멋진 붕대면 괜찮아질까요, 나무 아저씨?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "A dying breed."
msgstr "죽어가는 품종이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "Disturbing, but it'll keep us dry."
msgstr "거추장스럽지만, 적어도 젖지 않게는 해 주니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "We have even MORE eyes and teeth!"
msgstr "눈과 이빨이 더 많이 생겼어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "We don't like the look of that..."
msgstr "생긴 게 맘에 안 들어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "We're not usually so bothered by a few extra eyes."
msgstr "보통은 눈이 좀 많다고 걱정은 안 하긴 하는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "A baby eye is about to be born."
msgstr "아기 눈이 태어나려 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "Ever vigilant."
msgstr "항상 지켜보고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "Stop looking at me!"
msgstr "나 좀 그만 쳐다봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "Wakey wakey!"
msgstr "기상 기상!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "A razed farm is no farm at all."
msgstr "갈아엎은 밭은 밭이 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "I'll have a go at this farming thing."
msgstr "여기다 농사를 지어야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "C'mooon, plants!"
msgstr "쑥쑥 크렴, 식물들아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "The soil is dried up."
msgstr "흙이 말랐어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "We need that to plant the seeds."
msgstr "씨앗을 심으려면 이런 게 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "That probably isn't good for it."
msgstr "저런 건 식물한테 안 좋을 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "Yay, it's ready to be picked!"
msgstr "야호, 이제 딸 준비가 됐어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Wow, look how big it got!"
msgstr "우와, 너 엄청 크다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "Hey, you're not a fruit or a veggie!"
msgstr "야, 넌 과일도 야채도 아니잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a plant!"
msgstr "식물이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "It'll be big in no time!"
msgstr "금방 커질 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "Uh oh... we probably should've picked it earlier."
msgstr "이런... 좀 더 일찍 땄어야 했던 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Blech, no thank you."
msgstr "우웩, 사양할게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "Grow seed, grow!"
msgstr "자라라 씨앗아, 자라라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "Yay! We're making a garden!"
msgstr "야호! 텃밭을 만들자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "We'll find a good spot for the garden."
msgstr "우린 좋은 텃밭 자리를 찾을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "We should clean that up."
msgstr "저걸 치워야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "This thing is huge!"
msgstr "이거 엄청 크다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "It looks like it took a whole flock to make that hat!"
msgstr "모자 하나 만드는 데에 새 한 무리는 필요했을 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "Haha! It tickles!"
msgstr "하하! 간지러워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "Feather of yellow."
msgstr "노란 깃털이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "Feather of black."
msgstr "검은 깃털이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "Feather of red."
msgstr "붉은 깃털이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "Feather of white."
msgstr "흰 깃털이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "She's locked up!"
msgstr "갇혀 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "I don't think we can jump over that."
msgstr "우린 뛰어넘을 수 없을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC"
msgid "It's not doing anything!"
msgstr "하나도 작동이 안 돼!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED"
msgid "We're not afraid of zaps."
msgstr "우린 감전되는 거 안 무서워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM"
msgid "Where should we put it?"
msgstr "어디다 놓아야 할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "The hinges are a little squeaky."
msgstr "경첩 부분이 약간 삐걱거려."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "Let's build a gate!"
msgstr "문을 만들자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "Let's build a fence!"
msgstr "울타리를 만들자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "It's not the nicest-looking fence."
msgstr "별로 멋진 울타리는 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "We're allowed to hit fence posts with it, just not too hard."
msgstr "이걸로 울타리를 쳐도 된댔어. 너무 세게는 말고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "I saw mum use this in her gardens."
msgstr "엄마가 텃밭에서 이런 걸 쓰는 걸 본 적 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "Mmm, tasty!"
msgstr "으음, 맛있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "This is going to be so much fun!"
msgstr "이거 엄청 재밌겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "This fruit is kinda weird, but tasty!"
msgstr "이상하게 생긴 과일이야. 맛은 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "We've never had sweet pasta before!"
msgstr "달콤한 파스타라니 우린 처음 먹어봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "We like to play swords with the stick when we're done."
msgstr "다 먹고 나면 이걸로 칼싸움할래."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "Now it's hot fruit."
msgstr "과일이 이젠 데워졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "It hurts people with magic."
msgstr "사람을 해치는 마법이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "Don't worry Ms. Wicker, we'll be careful."
msgstr "걱정하지 마세요, 위커 선생님. 조심할게요."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "Elusive little buggies."
msgstr "찾기 힘든 작은 벌레야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "Going on an adventure, got some fireflies in our pocket!"
msgstr "모험을 떠날 채비로 반딧불이를 좀 잡아다 뒀어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "He's got a fire under his feet. And all inside him."
msgstr "발등에 불 떨어졌네. 뱃속에도 불 떨어졌고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "A bad, stinging weed."
msgstr "막 쏘는 나쁜 풀이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED"
msgid "Did we pick these?"
msgstr "우리가 이걸 땄었던가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "How dangerous could a pen really be?"
msgstr "펜이 위험하면 얼마나 위험하겠어?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "We should put something on the fire before it goes out."
msgstr "불이 꺼지기 전에 뭔가 넣어야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure beats the cold. And darkness."
msgstr "확실히 덜 추워. 덜 어둡고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "That fire is huge!"
msgstr "불이 엄청 커!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "The fire's getting a touch low."
msgstr "불이 너무 약해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and warm."
msgstr "따뜻하고 편안해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "Well, that's done. But not forever!"
msgstr "뭐, 끝났네. 영원히는 아니지만!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "We didn't start the fire."
msgstr "우리가 불 놓은 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Running low on fuel."
msgstr "연료가 떨어지고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "It's off."
msgstr "꺼져 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "This would come in handy in a snowball fight."
msgstr "이거 눈싸움 할 때 좋을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "It could stand to be fried."
msgstr "튀김하면 되겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "Maybe we'll catch some antchovies!"
msgstr "어쩌면 멸구치 몇 마리 잡을 수 있을 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "I miss grandpa's fishing trips."
msgstr "할아버지랑 낚시 여행 가던 게 그리워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "It would probably be better cooked."
msgstr "아마 요리하는 게 좋을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Mmm, delicious!"
msgstr "으음, 맛있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "All the juice has been sucked out of it."
msgstr "물기를 쫙 짜냈어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "It's a little fishy."
msgstr "좀 비릿한데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "Boney."
msgstr "가시투성이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED"
msgid "It's really chewy, but we don't mind!"
msgstr "좀 질기긴 한데 우리한텐 괜찮아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "One of my favorite foods! Just me though."
msgstr "내가 좋아하는 음식이야! '나'만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Taco Tuesday!"
msgstr "화요일은 타코 먹는 날!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "It's like an aquarium! Except we eat the fish..."
msgstr "마치 수족관 같아! 우리가 물고기를 먹는다는 점을 빼면 말이야..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Flaky and moist. Delicious."
msgstr "촉촉하고 꼬들꼬들해. 맛있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "Oh, to feel a sharp edge against my skin."
msgstr "와, 내 피부에까지 날카로운 모서리가 느껴져."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED"
msgid "Aww!"
msgstr "히잉!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC"
msgid "Wheeee!"
msgstr "슈우우웅!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD"
msgid "We have something fun!"
msgstr "재미있는 게 생겼어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "Promise we won't splash..."
msgstr "물장구 안 치기로 약속..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "We agree that flowers are nice."
msgstr "꽃이 예쁘다는 건 우리도 동감이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Bright red petals! We love it!"
msgstr "밝은 빨간색 꽃잎이야! 우리도 좋아해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "Colorful crown."
msgstr "화려한 왕관이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "Five servings a day."
msgstr "하루에 5인분 먹자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "Oooh, a glowing ball of flower!"
msgstr "우와아, 빛나는 공 모양 꽃이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED"
msgid "It's not glowing much."
msgstr "별로 빛나지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "This flower is decidedly not nice!"
msgstr "이 꽃은 완전 별로야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "Aww so sad!"
msgstr "아아, 너무 슬퍼!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "Soft and leafy."
msgstr "부드러운 잎이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED"
msgid "Did we pick these?"
msgstr "우리가 이걸 땄었던가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "We could be good at football, much better than I was!"
msgstr "우리라면 내가 예전에 하던 것보다 풋볼을 더 잘 할 수도 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "This one has pretty flowers."
msgstr "참 예쁜 꽃이 달렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED"
msgid "Did we pick these?"
msgstr "우리가 이걸 땄었던가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Our beefalo might look even more dapper than Maxwell!"
msgstr "우리 비팔로가 맥스웰 아저씨보다 훨씬 말끔하게 차려입을 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "We want to play archaeologist!"
msgstr "우리 발굴 놀이 하고 싶어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "That looks real good!"
msgstr "정말 멋지다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "Maybe we shouldn't play with bones."
msgstr "아무래도 우린 뼈다귀 가지고 놀면 안 되겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Needs more bones!"
msgstr "뼈가 더 필요해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES"
msgid "Cripes! We can't wait for these crepes!"
msgstr "세상에나! 빨리 크레페 먹고 싶어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY"
msgid "This one's nice!"
msgstr "얘는 착하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "A hop too far."
msgstr "너무 멀리 뛰었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "Ack! Sticky tongue!"
msgstr "으악! 혀가 끈적끈적해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "Oblivious amphibious."
msgstr "두서 없는 양서류야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL"
msgid "Thanks Warly!"
msgstr "고마워요 왈리 아저씨!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "Sandwich for me, frog legs for him."
msgstr "샌드위치는 내가 먹고, 개구리 다리는 얘가 먹고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "A fraction of a frog."
msgstr "개구리의 일부분이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "I admit, we've acquired a taste for those."
msgstr "나도 인정, 우리 입맛에 좀 맞는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON"
msgid "Something we both like!"
msgstr "우리 둘 다 좋아하는 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI"
msgid "We can pretend it's a milkshake!"
msgstr "밀크셰이크라고 생각하고 먹자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "It smells like yummy fruit."
msgstr "맛난 과일 냄새가 나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "It looks kinda yummy."
msgstr "좀 맛있어 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Night night!"
msgstr "잘 자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY"
msgid "Stop messing up our garden!"
msgstr "내 밭 망치지 마!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT"
msgid "Now the Fruit Flies listen to us!"
msgstr "이제 초파리가 우리 말을 들어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "Pile o'fruit."
msgstr "과일 모아둔 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Fluffy, and not from a spider."
msgstr "폭신한데 거미에게서 나온 건 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING"
msgid "Ouchie! It bites!"
msgstr "아야! 막 깨물잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB"
msgid "You're not one of our spider friends!"
msgstr "넌 거미 친구 아냐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "Haha. We can stack things on its head and it won't even move."
msgstr "하하. 머리 위에 뭘 쌓아둬도 안 움직이겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "Yikes."
msgstr "으익."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "Maxwell says you ward monsters away with it."
msgstr "맥스웰 아저씨 말론 이게 있으면 괴물을 쫓아낼 수 있대."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "It didn't ward us off!"
msgstr "우릴 쫓아내진 않았네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What do we do with all this garlic?"
msgstr "저 많은 마늘로 뭘 하지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "We can find out what they are by planting them."
msgstr "심어보면 어떤 종류인지 알 수 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "I don't wanna eat it, but Warly was nice to make it for us."
msgstr "난 먹기 싫지만, 왈리 아저씨가 우릴 생각해서 만들어 주셨으니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "WX eats them by the fistful!"
msgstr "WX가 이걸 한 주먹씩 먹던데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC"
msgid "Can we play with it?"
msgstr "어울려 놀아도 되는 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER"
msgid "Are you stuck?"
msgstr "갇힌 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "There's a prize inside!"
msgstr "안에 보물이 들어 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE"
msgid "It's sticky like our webs!"
msgstr "우리 거미줄처럼 끈적거려!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL"
msgid "Yummy!"
msgstr "맛있겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like jelly."
msgstr "젤리 같이 생겼어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT"
msgid "We can build it!"
msgstr "우리가 만들 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "Looks empty."
msgstr "비어있는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "Looks good."
msgstr "보기 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "We really hope it wasn't just sleeping."
msgstr "그냥 자는 게 아니었어야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Are we sure it's not just sleeping?"
msgstr "정말 그냥 자는 거 아닌 거겠지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "We thought it was dead."
msgstr "죽은 줄 알았는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT"
msgid "They want to talk, but they don't know how!"
msgstr "말을 하고 싶어하는데 말할 줄을 몰라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED"
msgid "We got one!"
msgstr "잡았다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "Nobody home."
msgstr "아무도 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD"
msgid "They don't seem very friendly."
msgstr "별로 친절하지 않은 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED"
msgid "Why are they mad at us?"
msgstr "왜 우리한테 화난 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "That's not a fun ghost!"
msgstr "재미없는 유령이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER"
msgid "This seems like something Wendy would like."
msgstr "웬디가 좋아할 만한 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT"
msgid "We wanna wear it!"
msgstr "우리도 써 볼래!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell us you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell us you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell me you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell us you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell us you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell me you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell us you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell us you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell us you were making crafts!"
msgstr "야, 왜 이런 거 만든다고 말 안 해준 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "Oh! What is it?!"
msgstr "우와! 이게 뭐지?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "I want to give someone something nice!"
msgstr "난 누군가에게 좋은 걸 주고 싶어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "Let's eat it!"
msgstr "어서 먹자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "Come back! Come back!!!"
msgstr "돌아와! 돌아와!!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Aaah! A gingerbread nightmare!"
msgstr "아악! 생강과자 지옥이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "We think it's great and we love it."
msgstr "멋진 것 같아. 마음에도 들고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "It's sharp enough to split a spider hair."
msgstr "거미 털을 자를 수 있을 만큼 날카로워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "Careful, it's fragile."
msgstr "조심해, 잘 깨지는 거니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Nice eyes."
msgstr "멋진 눈이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "We'll find you a blanket!"
msgstr "우리가 담요 가져다 줄게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "I spoke too soon. It smells worse now."
msgstr "내가 너무 성급했어. 지금 냄새가 훨씬 구려."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It doesn't smell very nice."
msgstr "냄새가 영 좋지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "Yucky muck!"
msgstr "더러운 배설물!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "I wish I'd at least ended up with wings. Sigh."
msgstr "나한테 날개라도 났으면 좋을 텐데. 하아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "Mmm, mousse!"
msgstr "으으음, 무스다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "Still looks pretty dangerous."
msgstr "아직도 꽤 위험해 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "We feel a bit bad about your horn..."
msgstr "네 뿔에 대해서는 좀 안 됐어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "We're glad you're our friend now!"
msgstr "네가 이제 우리 친구여서 기뻐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "Woah, it's got a spear on its head!"
msgstr "우와, 얘는 머리에 창이 달렸어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "Maybe it's magic?"
msgstr "이거 마법인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "A glass of milk with every supper."
msgstr "저녁마다 우유 한 잔."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "We wish it had eight lenses."
msgstr "렌즈가 8개 있었으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "Life is okay when you've got a golden axe."
msgstr "금으로 만든 도끼라니, 세상은 아직 살 만하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "The finest pickaxe of them all."
msgstr "곡괭이 중의 곡괭이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "We can do some fancy forking with this."
msgstr "이걸로 멋지게 찌를 수 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "We're gonna dig so many holes."
msgstr "아주 많은 구멍을 팔 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "Gardening's more fun when you get to play with something shiny!"
msgstr "반짝이는 걸 가지고 놀면 밭일이 더 재미있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "We definitely like shiny."
msgstr "우리는 반짝이가 진짜 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "Tickle torture."
msgstr "간지럼 고문에 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "It could use some perking up."
msgstr "기운을 차리게 해 줘야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Fire, fire, fire!"
msgstr "불, 불, 불이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "Maybe it needs some chicken soup?"
msgstr "닭고기 수프를 좀 줘야 하려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Are you okay, lil tuft?"
msgstr "괜찮니, 풀아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Grass, next best thing to silk."
msgstr "풀, 거미줄 다음 가는 재료지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "Picked down to the stems."
msgstr "줄기까지 베어졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "The heat wave bested it."
msgstr "열기에게 졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "We don't think it wants to be friends with us."
msgstr "우리랑 친구 하고 싶지는 않은 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It's got ouchies in its tummy."
msgstr "얘는 배가 아야해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "Hey! You dropped something!"
msgstr "잠깐! 너 뭐 떨어뜨렸어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "Rain won't keep us from playing in puddles!"
msgstr "비가 와도 문제없이 웅덩이에서 놀 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "We don't think anyone's inside."
msgstr "안에 아무도 없는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "We got a ghost!"
msgstr "유령을 잡았어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "We like lots of gravy!"
msgstr "우린 그레이비는 많은 게 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "Time to build!"
msgstr "만들기 시간!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "I'm absolutely green with envy."
msgstr "난 녹색이 정말 부러워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "We could always use more eyes!"
msgstr "언제나 눈이 더 필요해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "Magic taker-apart-er."
msgstr "분해 마법이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Smells really earthy."
msgstr "진짜 흙 냄새가 나는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Heat really brings out the juices."
msgstr "열을 가했더니 수분이 정말 빠졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Ready for harvest."
msgstr "수확할 준비가 됐어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "We can't get at it!"
msgstr "딸 수가 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It's gone now."
msgstr "이제 없어졌네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "Isn't it dangerous to have glass in the pool?"
msgstr "수영장에 유리를 넣어두면 위험하지 않아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "Isn't it dangerous to have glass in the pool?"
msgstr "수영장에 유리를 넣어두면 위험하지 않아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "Holy moley, this is tasty."
msgstr "이런 맙소사, 이거 진짜 맛있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "Bat doodoo."
msgstr "박쥐 응가야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "This black powder stuff packs a punch."
msgstr "이 검은 가루 같은 건 한 방이 아주 세."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Oh, Wendy! We'll trade you for your choco pigs!"
msgstr "오, 웬디! 네 초코 돼지랑 우리 거랑 바꾸자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "Candy candy candy!"
msgstr "사탕 사탕 사탕!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "Mmm! Sweet revenge!"
msgstr "으으음! 달콤한 복수야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "Wriggly, yet satisfying."
msgstr "꿈틀거리지만 기분이 좋아져."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "We like these a lot."
msgstr "우린 이게 정말 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "Gosh, it's spicy."
msgstr "으악, 매워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Haha ew! It's weird!"
msgstr "하하, 윽! 이상한 맛이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Haha, that's not candy!"
msgstr "하하, 이건 사탕이 아니잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "We aren't totally comfortable with this."
msgstr "정말정말 불편해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "We forgot what good things tasted like!"
msgstr "맛있다는 게 어떤 거였는지 까먹고 있었어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "No worse than the other stuff we've eaten out here!"
msgstr "우리가 여기서 먹은 것들에 비하면 이 정도야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "Oh, Ms. Wicker! We saved these for you!"
msgstr "아, 위커 선생님! 선생님 드리려고 아껴뒀어요!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "Candy candy candy!"
msgstr "사탕 사탕 사탕!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "Gummy worms, yummy worms!"
msgstr "쫄깃한 벌레, 맛있는 벌레!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "Makes us feel big and strong!"
msgstr "크고 강해진 기분이 들게 해 줘!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "It's pretty powerful."
msgstr "꽤 강력해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "It's only a little powerful."
msgstr "그냥 좀 강력하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "Neat! It's like firecrackers."
msgstr "좋다! 폭죽 같네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "Should we drink it? Nah, probably not."
msgstr "한 번 마셔볼까? 아냐, 안 그러는 게 좋을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "Oooh. Spooky. We should decorate!"
msgstr "우와. 무시무시하네. 좀 꾸며야겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "Gosh. That almost looks real."
msgstr "세상에, 이거 진짜 같네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "Aw. It's not real. Let's hang it somewhere."
msgstr "아이, 진짜는 아니네. 어디 걸어두자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "Let's hang it somewhere for Halloween!"
msgstr "할로윈 기념으로 어디 걸어두자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "We should put this guy in a tree!"
msgstr "이 녀석은 나무에 둬야 해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "If we put it in a tree it'd look almost real."
msgstr "나무에 달면 진짜같아 보일 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "An interesting way to use food."
msgstr "음식을 사용하는 흥미로운 방법이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "Chaos and destruction!"
msgstr "혼돈과 파괴!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "We're not strong enough to use it."
msgstr "우린 이걸 쓸 수 있을 만큼 세지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "A fluffy puffy pillow!"
msgstr "폭신폭신한 베개야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "Is that pillow... dripping?"
msgstr "베개에서... 물 떨어지나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "It's the nicest pillow we've ever smelled!"
msgstr "베개에서 완전 좋은 냄새 나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Ah! This one's really scratchy..."
msgstr "아! 이거 엄청 까슬까슬하네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "Yuck! What a mean dare!"
msgstr "우웩! 진짜 너무하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "Grandpa's style, definitely."
msgstr "할아버지의 스타일이야, 확실해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "Soothing."
msgstr "아픈 게 가라앉아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "Not just for booboos!"
msgstr "아야한 데에만 바르는 게 아냐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "That uses magic to hurt people."
msgstr "사람을 해치는 마법이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "It's getting chilly."
msgstr "점점 차가워지고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "It's cold to the touch."
msgstr "만지기에 너무 차가워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a rock."
msgstr "바위야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "It's hot to the touch!"
msgstr "만지면 엄청 뜨거워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "It's getting hot!"
msgstr "점점 뜨거워지고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Did we say something wrong?!"
msgstr "우리가 뭐 나쁜 말 했니?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "Look at all those pretty red roses."
msgstr "저 예쁜 빨간 장미들 좀 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "She reminds me of grandma... but meaner."
msgstr "우리 할머니 생각나네... 물론 그보다는 심술궂지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
msgid "So warm!"
msgstr "엄청 따뜻해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
msgid "It'll make us brave?"
msgstr "마시면 용감해지는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "For when we feel really funny."
msgstr "머리가 아주아주 이상할 때 마시는 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "Tastes like the moon?"
msgstr "달의 맛은 이런 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS"
msgid "For when we feel a little funny."
msgstr "머리가 조금 이상할 때 마시는 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "It makes us feel funny!"
msgstr "머리가 이상해져!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "Tastes like a cool breeze!"
msgstr "시원한 산들바람 같은 맛이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "Do we have to?"
msgstr "꼭 마셔야 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
msgid "Awww..."
msgstr "힝..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "Bright and cheery!"
msgstr "밝고 즐거워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
msgid "We're gonna make the island so pretty!"
msgstr "섬을 아주 예쁘게 만들어야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "We get to help Ms. Pearl find a new home!"
msgstr "진주 아주머니께 새 집을 찾아드리자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL"
msgid "We can see Ms. Pearl anytime we want!"
msgstr "언제든 진주 아주머니를 보러 갈 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE"
msgid "We love Ms. Pearl's tea!"
msgstr "우린 진주 아주머니 차가 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING"
msgid "We want our tea! We want our tea!"
msgstr "차 주세요! 차 주세요!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT"
msgid "Poor Ms. Pearl!"
msgstr "진주 아주머니 어떡해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh, Ms. Peeeaarl! Where are you?"
msgstr "진주 아주머니이이이! 어디 계세요?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "We promise not to splash! Maybe."
msgstr "물장난 안 하기로 약속! 아마도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "Aw, it's all dried up."
msgstr "아, 다 말라버렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "Splish splash."
msgstr "첨방 첨벙."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR"
msgid "It's taking forever!"
msgstr "너무 오래 걸려!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "She must be sad living here all alone..."
msgstr "이제는 행복하셨으면 좋겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "We hope this makes her feel happier!"
msgstr "여기서 혼자 사시느라 슬펐겠다...."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY"
msgid "Where should we hide them?"
msgstr "어디다 숨길까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Will there still be room for webs?"
msgstr "거미줄 놓을 자리도 있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "It's always fun to unwrap a package!"
msgstr "선물을 뜯어보는 건 늘 즐거운 일이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "We have so many shells to play with!"
msgstr "가지고 놀 조가비가 엄청 많아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "We hope Ms. Pearl isn't too mad at us..."
msgstr "진주 아주머니한테 혼나면 어쩌지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "We'll take really good care of it!"
msgstr "정말 조심해서 다뤄야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "We could be part bee now too!"
msgstr "우리는 벌 편도 될 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "Hellooo? We're here!"
msgstr "저기요오오? 우리 여기 있어요!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "The lettering burnt off."
msgstr "글자들이 다 타 버렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "We could write on that if only we had a pen!"
msgstr "펜이 있었으면 여기에 글씨도 썼을 텐데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "Ooooh, what should we say?"
msgstr "우와아, 뭐라고 쓸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Sticky and sweet."
msgstr "끈적하고 달콤해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "Honey pods!"
msgstr "꿀단지야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Ooo, tasty!"
msgstr "우와, 맛있겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "We wish they were shaped like dinosaurs."
msgstr "공룡 모양이었으면 좋겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "If this makes a mating call we're all in trouble."
msgstr "만약 이게 짝짓기 울음소리라면 큰일인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "It makes our spider skin crawl."
msgstr "거미 피부에 닭살이 돋을 정도야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE"
msgid "It's lucky!"
msgstr "운이 좋네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Flavor bombs!"
msgstr "양념 폭탄이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "It smells nice and looks pretty."
msgstr "냄새도 좋고 생긴 것도 예뻐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "Aw, it's all dried up."
msgstr "아, 다 말라버렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "Splish splash."
msgstr "첨방 첨벙."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "We could crack it open."
msgstr "깨서 열 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "That's an angry puppy!"
msgstr "화난 강아지다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "There isn't much left."
msgstr "많이 남아있지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "I miss the puppy, but I don't want it to come back."
msgstr "강아지가 그리워. 물론 살아돌아오는 건 싫어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Poor puppy."
msgstr "불쌍한 강아지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Make it stop, make it stop!"
msgstr "멈춰, 멈추라고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "This place scares us."
msgstr "여긴 우리에게 무서운 곳이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "It's the perfect tooth to gnash."
msgstr "갈기 딱 좋은 이빨이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "We can shoot dog teeth!"
msgstr "개 이빨을 쏠 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "Our head buzzes when we blow it."
msgstr "불면 머리가 웅웅거려."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Give us a Huggy!"
msgstr "우리 안아줘!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "He's our new friend."
msgstr "우리 새 친구야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "He was our new friend."
msgstr "우리 새 친구였어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "Chilling."
msgstr "시원해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope our boat doesn't run into it."
msgstr "우리 배가 저기 부딪치지 않았으면 하는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "We guess it's too hot out."
msgstr "우리 생각엔 밖이 너무 더운 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "We guess it's too hot out."
msgstr "우리 생각엔 밖이 너무 더운 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "Spoil not, food supplies!"
msgstr "썩지 마렴, 식량아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "We dream of ice cream."
msgstr "우리가 꿈에 그리던 아이스크림이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "This should keep us cool."
msgstr "이걸 쓰고 있으면 시원할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "He has a chilling look in his eyes."
msgstr "차가운 눈빛을 가지고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "It's fuzzy!"
msgstr "털이 많아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "It makes me feel funny."
msgstr "뭔가 이상한 기분이 들게 하더라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2"
msgid "Ms. Wickerbottom says we should be careful with magic."
msgstr "위커바텀 선생님이 마법은 조심해서 다뤄야 한댔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3"
msgid "It makes our teeth chatter!"
msgstr "이빨이 와들와들거릴 정도야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Brrr, maybe we should wear gloves for this."
msgstr "흐드드, 장갑 끼고 해야겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "Move, stupid rock!"
msgstr "비켜, 이 멍청한 바위야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "I wonder what that does."
msgstr "뭐에 쓰는 물건인지 궁금해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Winona's been using those funny glasses a lot lately."
msgstr "위노나가 요즘 저 이상한 안경을 자주 쓰고 다녔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "Ah! I'm a monster! Haha, we're just kidding."
msgstr "으아! 내가 괴물이라니! 하하, 우리 그냥 농담한 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP"
msgid "Wormwood's nice, but he's not very good at cooking."
msgstr "웜우드는 착하긴 한데 요리를 잘 못하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE"
msgid "It really doesn't like when we pick the other plants!"
msgstr "우리가 다른 식물을 꺾는 걸 안 좋아하나 봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "Ew... sticky fingies."
msgstr "으으... 손가락이 끈적해졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "Will they grow into candy beanstalks?"
msgstr "심으면 사탕 콩나무가 자랄까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE"
msgid "There might be something fun to play with in there!"
msgstr "저 안에 갖고 놀 만한 게 있을지도 몰라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Ooh! We see a prize at the top!"
msgstr "우와! 꼭대기에 상품이 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC"
msgid "We don't want to get squashed!"
msgstr "우린 깔려 죽기 싫어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
msgid "Can we have pancakes instead?"
msgstr "이거 말고 팬케이크는 없나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Foods on a stick!"
msgstr "막대에 끼운 음식이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "Slimy, yet satisfying."
msgstr "끈적하지만 맛있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "Why did we make this?"
msgstr "우리가 이걸 왜 만든 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "He doesn't like it very much, but I think it's okay."
msgstr "얘가 별로 안 좋아하긴 하지만, 난 괜찮을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "Mmm, salty and flaky!"
msgstr "으음, 짭짤하고 바삭해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "Uh oh, run!"
msgstr "어 이런, 도망쳐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't escape."
msgstr "빠져나가지 않았으면 좋겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no!"
msgstr "안돼!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "We hope the kitcoons like it!"
msgstr "킷쿤들이 좋아했으면 좋겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "We'll have it done right away!"
msgstr "금방 완성할 수 있을 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr "히잉..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "We like watching the kitcoons play with it!"
msgstr "킷쿤들이 가지고 노니까 보기 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "Where should we put it?"
msgstr "어디다 놔 둬야 할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "We hope it was evacuated..."
msgstr "다들 빠져나갔어야 할 텐데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A nice safe place for kitcoons to rest after playing."
msgstr "킷쿤들이 놀고 나서 편안하고 안전하게 쉴 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
msgid "They're hiding..."
msgstr "숨어있어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "We're almost out of time to find all of the babies..."
msgstr "아가들을 전부 찾을 시간이 거의 없어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT"
msgid "We can use this to build a little house for the kitcoons."
msgstr "이거면 킷쿤들에게 작은 집을 지어줄 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "The minister's kit is a dastardly kit!"
msgstr "교활한가요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT"
msgid "The minister's kit is a golden kit!"
msgstr "금빛인가요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST"
msgid "The minister's kit is an arborous kit!"
msgstr "감나무를 타나요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS"
msgid "The minister's kit is an eager kit!"
msgstr "간절한가요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH"
msgid "The minister's kit is a comfy kit!"
msgstr "그냥 좋나요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "The minister's kit is a husky kit!"
msgstr "걸걸한가요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "We always wanted a pet!"
msgstr "늘 애완동물이 가지고 싶었어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "The minister's kit is a ferrous kit!"
msgstr "겁을 주나요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "The minister's kit is a beastly kit!"
msgstr "끔찍한가요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "The minister's kit is an icy kit!"
msgstr "까칠한가요? 네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "That meanie imprisoned those deer!"
msgstr "저 나쁜 녀석이 사슴들을 붙잡았어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "I think maybe this goes somewhere."
msgstr "어딘가에 넣을 수 있을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "Presents?!"
msgstr "선물이야?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "Wow! That's complicated clockwork."
msgstr "와! 복잡한 태엽 장치잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Goodnight, good knight."
msgstr "좋은 밤, 좋은 말."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING"
msgid "Follow us to fun!"
msgstr "우릴 따라오면 재미있을 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
msgid "Where are you going?"
msgstr "어디로 가는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "Why are you so naughty?"
msgstr "왜 그리 못되게 구는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "This makes us sad."
msgstr "이걸 보니 슬퍼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "Maybe it's lost."
msgstr "길을 잃었나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "We finally found it!"
msgstr "우리가 드디어 찾아냈어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "That looks extra filling!"
msgstr "훨씬 푸짐해 보여!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "Give us back our things!"
msgstr "우리 물건 돌려 내!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid ""
"We could put more in but we're scared to touch the stuff he left inside."
msgstr "다른 걸 넣을 수도 있겠지만 여기 남아있던 건 만지기 무서워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "The sun's trapped in there."
msgstr "태양이 갇혀 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "They're like pancakes made out of potatoes!"
msgstr "마치 감자로 만든 팬케이크 같아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Maybe we should let someone tougher have it."
msgstr "더 힘센 사람이 가지게 두는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "We'll be an impervious spider!"
msgstr "우린 튼튼한 거미가 될거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "Uhh, I don't think that's very safe."
msgstr "어, 별로 안전하진 않은 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "We'd skitter really fast with that."
msgstr "저걸 입으면 엄청 잽싸게 달릴 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "Safety first!"
msgstr "안전 제일!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "We like this armor a lot."
msgstr "우리 이 갑옷 엄청 좋아해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "This armor seems pretty good!"
msgstr "이 갑옷 꽤 좋아 보인다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "We should armor up to be safe."
msgstr "안전을 위해 갑옷을 입어야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "Hey, help me break this Battle Standard!"
msgstr "저기, 이 전투 휘장 부수는 것 좀 도와줘!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "Oh! Willow brought Bernie!"
msgstr "오! 윌로우가 버니를 데려왔어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "Maybe he's nice?"
msgstr "혹시 친절한 사람인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "That helmet is really something!"
msgstr "저 투구 엄청 멋지다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "Hey hi, rock-person!"
msgstr "거기 안녕, 돌사람아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "It looks neat, but we don't want it."
msgstr "괜찮아 보이기는 한데, 별로 원하지는 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "That might make us scuttle faster."
msgstr "우리가 더 빨리 달릴 수 있게 해 줄 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "It's like fiery spit balls."
msgstr "불타는 침 덩어리 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "It makes your day a little brighter."
msgstr "하루를 좀 더 활기차게 만들어 줘."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "It makes you feel a little better when you wear it."
msgstr "이걸 쓰면 몸이 좀 건강해져."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "That sword is too big for us to carry!"
msgstr "우리가 들기엔 너무 큰 칼이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "It doesn't have its key."
msgstr "열쇠가 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "That looks much better!"
msgstr "훨씬 낫네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "That looks like it was made for spiders."
msgstr "이건 거미를 위해 만든 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "You look different, Lucy. Did you get a haircut?"
msgstr "너 오늘 좀 달라보인다, 루시. 머리 잘랐어?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "This isn't home!"
msgstr "여긴 집이 아니잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Time to go... \"home\"."
msgstr "가자... \"집\"으로."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "It sure is sparkly."
msgstr "진짜 정말 반짝거리네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "That's the bad guy portal!"
msgstr "악당 포탈이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "We like that hat!"
msgstr "이 모자 맘에 들어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "I don't think we should wear that."
msgstr "우리가 입어야 할 건 아닌 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "Sizzling hot!"
msgstr "지글지글 타는 듯이 뜨거워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "Being all froze up probably isn't comfy."
msgstr "꽁꽁 얼어버리면 편하진 않을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe I can make it hatch?"
msgstr "어쩌면 부화시킬 수도 있지 않을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Poor egg. It looks cold."
msgstr "불쌍한 알. 추워 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "The egg seems happy."
msgstr "알이 기분 좋나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "Happy lavae!"
msgstr "용암이가 기분 좋대!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "It's my friend."
msgstr "내 친구야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "Poor hungry lavae."
msgstr "우리 용암이 배고프구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "It looks starving!"
msgstr "굶은 것 같아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "What a weird tooth."
msgstr "정말 이상한 이빨이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "Looks safe now."
msgstr "이제 안전해 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Too hot for us!"
msgstr "너무 뜨거워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "Ouch! Burnies!"
msgstr "아얏! 뜨거워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "Wow! A rock!"
msgstr "와아! 돌이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "Not quite how mother used to make it."
msgstr "엄마가 해 주시던 거랑은 많이 달라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "This hamburger tastes kind of... grassy?"
msgstr "이 햄버거는 뭔가... 풀 맛이네?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "We're not sure about this one..."
msgstr "이거 먹어도 괜찮을지 모르겠네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "Where did that come from?!"
msgstr "어디서 온 거지?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "Aww, it's a little angry tree!"
msgstr "우왕, 작은 화난 나무네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "Where did that come from?!"
msgstr "어디서 온 거지?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "It likes it down here."
msgstr "얜 여기 아래를 좋아해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "I hate taking my medicine!"
msgstr "주사 맞기 싫어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "Bright and delicious."
msgstr "밝고 명랑해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "Aww don't be shy, we're friendly!"
msgstr "아이, 부끄러워 하지 말고, 우리 착해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Lighter than what?"
msgstr "불에 뭘 붙이는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "We think it's probably too big to fit in a jar."
msgstr "병에 잡아두기에는 너무 큰 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "It's all glowy."
msgstr "온통 번쩍거려."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "My father kept goats."
msgstr "아빠가 염소를 키우셨어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "This might make a good weapon."
msgstr "좋은 무기를 만들 수 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "It looks all glowy!"
msgstr "온통 번쩍거려!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "This might keep us safe."
msgstr "이거면 안전해질 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "He has anger in his eyes."
msgstr "눈에 분노가 가득 차 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "This log has a face."
msgstr "이 통나무엔 얼굴이 있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "Hello, Mr. Tree!"
msgstr "안녕하세요, 나무 아저씨!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "We should plant this somewhere."
msgstr "어딘가 다른 곳에 심어야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "It's a monster kid. Like me!"
msgstr "꼬마 괴물이잖아. 나랑 똑같네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "We want to pour it all over our tongues!"
msgstr "한 번에 마셔버리겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "We have to eat it with our eyes closed. Too many legs!"
msgstr "눈 좀 감고 먹자. 다리가 너무 많잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "So much for our arts and crafts!"
msgstr "미술 시간은 물 건너갔네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a log of wood."
msgstr "나무의 통 부분이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
msgid "He's a big meanie!"
msgstr "크고 나쁜 놈이야!"

