msgstr "죽은 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING"
