msgstr "꽤나 매워 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "Let's plant these and see what grows."
msgstr "이걸 심어서 뭐가 자라는지 보자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PERD"
