msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "I shouldn't touch the machine's things."
msgstr "기계의 것을 건드리면 안 돼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
