msgstr "너무... 멀어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT"
msgid "I can't crush that poor hat."
msgstr "저 불쌍한 모자를 차마 뭉갤 순 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
msgid "I won't interrupt."
msgstr "방해하지 않아야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING"
msgid "It's no use. It's the end for this one."
msgstr "소용없어. 녀석도 이젠 끝이거든."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH"
msgid "It's too tall."
msgstr "너무 높아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE"
msgid "It's empty. I'll try again later."
msgstr "텅 비었어. 나중에 다시 시도해야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "Mother warned me not to touch a pot while it's cooking."
msgstr "엄마가 요리하는 중에는 솥에 손을 대면 안 된다고 하셨어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's in there."
msgstr "안에 누가 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "It isn't empty inside, unlike me."
msgstr "속이 비지 않았어. 나와는 다르게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED"
msgid "Failure."
msgstr "실패했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "I draw better with references..."
msgstr "참고할 게 있으면 더 잘 그릴 텐데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "Perhaps if I wanted my garden to die a slow, painful death..."
msgstr "내 텃밭이 천천히, 고통스럽게 죽기를 원한다면야..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "I can't catch anything out here with this flimsy rod."
msgstr "이런 얄팍한 낚싯대로는 여기서 아무 것도 잡을 수 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC"
msgid "It was the evil twin."
msgstr "사악한 쌍둥이였구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "Why isn't it working, Abigail?"
msgstr "왜 안 되는 걸까, 아비게일?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "It's too busy to pay attention to me..."
msgstr "너무 바빠서 나에게 신경을 못 쓰나 봐..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "It has no will to live."
msgstr "살아갈 의지가 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "They already started without me..."
msgstr "벌써 나 빼고 시작했어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
msgid "That's not what it wants."
msgstr "이걸 원하는 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "They've no need of material possessions where they've gone."
msgstr "죽은 자에게 재물 따위는 필요하지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "Oh... my information's useless..."
msgstr "아... 내 지식이 쓸모가 없다니..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "It hasn't yet eaten our last sacrifice..."
msgstr "방금 준 제물을 아직 먹지 않았어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "No... I can't..."
msgstr "아니... 그럴 수 없어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
