msgstr "물건을 가져가버려. 나는 따라갈 수 없고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF"
msgid "It's dead..."
msgstr "죽었어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING"
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr "이런..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT"
msgid "It all crumbles to ash, in the end."
msgstr "결국엔 바스라져 재가 됐어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Not everything can be brought back."
msgstr "뭐든지 되가져올 수 있는 건 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF"
msgid "It's dead..."
msgstr "죽었어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "It helps stave off the encroaching cold."
msgstr "매서운 추위를 견뎌낼 수 있도록 도와줘."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Does that mean my day to die is here?"
msgstr "내가 죽을 날이 왔다는 의미일까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "Why do I feel that it is measuring our mortality?"
msgstr "왜 우리의 치사율을 측정하는 느낌일까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "Makes me think of holidays with Abigail."
msgstr "아비게일과 보냈던 명절날들이 떠올라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING"
msgid "The end is almost nigh."
msgstr "끝이 거의 다가오고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING"
msgid "At least something is warm in this world."
msgstr "적어도 이 세상에서 따뜻한 게 있긴 하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY"
msgid "I suppose I could eat something."
msgstr "뭘 먹을 순 있을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A place to cook dead things."
msgstr "죽은 것들을 요리하는 공간이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "I'm going to eat you."
msgstr "널 먹어버리겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "Not nearly sweet enough to balance out this bitter world."
msgstr "이 쓰디쓴 세상에 균형을 맞춰줄 정도로 달콤하진 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "If you eat it right... the end gets sharp..."
msgstr "먹다 보면... 끝부분이 날카로워져서..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "It is filled with chunks of evil."
msgstr "사악함이 가득 차 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "It tastes okay, but I've grown tired of logs..."
msgstr "먹을만해. 그렇지만 통나무는 이제 염증이 나..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "I'm going to lick all the icing off..."
msgstr "아이싱부터 핥아먹어 버려야지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "I don't want Winter's Feast to end..."
msgstr "겨울 축제가 영원히 끝나지 않았으면 좋겠어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "I missed cocoa."
msgstr "따뜻한 코코아가 그리웠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "So aggressively delicious. You can't help but feel better."
msgstr "아주 적극적으로 맛있어. 기분이 좋아질 수밖에."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Do you like this one, Abigail?"
msgstr "이거 마음에 드니, 아비게일?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "This is one of my favorites."
msgstr "내가 가장 좋아하는 것 중 하나야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "A remembrance of past carnage."
msgstr "과거에 있던 대학살의 기념물이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "Should old acquaintance be forgot."
msgstr "오랫동안 사귀었던 정든 내 친구여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "Bright lights... Cold nights..."
msgstr "불빛은 밝고... 밤은 차고..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL"
msgid "Just lovely."
msgstr "사랑스러워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "저런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Death comes for all of us..."
msgstr "죽음은 누구에게나 찾아오지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE"
msgid "Oh, joy."
msgstr "참 즐거워라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG"
msgid "It's not ready yet."
msgstr "아직 다 자라지 않았어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "Death comes for all of us..."
msgstr "죽음은 누구에게나 찾아오지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "We can plant a Winter's Feast tree."
msgstr "여기에 겨울 축제 나무를 심을 수 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "A damp and dreary home."
msgstr "축축하고 음울해 보이는 집이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS"
msgid "This world has made it hard, and sharp."
msgstr "세상이 녀석을 억세고 날카롭게 만든 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
msgid "Its hard exterior shelters it from the cruel outside world."
msgstr "단단한 겉껍질이 잔인한 바깥 세상으로부터 지켜주고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD"
msgid "It's met its maker. I've met my lunch."
msgstr "이 녀석은 조물주 보러 갔고, 난 점심밥 먹으러 왔고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
msgid "It's a feast!"
msgstr "정말 푸짐해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1"
msgid "She's... soft. And nice."
msgstr "얘... 부드럽다. 착하기도 하고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2"
msgid "She's... soft. And nice."
msgstr "얘... 부드럽다. 착하기도 하고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1"
msgid "I wonder how she came to this miserable place."
msgstr "이런 아이가 어쩌다 이런 끔찍한 곳에 오게 됐는지 모르겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2"
msgid "I wonder how she came to this miserable place."
msgstr "이런 아이가 어쩌다 이런 끔찍한 곳에 오게 됐는지 모르겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT"
msgid "Woby loves these."
msgstr "워비가 좋아해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "I don't trust %s. Fear makes people dangerous."
msgstr "난 %s를 믿지 않아. 공포는 사람을 위험하게 만들지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Fire won't protect you, %s."
msgstr "불은 아저씨를 지켜주지 않을 거예요, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s. Why are you shaking?"
msgstr "안녕하세요 %s. 왜 떨고 계세요?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "%s... Everyone leaves..."
msgstr "%s... 모두들 날 떠나고 있어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "Strength is meaningless if you can't catch me..."
msgstr "절 못 잡는데 힘이 무슨 소용이신지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "Don't be scared, %s. Abigail just wants to be friends."
msgstr "겁 먹지 마세요, %s. 아비게일은 친구가 되고 싶을 뿐이에요."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE"
msgid "Abigail, I saw you whispering at Wolfgang to make us do pushups!"
msgstr "아비게일, 방금 너 볼프강 아저씨한테 팔굽혀펴기 시키라고 말한 거 다 봤어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER"
msgid "I think I know why the other monkeys cast you out."
msgstr "왜 원숭이들에게 따돌림 받는지 알 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Monkeys shouldn't play with fire."
msgstr "원숭이는 불장난 하면 안 돼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC"
msgid "Why hello there. Did the other monkeys shun you?"
msgstr "거기 안녕. 다른 원숭이들한테 따돌림당한 거니?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST"
msgid "Now you and Abigail can play together."
msgstr "이제 아비게일이랑 놀면 되겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER"
msgid "I think it's time Abigail and I put an end to your games... for good."
msgstr "아비게일과 함께 너에게 최후를 선사할 때가 된 것 같구나... 아무튼 말야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER"
msgid "What a strange creature you are."
msgstr "너 참 이상한 녀석이구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT"
msgid "Today, a pine hat... perhaps tomorrow a pine box."
msgstr "오늘은 소나무 모자지만... 내일은 소나무 관이 될지도 모르지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is plotting something dastardly with that axe."
msgstr "%s가 저 도끼로 뭔가 위험한 짓을 꾸미는것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "He pinky-promised I'd get to ride on his shoulders. Such lies."
msgstr "어깨에 태워 주겠다고 손가락 걸었으면서. 순 거짓말."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "The curse haunts you even in death, %s?"
msgstr "죽어서도 저주에 고통받으시는 건가요, %s 아저씨?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Fire setting does not seem in your best interest..."
msgstr "불을 지피는 게 그다지 이득이 되지는 않을 텐데요..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, %s?"
msgstr "잘 지내시나요, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "We'll get a heart, but are you sure you want to come back?"
msgstr "심장을 가져오긴 할 건데, 다시 돌아오고 싶으신 거 맞아요?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE"
msgid "Hah... you look so silly I almost... well, never mind."
msgstr "힛... 아저씨가 너무 우스꽝스러워서 그만... 아니다, 신경 쓰지 마세요."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST"
msgid "Why stay when you could fly away from this place?"
msgstr "이 곳을 떠날 수 있는데 왜 머무르시는 건가요?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE"
msgid "It looks like your condition has worsened, %s."
msgstr "아저씨 상태가 악화된 모양이군요, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST"
msgid "I'll find a way to return you to this mortal coil. If you wish."
msgstr "아저씨를 이 육신으로 돌아오게 할 방법을 찾아볼게요. 원한다면야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "I'll send you someplace much nicer than this, %s."
msgstr "여기보다 나은 곳으로 보내드릴게요, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "Abigail likes you, %s. But she likes Lucy more."
msgstr "아비게일이 아저씨를 좋아해요, %s. 근데 루시가 더 좋다네요."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT"
msgid "Oh well."
msgstr "오 이런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "Abigail?"
msgstr "아비게일?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "You might be sitting on Abigail."
msgstr "아비게일을 깔고 앉았으면 어쩌려고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Just as well."
msgstr "오히려 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Abigail's favorite hiding spot."
msgstr "아비게일이 이런 데 자주 숨었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Abigail's favorite hiding spot."
msgstr "아비게일이 이런 데 자주 숨었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT"
msgid "Is something there?"
msgstr "저기에 뭔가 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT"
msgid "It seems out of place."
msgstr "뭔가 어색한걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
msgid "It comes from the depths."
msgstr "깊은 곳으로부터 왔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Life doesn't always make sense."
msgstr "삶은 언제나 말이 되진 않지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN"
msgid "No matter what it consumes, it is never satisfied."
msgstr "무엇을 삼켜도 절대 만족하지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED"
msgid "It will soon give up."
msgstr "곧 포기하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
msgid "There's a slight humming coming from it."
msgstr "작게 흥얼거리는 소리가 들려오고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
msgid "Better the worm's light than its tongue."
msgstr "벌레의 혀보다는 벌레의 빛이 낫지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "It seems out of place."
msgstr "뭔가 어색한걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has developed a taste for blood."
msgstr "%s는 피의 맛을 알게 되었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "If you play with fire, you're liable to get burned..."
msgstr "네가 불장난을 한다면 쉽게 탈 텐데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, %s?"
msgstr "잘 지내니, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST"
msgid "You were too good for this world, %s."
msgstr "넌 이 세상에 있기엔 너무 착했어, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER"
msgid "Don't worry, %s. I'll end it quickly."
msgstr "걱정 마, %s. 금방 끝내줄게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER"
msgid "%s's friendship extends beyond the veil."
msgstr "%s의 우정은 장막을 뛰어넘구는나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "It is no more."
msgstr "더 이상 존재하지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "I despise how it skitters..."
msgstr "찍찍거리는 게 경멸스러워..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "Freedom is not for you."
msgstr "자유는 널 위한 건 아니란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "It is arrested by deepest sleep."
msgstr "깊고 깊은 잠에 사로잡혔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "It prefers to be alone."
msgstr "혼자 있는 것을 좋아해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "You simply look too delicious."
msgstr "넌 지나치게 맛있어 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It is arrested by deepest sleep."
msgstr "깊고 깊은 잠에 사로잡혔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "A small spot of light in the darkness... waiting to be snuffed out."
msgstr "어둠 속의 작은 불빛이야... 무참히 죽게 되겠지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS"
msgid "Nothing goes extinct here."
msgstr "이 세상의 사전에 멸종이란 없구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER"
msgid "You haven't been a good imp today, %s."
msgstr "오늘은 착한 임프처럼 굴지 못했구나, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Abby and I know what you did, %s."
msgstr "애비와 난 네가 무슨 짓을 했는지 다 알아, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Heehee. You're funny, %s."
msgstr "히히. 너 재밌다, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "Did you lose a game, %s?"
msgstr "게임에서 진 거야, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Abby and I will put your souls to rest!"
msgstr "애비와 내가 너를 영면에 들게 해 주마!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is reliable when it counts."
msgstr "%s는 중요한 순간엔 믿음직하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG"
msgid "He's becoming more like Krampus."
msgstr "점점 크람푸스처럼 되어가고 있구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER"
msgid "Of course it won't work for Abigail."
msgstr "당연히 아비게일에게는 소용 없겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR"
msgid "You can hear the souls screaming inside."
msgstr "단지 속에서 영혼의 절규가 들려."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER"
msgid "If you won't play nice, you can't play with us!"
msgstr "착하게 굴지 않으면 안 놀아줄 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Maybe we should play a different game..."
msgstr "다른 놀이를 해야 할 것 같은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello, %s."
msgstr "안녕, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST"
msgid "I'm so sorry, %s."
msgstr "정말 유감이야, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER"
msgid "You should've stayed hidden in your swamp!"
msgstr "넌 네 늪에 계속 숨어있었어야 했어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER"
msgid "That was very nice of you, %s."
msgstr "너 정말 친절하구나, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR"
msgid "Sigh. Isn't the regular swamp bad enough?"
msgstr "에휴. 평범한 늪은 충분히 나쁘지 않았던 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW"
msgid "Sigh. Isn't the regular swamp bad enough?"
msgstr "에휴. 평범한 늪은 충분히 나쁘지 않았던 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER"
msgid "Do you have a conscience, %s?"
msgstr "양심은 있니, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I'd begun to think you were all talk, %s."
msgstr "네가 전부 말해줬다고 생각했었는데, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC"
msgid "How do you do, %s?"
msgstr "잘 지내니, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST"
msgid "Say \"Pretty Please\" and I might get you a heart, %s."
msgstr "\"부탁해요\"라고 빌면 생각해 볼게, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER"
msgid "None of us are above death, %s!"
msgstr "죽음을 뛰어넘을 수는 없어, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER"
msgid "Abigail likes you, %s."
msgstr "아비게일이 널 좋아하는걸, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE"
msgid "It looks so fragile... hopefully no tragic accidents befall it."
msgstr "매우 연약해 보여... 안타까운 사고는 없었으면 좋겠네."

