msgstr "의사소통을 시도하는 게 분명해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "That food is simply not suitable."
msgstr "부적합하기 짝이 없는 음식이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "Don't be silly, dear."
msgstr "장난칠 때가 아냐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "No one ought to sculpt with that, dear."
msgstr "누구도 이런 것으론 조각하지 않는단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "This is not the staff I seek."
msgstr "내가 찾는 그 지팡이가 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "This is no time for fun and games!"
msgstr "지금은 한가하게 놀 때가 아니야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "I'll need to do some tidying up first."
msgstr "먼저 정리를 해야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "No time for that now. It'll be dark soon."
msgstr "지금은 그럴 시간이 아니야. 곧 어두워질 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY"
