msgstr "그러기엔 공간이 지극히 부족하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN"
msgid ""
"Oh that won't do, the intended arborous recipient appears to be missing."
msgstr "소용없을 게야. 받을 식물체가 사라져 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE"
