msgstr "여기서는 촉수가 지면을 뚫고 나오지 못할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOWATERNEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOWATERNEARBY"
