"Weight: {weight}\n"
"This specimen is decidedly larger than average."
msgstr ""
"무게: {weight}\n"
"이 표본은 확실히 평균 이상의 크기야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_WENDY_BABYSITTER_SET
