msgstr "체크포인트 설치하는 작업을 간과해 버렸구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS"
