#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1"
msgid "Merely a single piece of a larger costuming pattern."
msgstr "커다란 의복 양식의 한 조각에 불과해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2"
msgid "Merely a single piece of a larger costuming pattern."
msgstr "커다란 의복 양식의 한 조각에 불과해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_3"
msgid "Merely a single piece of a larger costuming pattern."
msgstr "커다란 의복 양식의 한 조각에 불과해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST"
msgid "This is where the beefalo are to be displayed for judging."
msgstr "심사를 받을 수 있도록 비팔로를 보이는 곳이란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "It should be simple enough to erect."
msgstr "세우기 간단할 것 같구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
msgid "I tend to prefer crochet."
msgstr "난 보통은 손바느질을 좋아한단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM"
msgid "Well, I'd better get that set up."
msgstr "그럼, 어서 설치하자꾸나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
msgid "How intriguing!"
msgstr "아주 흥미롭구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
msgid "I suppose it's not going to construct itself."
msgstr "알아서 조립되지는 않을 게야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "That won't do at all."
msgstr "별로 제 기능은 못 하겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It requires an offering of some sort."
msgstr "이건 어떤 종류의 공물을 필요로 한단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a tribute to the small plant-animal hybrid."
msgstr "작은 동-식물 혼성체에게 바치는 공물이란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
msgid "I'm afraid it won't be of much use to anyone now."
msgstr "지금은 누구에게도 쓸모가 없을 듯하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC"
msgid "This will put the creature's sense of direction to the test."
msgstr "생물의 방향 감각을 시험할 거란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
msgid "Who's a clever little Daucus carota rattus?"
msgstr "누가 영리한 집쥐당근일까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
msgid "An easily constructed directional testing apparatus."
msgstr "간단하게 제작한 방향 실험 장치란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT"
msgid "I'm afraid it won't be of much use to anyone now."
msgstr "지금은 누구에게도 쓸모가 없을 듯하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC"
msgid "This should be a good test of reflexes."
msgstr "좋은 민첩성 시험이 될 거란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT"
msgid "I do believe its reaction time is improving!"
msgstr "분명 녀석의 반사신경이 개선되고 있을 게야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM"
msgid "Everything I need to test my subject's alertness."
msgstr "내 대상의 경계 능력을 시험하는 데에 필요한 것들이란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT"
msgid "I'm afraid it won't be of much use to anyone now."
msgstr "지금은 누구에게도 쓸모가 없을 듯하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "Speed is no replacement for cleverness, but it helps."
msgstr "속도가 영리함을 대체할 수는 없지만 도움은 될 거란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT"
msgid "Oh my, look at it go!"
msgstr "세상에나, 이걸 좀 보렴!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM"
msgid "An easily constructed speed testing device."
msgstr "간단히 구성한 속도 시험 장치란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT"
msgid "I'm afraid it won't be of much use to anyone now."
msgstr "지금은 누구에게도 쓸모가 없을 듯하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC"
msgid "The repeated jumping should help build the creature's stamina."
msgstr "뜀뛰기를 반복하면 생물의 체력을 기르는 데에 도움이 될 게야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "The little dear is working so hard."
msgstr "저 조그만 아이는 열심히 일하는 중이구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "Everything I need to test the stamina of my subject."
msgstr "내 대상의 체력을 시험하는 데에 필요한 것들이란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "This marker should help keep things on track."
msgstr "이 표식은 길 찾기를 도와줄 수 있을 거란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "I'd best make sure I have enough to reach the finish line."
msgstr "결승선에 다다를 수 있을 만큼 충분히 놓는 게 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Oh dear, that won't do at all."
msgstr "오 세상에나, 저러면 정말 안 되는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm eager to document the results!"
msgstr "결과를 기록해 두고 싶구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "Oh ho! Superb results, if I do say so myself."
msgstr "오호! 말하자면 꽤나 엄청난 결과물이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "\"Note: {winner}'s specimen displays superior racing ability.\""
msgstr "\"메모: {winner}의 표본은 우수한 경주 능력을 보인다.\""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "The ending point for this little experiment."
msgstr "이 작은 실험의 종료점이란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "This will be a unique opportunity to observe the Daucus carota rattus."
msgstr "집쥐당근을 관찰할 특별한 기회가 되겠구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "I should find a suitable place for this."
msgstr "설치하기 적합한 장소를 찾아야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "Oh my, that won't do at all."
msgstr "오 세상에나, 전혀 쓸모가 없겠구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "Hm, it seems that more training might be in order."
msgstr "흠, 훈련을 좀 더 해야겠구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "The specimen seems to have responded well to the training!"
msgstr "저 표본은 훈련에 잘 대응한 듯하구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "Fascinating! I never realized skill could be measured by weight."
msgstr "대단히 흥미로워! 저울로 능력을 측정할 수 있을 줄이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "It measures the racing prowess of herbaceous rodents."
msgstr "초본 설치류의 경주 실력을 측정한단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "I used to be quite an avid gardener."
msgstr "전엔 부지런히 정원도 가꿨었는데 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "I wonder what species it will turn out to be."
msgstr "어떤 종이 들어 있을지 궁금한걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "One of the more curious uses for gold I've seen yet."
msgstr "금을 이렇게 특이하게 쓰는 건 또 처음 봤어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "It will allow us to create an anchor for our ships."
msgstr "이거면 배에 닻을 설치할 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It has expired."
msgstr "파손되었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I suspect it requires a tribute of charcoal."
msgstr "숯을 바쳐야 하는 것 같구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "A tribute to a creature with both reptilian and insectoid traits."
msgstr "파충류와 곤충의 특징을 한 몸에 가진 생물에게 바치는 사당이란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid ""
"It never occurred to me how perfectly paddle-shaped the native Diptera's "
"forearm is."
msgstr "이 곳에 사는 파리의 앞발을 완벽하게 닮다니 상상도 못 했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Let us be off, then!"
msgstr "그럼, 출항하자꾸나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "A necessity should we want to steer our boat."
msgstr "배를 조종하는 데에 필수적인 부품이란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid ""
"It is a rocking horse, of the sort commonly found in children's nurseries."
msgstr "흔들목마구나. 흔히 유아원 등지에서 볼 수 있는 것이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "This knight's helm affords adequate cranial protection."
msgstr "이 기사 투구는 두개골을 적절히 보호해주는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "This shrine has been burned."
msgstr "사당이 불타버렸구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It demands are particular offering."
msgstr "특정한 공물을 요구하고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "A sufficient offering has been made."
msgstr "적절한 공물을 바쳤구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "It simply confers greater swiftness upon one's steps."
msgstr "단순히 발걸음을 더욱 빨라지게 하는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "During the medieval era, this type of lance was employed for jousting."
msgstr "중세시대에는 이런 종류의 창으로 마상창시합을 행했지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "A feast fit for a festival!"
msgstr "축제에 걸맞는 만찬이구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Not fit for human consumption."
msgstr "인간이 섭취하기에는 부적합해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "I do enjoy a snack now and then."
msgstr "나도 가끔은 간식을 즐길 줄 안단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "It provides ample reading light."
msgstr "책을 읽을 만큼 충분히 밝아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "It appears my reading light has run out."
msgstr "독서등이 꺼진 것 같구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "It would look quite nice right over there."
msgstr "저기다 두면 상당히 잘 어울릴 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "It provides ample reading light."
msgstr "책을 읽을 만큼 충분히 밝아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "It appears my reading light has run out."
msgstr "독서등이 꺼진 것 같구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "It would look quite nice right over there."
msgstr "저기다 두면 상당히 잘 어울릴 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah. Silent, for now."
msgstr "아. 조용하구나. 일단은."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "Now now, let's not get too rough!"
msgstr "자자, 너무 과하게 하지들은 마시고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "Let's build this far away from my reading area, shall we?"
msgstr "일단 나 책 읽는 곳에서는 좀 멀리 두자꾸나. 알았지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "Putting carrots in your dessert does not make it healthy, I'm afraid."
msgstr "디저트에 당근을 넣는다고 건강에 좋은 건 아니란다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "\"Blue\" is an odd adjective for a flavor, but I can't disagree."
msgstr "\"파란색\" 맛이라는 표현이 이상하긴 하다만, 틀린 묘사라고는 못 하겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "What a fascinating confection!"
msgstr "참 흥미로운 과자구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "Cakes on a stick, what next?"
msgstr "떡으로 만든 꼬치라, 또 뭐가 나올라고?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Oh dear."
msgstr "오 이런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid ""
"The expression on this edifice suggests an offering of food may be "
"appropriate."
msgstr "이 건축물이 표현하는 바를 보아하니 음식을 바치는 게 적절할 게야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "We must show our appreciation to the local lagomorphs."
msgstr "이 지역 토끼들에게 감사의 뜻을 전해야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid ""
"Traditionally, being struck with a glove implies a challenge to a duel."
msgstr "예로부터 장갑으로 때리는 것은 결투 신청을 의미했단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Carbonized. Pity."
msgstr "탄화됐구나. 이런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "Delightful!"
msgstr "마음에 드는구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid ""
"One of those whippersnappers should find themselves useful and construct "
"this."
msgstr "젊은 놈의 것들이 좀 나서서 조립하고 할 것이지 원."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Somehow most of our things get reduced to carbon."
msgstr "어째서인지 많은 것들이 탄화되어 버리는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It requires a meat sacrifice of the monster variety."
msgstr "괴물류의 고기를 제물로 바쳐야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The appropriate offering was made."
msgstr "적절한 공물을 바쳤구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
msgid "A surface dwelling worm. Interesting."
msgstr "지상에 서식하는 땅굴벌레구나. 흥미로워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "The fire was overwhelming."
msgstr "화마에 압도당했구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "A golden offering is necessary."
msgstr "딱 맞는 공물을 바쳐야만 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "A special representation of wildcats."
msgstr "특별하게 묘사한 들고양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "A rare occurrence. I don't know what that is."
msgstr "흔치 않은 일이구나. 나도 모르는 게 있다니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "This crop appears to be in good health."
msgstr "아주 건강하게 잘 자라고 있는 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "It seems to be suffering from two different stressors at once."
msgstr "두 가지 스트레스 원인 때문에 고통을 겪는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "These grow best when surrounded by others of its particular species."
msgstr "이들은 다른 동종 식물과 같이 자랄 때 가장 잘 자란단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "I should stimulate its growth with some conversation."
msgstr "대화를 좀 나눠서 성장을 촉진해야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "I'll have to remove some of those troublesome weeds."
msgstr "골치 아픈 잡초를 좀 제거해야 할 것 같구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "It could use a little hydration."
msgstr "수분을 조금 제공하면 좋을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "It requires more nutrient-rich soil."
msgstr "토양에 양분이 더 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid ""
"The density of plants should be reduced to avoid competition for nutrients."
msgstr "양분 경쟁을 피하려면 식물 밀도를 줄여야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "I'm afraid this plant might not be in season."
msgstr "이 식물은 제철이 아닌 것 같구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "It appears to be suffering from quite a variety of stressors."
msgstr "아주 많은 스트레스 원인에 고통을 받는 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Seems it's about to ignite from the heat."
msgstr "곧 열에 의해 점화될 것 같구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "I can't see in the dark."
msgstr "어둠 속에선 앞을 볼 수 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "Al dente."
msgstr "살짝 딱딱하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "I feel as though I've been wrapped in a cozy blanket."
msgstr "마치 아늑한 이불에 싸여진 듯한 느낌이구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "We've failed."
msgstr "실패하고 말았구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "It was too long on the fire."
msgstr "불 위에 너무 오래 있었던 게야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "That was not a viable recipe."
msgstr "가능한 레시피가 아니었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "We best be on our way. Ta!"
msgstr "우린 이제 가는 게 좋겠구나. 그럼 안녕!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE"
msgid "I know I saw that fancy bird guy around here."
msgstr "분명 그 멋부린 새놈이 여기 어디로 갔단 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN"
msgid "Anyone home? ...Guess not."
msgstr "누구 있어? ...없나 보네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
msgid "Hey. Hey. Hey. Hey. I'm gonna keep going until you answer me!"
msgstr "야. 야. 야. 야! 너 대답 안 하면 계속 한다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "It'd be more fun with more kitcoons."
msgstr "킷쿤들이 더 많으면 훨씬 재밌을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "This place doesn't have a ton of hiding spots..."
msgstr "숨을 곳이 많지도 않은 것 같은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid "They look tired. Let's play again tomorrow!"
msgstr "지쳤나 보네. 내일 또 놀자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I can't even burn it!"
msgstr "태워서 없앨 수도 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "Nah, it looks better on me."
msgstr "아니다, 그냥 지금이 낫겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "Aww, looks like they all left."
msgstr "아오, 다 갔나 보네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "Just some robot stuff."
msgstr "암튼 로봇 물건이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
msgid "Whatever. Wurt can deal with them."
msgstr "남이사 워트가 알아서 하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE"
msgid "Sorry. Wrong Bernie. As you were."
msgstr "미안. 내 버니가 아니었네. 원래 그랬지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW"
msgid "Hey, don't I need a pillow first?"
msgstr "잠깐만, 일단 베개가 있어야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER"
msgid "Phew! That's too strong."
msgstr "아우! 너무 독하잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW"
msgid "Hey! Quit doing whatever you're doing and look at this!"
msgstr "야! 하던 것 좀 그만하고 여기 좀 보라고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "Ughhhh, nooo... I don't feel good."
msgstr "으으, 안되겠는데... 몸이 안 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "Aww, someone did that one already!"
msgstr "에이, 누가 벌써 해 버렸잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "Pfft, that wouldn't work with glass in the way."
msgstr "쯧, 유리에 써 봤자 소용 없다구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION"
msgid "I hate waiting."
msgstr "난 기다리는 거 싫은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I've already got one!"
msgstr "이미 한 마리 있다고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "I can't place anything from atop this big lout!"
msgstr "이 덩치 녀석 위에서 뭘 놓으라는 건데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON"
msgid "Wait... you're not my ticoon!"
msgstr "잠깐만... 내 호쿤이 아니잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE"
msgid "I wasn't too slow, it was too fast."
msgstr "이게 내가 느린 탓이야? 저게 빠른 거지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
msgid "What the heck, fire! It's me!"
msgstr "아, 뭐야! 이 불 자식아, 나라고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE"
msgid "That pumpkin is occupied."
msgstr "누가 호박을 쓰고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED"
msgid "My beast is too flamable for that kind of fun."
msgstr "그거 하다가는 요 녀석도 불타기 좋아서."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS"
msgid "I need more embers! Heh. Better get back to burning."
msgstr "불씨가 더 필요해! 헤. 불장난 좀 더 해볼까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS"
msgid "There is nothing scary to burn nearby."
msgstr "태울 만한 무서운 게 없는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN"
msgid "I need to give it a moment."
msgstr "잠깐 쉬고 하자고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "That's way better than some dumb dresses!"
msgstr "멍청한 옷들보다는 저게 더 재미있지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Nah, too much effort."
msgstr "아냐, 너무 수고스러운 일이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "Stop hogging it, I wanna dress up too!"
msgstr "너만 쓰기냐, 나도 옷 좀 갈아입자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT"
msgid "Just a wild guess, but I might need to hitch up a beefalo first."
msgstr "그냥 대충 짐작인데, 비팔로를 데려와서 묶어둬야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR"
msgid "It might help if my beefalo had more hair."
msgstr "내 비팔로 몸에 털이 더 많아야겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL"
msgid "Fully charged, yes!"
msgstr "꽉 찼네, 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE"
msgid "Ugh. No charge left!"
msgstr "윽. 충전이 안 남았잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
