msgstr "방금 녀석이 마지막이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE_TEAM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE_TEAM"
