msgstr "이거 태워도 돼?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
