msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "No flame, no real heat... what fun is that?"
msgstr "불꽃도 없고, 열기도 없고... 무슨 재미지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Ugh, you sneaky jerk!!"
msgstr "윽, 이 얍삽한 자식!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
