msgstr "난 세상이 불타는 걸 보고 싶지만 차는 시원했으면 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "Healthy? Well, that's no fun."
msgstr "건강? 재미없게 진짜."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
