msgstr "이거 태우면 안 될까?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "I love a warm glow."
msgstr "난 따스한 불빛이 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
