msgstr "너 왤케 작고 하찮냐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "A lump of coal would be really useful, actually!"
msgstr "석탄 좀 있으면 도움이 되겠는데 말이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Ha! I wouldn't wanna get smacked with that thing!"
msgstr "하! 저걸로 후드려 맞지는 않았으면 좋겠네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "Nothing says \"Open Me\" quite like a lock!!"
msgstr "자물쇠라니, 대놓고 열어달란 거잖아!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "It's a pony!"
msgstr "조랑말이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It looks pretty worn down."
msgstr "많이 낡은 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING"
msgid "That's right, you follow me!"
msgstr "그래, 날 따라오라고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
msgid "Who's bossing you around?"
msgstr "네 두목이 누구길래?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "What is your problem, horse?"
msgstr "뭐가 문제야, 이 말대가리야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "It's dead. Shall I do the honors?"
msgstr "죽었네. 뭐 명복이라도 빌어줘야 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "We will be great friends!"
msgstr "우린 좋은 친구가 될 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "He sure looks warm..."
msgstr "확실히 따뜻해 보여..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "Sweet and rubbery."
msgstr "달콤하고 질겨."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "Stay back, you big jerk!"
msgstr "저리 가, 이 덩치만 큰 찌끄레기야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "The holidays came early this year!"
msgstr "올해는 그 날이 좀 일찍 온 모양이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "Fire is not meant to be contained like this!"
msgstr "불은 이렇게 담아만 두면 안 된다고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "No skimping on the sour cream!"
msgstr "사워크림을 아끼면 안 되겠지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Nothing's gonna get through that!"
msgstr "무엇도 뚫을 수 없는 갑옷!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "That armor looks pretty safe."
msgstr "이 갑옷은 꽤 안전해 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "This armor isn't very good."
msgstr "그리 좋은 갑옷은 아닌 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "It barely does anything."
msgstr "안 입은 거나 마찬가지잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "This armor will stop a blow or two."
msgstr "한두 대 정도는 막아주겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "Good for smackin' stuff."
msgstr "뭔가 팰 때는 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "I could do neat stuff more often with that."
msgstr "멋진 동작을 더 자주 할 수 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
