msgstr "오오, 나 가질래!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "It's a feather crown!"
msgstr "깃털 왕관이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
