msgstr "불이야! 불이야! 불이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "That's a great wreath!"
msgstr "멋진 화관이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "I don't even wanna burn it!"
msgstr "태우고 싶지도 않아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
