msgstr "으으으, 조그만 팔이 돋아났잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
