msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD"
msgid "Ever considered making your ammo a little more flammable?"
msgstr "좀 더 잘 타는 걸로 만들어보는 건 어때?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Oh yeah. That's the stuff."
msgstr "그래. 바로 이거지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY"
msgid "Ever considered making your ammo a little more flammable?"
msgstr "좀 더 잘 타는 걸로 만들어보는 건 어때?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL"
msgid "Ever considered making your ammo a little more flammable?"
msgstr "좀 더 잘 타는 걸로 만들어보는 건 어때?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK"
msgid "Ever considered making your ammo a little more flammable?"
