msgstr "나 농담 아니고 저 녀석은 태워버려야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Now's the perfect time to burn it."
msgstr "녀석을 태우기에 절호의 기회야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "Well it might not work, but at least it makes noise!"
msgstr "뭐, 소용은 없다고 해도, 소리는 잘 나잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "Get over here!"
msgstr "이리로 와!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "He had it coming."
msgstr "자업자득이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe I could kill it... with FIRE."
msgstr "죽일 수도 있겠는데... 불만 있으면."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "Maybe I should just leave that one alone."
msgstr "아무래도 저 녀석은 가만히 둬야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "Get outta the water so I can burn you!"
msgstr "불태워 주게 물 밖으로 나오렴!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "Nu-uh, I'm not putting that thing anywhere near my face."
msgstr "됐거든요, 내 얼굴에 갖다 대기 싫네요!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Gross."
msgstr "징그러워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "At least it's still flammable."
msgstr "적어도 아직 태울 수는 있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's like floating fire!"
msgstr "떠 다니는 불 같아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "It feels flammable."
msgstr "불에 잘 탈 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "Alright, I get the message! I'll stay away!"
msgstr "그래, 뭔 말인지 알겠어! 저리 가 있을게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It has no idea where it's going."
msgstr "정처 없이 떠돌아 다니네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "It feels flammable."
msgstr "불에 잘 탈 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's like colorful sparks!"
msgstr "예쁜 불꽃 같아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "It feels flammable."
msgstr "불에 잘 탈 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "No substitute for a good torch."
msgstr "횃불을 대신할 정도는 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "Boo! Hissss!"
msgstr "에비! 훠이!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "It's so beautiful!"
msgstr "너무 아름다워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "This magic stuff is easy!"
msgstr "이 마법 도구 쓰기 쉽네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Always whirling! Swirling towards destruction!"
msgstr "언제나 빙글빙글! 휘몰아치는 파멸이여!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "Gross! I told you we shoulda burned it!"
msgstr "맙소사! 태워버려야 한다고 내가 말했잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "What's a weird table doing out here? Let's burn it!"
msgstr "저 이상한 탁자는 왜 여깄는 거야? 태워버리자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "What's a weird table doing out here? Let's burn it!"
msgstr "저 이상한 탁자는 왜 여깄는 거야? 태워버리자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "Gross! I told you we shoulda burned it!"
msgstr "맙소사! 태워버려야 한다고 내가 말했잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "Rocks are boring."
msgstr "바위는 따분해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "More boring rocks."
msgstr "또 따분한 바위네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "I brought you back so I could beat you up!"
msgstr "네가 살아났단 건 내가 널 때릴 수도 있단 거지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "It's just bones and shadow."
msgstr "뼈랑 그림자 밖에 없네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "Yuck, it's barely even alive."
msgstr "우웩, 이건 거의 산 것도 아니잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "Ha! Those dumb monkeys left a map to their treasure!"
msgstr "하! 멍청한 원숭이 녀석들, 자기들 보물 지도도 놓고 갔네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Looks about the same."
msgstr "비슷해 보이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that supposed to be something?"
msgstr "저게 도대체 물건이긴 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "Such a nice statue. Shame if something were to happen to it."
msgstr "정말 멋진 조각상이야. 무슨 일이라도 생기면 아깝겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "That poor statue's covered in flammable vines! Whatever should I do?"
msgstr "불쌍하게도 잘 타게 생긴 덩굴에 뒤덮였어! 뭘 해야 할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "A big stone nerd."
msgstr "큰 바위 얼굴 하고는."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's an okay statue, I guess."
msgstr "그럭저럭 괜찮은 조각상 같네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "Yikes. I'd cover that up too if I were her."
msgstr "이크. 나 같으면 저것도 가렸을걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "She hasn't put her face on for the day yet."
msgstr "아직 오늘 외출 전에 화장을 안 했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "A brazier would be nicer."
msgstr "화로였으면 더 좋았겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "Make a spark, it'll still burn."
msgstr "불꽃을 일으켜봐, 계속 탈 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Check out how fast I can spin it!!"
msgstr "내가 이거 얼마나 빨리 돌리는지 봐!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "Can't sail without that."
msgstr "이거 없이는 항해할 수 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It's pokey!"
msgstr "따끔해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "That definitely will not burn."
msgstr "저건 분명 절대 안 타겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "You can sit there. That chair will not spontaneously combust."
msgstr "앉든 말든 하라고. 자연발화할 걱정도 없으니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not sure how to feel about non-flammable furniture."
msgstr "불연성 가구라니 감정이 참 복잡하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "I'm not sure how to feel about non-flammable furniture."
msgstr "불연성 가구라니 감정이 참 복잡하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "Only thing left to do is melt it down. I'll stoke up the furnace!"
msgstr "이제 녀석을 녹일 일만 남았네. 화로는 내가 켤게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "It frees up my time to burn things."
msgstr "덕분에 불장난 할 시간이 더 생겨."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "A hat made of straw. To think, it could've been tinder."
msgstr "짚으로 만든 모자야. 생각해 보면, 불쏘시개로도 쓸 수 있었겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "It's still not a bird, but it's sure stuffed like one!"
msgstr "나뭇가지도 아니고, 나뭇가지보다 훨씬 푸짐해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "Out of the turkey and into my stomach!"
msgstr "칠면조 뱃속에서 내 뱃속으로!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "It's been picked."
msgstr "뽑혔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED"
msgid "Mmm... So dry. So flammable."
msgstr "으음... 잘 말랐네. 잘 타겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "It's a small, unburned plant."
msgstr "작고 아직 불타지 않은 식물이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "We're keeping it."
msgstr "저건 가지고 있자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Sooo... I can burn it now, right?"
msgstr "그래서... 이제 태워도 돼?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Aw, c'mon!"
msgstr "아, 좀!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Bet I could cram a lot more stuff in there."
msgstr "저 안에 더 많은 물건을 쑤셔넣을 수 있겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "I don't wanna be here when that thing finally breaks."
msgstr "내가 여깄을 때 저게 부서지지만 않았으면 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "I guess I'll have to keep an eye out for falling rocks again."
msgstr "아무래도 다시 돌 안 맞게 조심해야겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "It's nice not having to worry about rocks falling on my head."
msgstr "머리에 돌 맞을 걱정 안 해도 되서 다행이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "I don't wanna be here when that thing finally breaks."
msgstr "내가 여깄을 때만은 안 부서졌으면 좋겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Somebody should really repair this."
msgstr "누가 진짜 이것 좀 고쳐 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Cool. Wonder if it will burn."
msgstr "멋진데. 이것도 불이 붙으려나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Hmm. That looks suspiciously like work."
msgstr "흐음. 수상할 정도로 일거리 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Hmm. That looks suspiciously like work."
msgstr "흐음. 수상할 정도로 일거리 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "Ugh. This is old person food!"
msgstr "윽. 완전 노친네 취향이잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "Not as nice as a flaming vest, but it'll do."
msgstr "발열조끼보다는 별로라도 따뜻하기는 하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr "그거 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "What's so great about it? It's just leaf juice."
msgstr "뭐가 그렇게 대단한 건데? 그냥 이파리 우린 거잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "It's okay, but now I really want a fire sword."
msgstr "나쁘진 않은데, 진짜 불 칼이었으면 좋았겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Now I'm really feeling the holiday spirit!"
msgstr "이래야 진짜 명절 분위기가 살지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "Are we having company?"
msgstr "손님이 왔나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "Looks so good I almost don't want to burn it."
msgstr "너무 예뻐서 태우기 아까운걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Oops, wrong food. Burn the mistake."
msgstr "이런, 잘못 놨네. 그냥 태워버리자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "I usually like my stuff in a state of organized chaos."
msgstr "내가 정리한 게 마구잡이인 것 같아도 나름 자리가 있다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "Who even reads fishing magazines? Uh, apart from me right now..."
msgstr "누가 낚시 잡지라도 읽는 거야? 으, 누군지 몰라도 앞으로 말 걸지 마..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "Gross, it looks full of bugs."
msgstr "으윽, 안에 벌레 투성이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "Sugary things burn great, but best not waste food."
msgstr "단 음식은 잘 타지만, 음식을 낭비하면 안 되지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "I don't think it wants to be friends."
msgstr "친구가 되고 싶지는 않은가 본데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "Does it like fire?"
msgstr "불을 좋아할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "Fire makes them so much better."
msgstr "불을 가해줬더니 착해졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Needs more fire!"
msgstr "불이 더 필요해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "Arise, my phoenix!"
msgstr "일어나라, 나의 불사조야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Is there such a thing as too much fire?"
msgstr "진짜 불이 과할 수가 있단 말이야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "How long is this going to take?"
msgstr "이거 얼마나 걸리려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "I'm getting tired of waiting."
msgstr "슬슬 기다리기 지쳤어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "That egg could use some fire!"
msgstr "저 알한테 불 맛 좀 보여 줘야겠는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "The nest is empty."
msgstr "둥지가 비었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "It still has that birdy crunch to it."
msgstr "아직도 그 요상한 껍데기가 있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "It's like a little bit of fire in my mouth!"
msgstr "입 안에 불을 넣은 것 같아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "I feel like he understands."
msgstr "얘는 날 이해해주는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "He sure eats a lot."
msgstr "확실히 많이 먹네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "All you do is eat and sleep."
msgstr "네가 하는 건 먹고 자는 것밖에 없구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Don't look at me! Get your own food."
msgstr "쳐다보지 마! 네 음식은 네가 챙겨."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "It needs something more."
msgstr "뭔가 더 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "I can feel the magic!"
msgstr "마법이 느껴져!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "I just want to see this world burn."
msgstr "난 그냥 이 세상이 불타는 걸 보고 싶을 뿐이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "I like the way the symbols glow."
msgstr "문양이 빛나는 게 마음에 들어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "Needs to be unlocked somehow."
msgstr "어떻게든 잠금을 풀어야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "I'm making a monstrosity!"
msgstr "난 지금 흉물을 만들고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "It feels warm."
msgstr "따뜻한 느낌이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "What's this part good for?"
msgstr "이건 어디에 쓰는 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "Perhaps it could be melted into a more pleasing shape."
msgstr "어쩌면 녹여서 더 보기 좋게 만들 수 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "This is too precious to burn!"
msgstr "이건 태우기 너무 아까워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "It's quite a rush to use."
msgstr "사용하기 좀 까다로워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "Well, I've still got my badges."
msgstr "뭐, 아무튼 배지 다 땄다니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "I got all the badges in Girl Scouts."
msgstr "난 걸스카우트 배지를 다 땄었다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "Not at all cuddly."
msgstr "전혀 귀엽지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "It's pointy and slimy."
msgstr "뾰족한데다 미끌거리기까지 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Ewwwww."
msgstr "으으으으으."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "I hear little digging sounds."
msgstr "땅 파는 소리가 작게 들렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "It's quivering."
msgstr "흔들리고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Awwww, they want hugs!"
msgstr "아이구, 안아달라는구만!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "What a smell! Light a match next time!"
msgstr "냄새 한 번 독하네! 다음엔 성냥 한 번 켜 봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "I hope it does fireworks instead of rainbows next time."
msgstr "다음엔 무지개 말고 불꽃놀이가 나왔으면 좋겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "Oh yuck, it looks all gross inside!"
msgstr "아 토 나와, 속에 완전 징그럽게 생겼네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "Oooh... Aaah..."
msgstr "오오... 아아..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "What horrors will you unleash upon our world?"
msgstr "얼마나 무시무시한 걸 이 세상에 풀어놓으려고 그러니?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "Looks like the fun's over."
msgstr "재밌는 건 끝났나 보네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "Oooh, maybe it's getting ready to explode!"
msgstr "우와, 터지려고 그러나 봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Do it again! Again!"
msgstr "한 번 더! 한 번 더!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "It'll be a nice place to put my stuff while I'm out burning."
msgstr "불장난 하러 갈 동안에 물건 넣어놓기 딱 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "Please have fireworks inside, pleeeease!"
msgstr "제발 속에 불꽃놀이였으면, 제발제발제발!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "I don't think it would burn."
msgstr "이건 불이 안 붙을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "I should try this one on Webber."
msgstr "웨버한테 한 번 써 봐야겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "This Thulecite crumbled to pieces."
msgstr "이 툴레사이트는 작은 조각으로 허물어졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "It smells like burnt hair!"
msgstr "머리카락 탄 내 나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "I don't need your help!"
msgstr "네 도움 같은 거 필요 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "What a fancy, tired looking catcoon. Maybe he's a businessman."
msgstr "참 멋지고 피곤하게 생긴 캣쿤이네. 무슨 회사원인감."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "Drat, looks like someone beat me to it."
msgstr "젠장, 누가 먼저 찾았잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "There's a kitcoon around here, I can feel it..."
msgstr "근처에 킷쿤이 있어. 감이 온다니까..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "Looks like he's not findin' anything."
msgstr "아무 것도 안 찾는 모양인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "Haha, he got you!"
msgstr "하하, 찾았네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "Don't think his nose can sniff that far."
msgstr "냄새를 그렇게 멀리서 맡을 수는 없나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "Looks like he's onto something!"
msgstr "뭔가 찾은 모양이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "That's not my guy."
msgstr "내가 안 데리고 다니는 녀석이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "Stupid weed."
msgstr "멍청한 잡초 같으니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "I guess that weed was good for something."
msgstr "잡초도 어딘가 쓸모가 있기는 한가 보다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED"
msgid "Mmm... So dry. So flammable."
msgstr "으음... 잘 말랐네. 잘 타겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's covered in nasty warts and fungus!!"
msgstr "온통 징그러운 버섯에 사마귀 투성이야!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "Woah! It's packing a punch now!"
msgstr "우와! 맞으면 아프겠는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "It's a hole, what do you want from me?"
msgstr "구멍이잖아, 그래서 어쩌라는 건데?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "A mutant mushroom! I want it!"
msgstr "돌연변이 버섯이잖아! 나 가질래!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "What is that? It's smelly."
msgstr "저게 뭐지? 냄새가 나는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "Cutting these is a pain."
msgstr "이걸 자르는 건 고통이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "It just needed a couple minutes on the fire."
msgstr "불 위에 잠깐만 올려놓으면 됐을 뿐이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Ugh, it's going to be even harder to cut now..."
msgstr "윽, 이제 자르기 훨씬 어렵겠네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "그냥 씨앗 더미야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "A top hat and a lighter, a perfect combination."
msgstr "여기에 라이터만 있으면 완벽한 조합이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "Aww, I thought I saw smoke, but it's just Max's shadow gunk."
msgstr "에이, 연기가 아니라 맥스 녀석의 그림자 찌꺼기였잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "Fire is so pretty."
msgstr "불꽃이 너무 예쁜걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "Get into my pie hole!"
msgstr "내 입으로 들어오렴!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Walking's for suckers."
msgstr "걷는 건 개나 줘버리라지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Magic stuff."
msgstr "신비로운 물건이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "I didn't wanna walk, anyway."
msgstr "걷기 싫던 차였는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Yuck. It smells like sulfur."
msgstr "우웩. 황 냄새 나잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "Crunch crunch crunch."
msgstr "오독 오독 오독."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "You can't push me around."
msgstr "어디 괴롭혀보시지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "Electrical doo-dah, doo-dah."
msgstr "전기 장-찌, 장-찌."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "It's a bit passive aggressive, but it'll work."
msgstr "조금 방어적이지만, 잘 작동할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "It's got really sharp thorns."
msgstr "가시가 엄청 날카롭네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "Jeez, that was rude!"
msgstr "아오, 싸가지 없는 놈!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Do starfish usually have so many teeth?"
msgstr "보통 불가사리에 저렇게 이빨이 많던가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "It would be better with fire."
msgstr "불까지 더해진다면 금상첨화겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "I know exactly what kind of jerk leaves this lying around!"
msgstr "어떤 놈이 이딴 거 깔았는지는 딱 보면 알지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "The trunk burned nicely."
msgstr "상자가 멋있게 그을렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a trunk for my junk."
msgstr "내 잡동사니를 넣어둘 상자야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "A big trunk for all my junk."
msgstr "잡다한 게 다 들어가는 커다란 상자야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Dirty trick!"
msgstr "치사하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "Moooooooooooooove."
msgstr "움직여어어어어어어어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "Eww tree gunk!"
msgstr "으으, 나무 끈끈이라니!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING"
msgid "Mm. Yeah."
msgstr "음. 좋은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED"
msgid "It's being a rock."
msgstr "돌이 되고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "I know what to do."
msgstr "뭘 해야 할지 알겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING"
msgid "Still a bit young to burn."
msgstr "불타기엔 조금 어리긴 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "You're still young. Burn you later."
msgstr "넌 아직 어려. 나중에 태워주지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "It's three times as pokey."
msgstr "세 배로 뾰족해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "That's how you play marbles, right? By burning them?"
msgstr "구슬놀이란 게 이런 거 맞지? 태우는 거?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Hey Maxwell, I think you dropped these!"
msgstr "야 맥스웰, 이거 떨어뜨린 것 같은데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Ooh, I wonder if he has a flamethrower!"
msgstr "우와, 화염방사기도 있으려나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "I bet Wilson would enjoy dissecting this."
msgstr "윌슨이 해부하고 싶어 하겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "She looks like she was forged in flame."
msgstr "불로 달궈 만든 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "They put a bird on it."
msgstr "여기에 새를 그려놓았네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "What is it with megalomaniacs and chess?"
msgstr "과대망상 환자들이랑 체스랑 무슨 상관이지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "What is it with megalomaniacs and chess?"
msgstr "과대망상 환자들이랑 체스랑 무슨 상관이지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "Metal bends when it gets nice and hot."
msgstr "금속은 충분히 열을 받으면 휘어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "I bet Wigfrid would be into this."
msgstr "분명 위그프리드가 좋아할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "Useful only for kindling."
msgstr "불쏘시개로나 쓸만하겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "A cheap fake. It probably doesn't even burn properly."
msgstr "싸구려 모조품이야. 제대로 타지도 않겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "This looks a little like a fire iron."
msgstr "무슨 화로용 연장 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "When I crank it Wes pretends to ride unicycle circles around me."
msgstr "이거 돌리고 있으면 웨스가 옆에서 외발자전거 타는 흉내 내면서 돌더라고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "I could use this as a very long fuse..."
msgstr "아주 기다란 심지로 쓸 수 있겠는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "It looks like it might melt in a fire."
msgstr "아마 불 속에서 녹은 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "I don't want Ms. Wickerbottom to be sad. Let's burn it!"
msgstr "위커바텀 씨가 슬퍼하시지 않았으면 해. 빨리 태워버리자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "I stuck one down Wolfgang's unitard when he wasn't looking. Haha."
msgstr "볼프강 안 볼 때 걔 쫄쫄이에 한 개 붙여놨지. 하하."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "I would have roasted it."
msgstr "나 같으면 구웠을걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "I want to stick it in a fire!"
msgstr "불에 집어넣고 싶어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "Chess is for pompous dorks."
msgstr "체스는 있는 척하는 얼간이들이나 하는 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "Chess is for pompous dorks."
msgstr "체스는 있는 척하는 얼간이들이나 하는 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "Why use a knife when you can use fire?"
msgstr "불이 있는데 칼을 쓸 필요가 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "Probably the most boring game ever invented."
msgstr "아마 세상에 나온 게임 중에서는 제일 재미없을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "Probably the most boring game ever invented."
msgstr "아마 세상에 나온 게임 중에서는 제일 재미없을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "Just a big dumb ball."
msgstr "그냥 크고 멍청한 공이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "Ewww! Who would ever wear that!"
msgstr "우웨엑! 저걸 누가 껴!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "Ughhh! That's so nasty!"
msgstr "으으윽! 완전 역겨워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Hey Wes! Dare you to drink the last bit!"
msgstr "야 웨스! 남은 거 한 모금 마셔봐!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Pfft, they're not even sharp."
msgstr "힛, 날카롭지도 않네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Looks like firewood to me."
msgstr "내가 보기엔 장작 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "It makes stuff look small no matter which way I turn it."
msgstr "어디로 돌려 보든 더 작게 보이는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "Who needs just one glove?"
msgstr "장갑이 한 짝만 필요한 사람이 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "He looks like he was forged in flame."
msgstr "불로 달궈 만든 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "Snails are gross!"
msgstr "달팽이는 역겨워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "Ooo, it's warm."
msgstr "오오오, 따뜻해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "I don't like snakes."
msgstr "난 뱀 안 좋아해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Yeesh. I can feel the nostalgia dripping off it."
msgstr "으으으. 추억이 묻어나오는구만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "It's just junk."
msgstr "그냥 고물이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "It's got kind of a dumb face, huh?"
msgstr "좀 멍청하게 생긴 얼굴이네 그래?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "I never take my pigtails out anyway."
msgstr "내 머리채를 없애먹기는 싫거든."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "Check out those tiny thrusters. Such explosive power!"
msgstr "이 작은 추진기 좀 봐. 이 폭발적인 힘!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "These wires get WX all frazzled. Heh heh."
msgstr "WX가 이거 보고 정신이 아주 너덜너덜해지더라고. 헤헤."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "Spinning the stick in the hole could start a fire. Thanks Girl Scouts!"
msgstr "구멍에 넣고 막대기를 돌리면 불을 붙일 수 있어. 고마워 걸스카우트!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "I've never liked bathing with water."
msgstr "난 물세례 같은 건 좋아한 적이 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "Cute as Wendy's lil nose."
msgstr "웬디의 쬐끄만 코처럼 귀엽네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "Heh... wasn't sure if that would work."
msgstr "헤... 이게 될 줄은 또 몰랐네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Who cares about weighing some dumb fish?"
msgstr "멍청하게 왜 물고기 무게 같은 건 잰다는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
msgid ""
"Weight: {weight}\n"
"Caught by: {owner}"
msgstr ""
"무게: {weight}\n"
"잡은 사람: {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid ""
"Weight: {weight}\n"
"Caught by: {owner}\n"
"How does it even fit in there?"
msgstr ""
"무게: {weight}\n"
"잡은 사람: {owner}\n"
"이게 대체 어떻게 들어간 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER"
msgid ""
"Weight: {weight}\n"
"Caught by: {owner}\n"
"Pfft, that wasn't even hard."
msgstr ""
"무게: {weight}\n"
"잡은 이: {owner}\n"
"훗, 어렵지도 않았다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY"
msgid ""
"Weight: {weight}\n"
"Caught by: {owner}\n"
"Read it and weep!"
msgstr ""
"무게: {weight}\n"
"잡은 사람: {owner}\n"
"보고 질질 짜시지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING"
msgid "Yeah, now we're talking!"
msgstr "그래, 이제야 말이 통하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT"
msgid "Aw, over already?"
msgstr "에이, 벌써 끝이야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC"
msgid "Oooh, that basket looks flammable!"
msgstr "우와, 저 바구니 엄청 잘 탈 것 같은데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM"
msgid ""
"Weight: {weight}\n"
"Harvested on day: {day}\n"
"Wow. Exciting."
msgstr ""
"무게: {weight}\n"
"수확일: {day}일차\n"
