msgstr "이제 말이 통하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "My Carrat's off the scale! I mean literally."
msgstr "측정 범위 밖이야! 말 그대로 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "A nice, scale-shaped pile of potential kindling."
msgstr "저울 모양의 잘 만든 예비 불쏘시개 더미야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "그냥 씨앗 한 줌이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "Oh wow, special seeds, how exciting."
msgstr "우와, 특별한 씨앗이라니, 참이나 기대된다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "It better be the only thing going into the water today."
msgstr "오늘은 물에 들어갈 게 이거뿐이었으면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Ooo, let's build an anchor."
msgstr "우우, 닻 좀 달아볼까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "좋았어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's hungry for charcoal."
msgstr "숯이 먹고 싶다는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "All hail the fire breather!"
msgstr "불의 숨결을 찬양하라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid ""
"It feels wrong to put it in the water... burning it after should even things"
" out."
msgstr "물에 넣는다니 뭔가 아닌 것 같은데... 불에도 넣으면 균형이 맞겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "I'm great at steering! I don't even crash that often!"
msgstr "나 배 잘 몰아! 그렇게 많이 부딪히지도 않는다고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "Can't sail without that."
msgstr "이거 없이는 항해할 수 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "Some kids got all the good stuff."
msgstr "세상에 어떤 애들은 좋은 거 다 누리는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "Tough looking horse."
msgstr "되게 튼튼해 보이는 말이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Don't look at me."
msgstr "내가 안 그랬다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What do you want, horsehead?"
msgstr "뭐 원하는 거 있냐, 말대가리?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Alright, now give!"
msgstr "좋아, 이제 내놔!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "Do I have to gallop?"
msgstr "꼭 말 흉내 내야 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "Those fancy knights must've had fun with this thing."
msgstr "저 뻔쩍뻔쩍 기사 녀석들 이걸로 재미 좀 봤겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "I'm gonna eat it all!"
msgstr "내가 몽땅 다 먹어버릴 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Nah. I'll feed it to something."
msgstr "됐어. 동물 먹이로나 써야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "A little snack to fill my belly."
msgstr "내 배를 채워줄 작은 간식이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "Everything looks better in the firelight."
msgstr "뭐든지 불빛이 나면 예뻐 보인다니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "Looks like it needs some more fire!"
msgstr "불을 좀 더 피워야겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "The more firelight around here, the better!"
msgstr "불은 많을수록 좋은 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "Everything looks better in the firelight."
msgstr "뭐든지 불빛이 나면 예뻐 보인다니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "Looks like it needs some more fire!"
msgstr "불을 좀 더 피워야겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "The more firelight around here, the better!"
msgstr "불은 많을수록 좋은 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Alright, who wants to get the stuffing knocked out of them?"
msgstr "좋아, 누구 베개 터질 때까지 싸울 사람?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "Yeah! Get 'em!!"
msgstr "좋아! 혼내줘!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "Oh, this'll be fun..."
msgstr "오, 이거 재밌겠는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
