msgstr "으으, 젤리로 된 왕눈알처럼 생겼잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
