msgstr "그래, 축제 상품이 뭐가 있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
