msgstr "저게 뭔지 모르겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
