msgstr "이거... 괜찮은 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
