msgstr "왜 그래? 외롭다거나 한 건 아니지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "What do you want from me?!"
msgstr "대체 나한테 뭘 원하는 건데?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "Ugh, do I really have to weed the garden again?"
msgstr "윽, 또 밭에 풀 뽑아야 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "Looking nice and crispy!"
msgstr "바삭하게 잘 말랐네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid ""
"Ms. Wickerbottom's always going on about nutrients in the soil. Maybe it "
"needs that."
msgstr "위커바텀 씨가 흙 속의 양분이랬나 뭐랬나. 암튼 그게 필요한가 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "These plants could use some more personal space."
msgstr "이 녀석들 개인 공간이 필요하겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "Guess it doesn't like the weather."
msgstr "지금 날씨가 맘에 안 드나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "Something's got it really upset."
msgstr "뭔가 되게 기분 상한 모양인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Hooray, it's about to light on fire!"
msgstr "야하, 불 나려 그러네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "I need more light!"
msgstr "빛이 더 필요해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "Ugh. Crunchy."
msgstr "윽. 오독거리잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
