msgstr "숨바꼭질 할 녀석들을 더 찾아야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
