msgstr "퉷!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
