#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER"
