msgstr "저건 대체 뭐야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX"
msgid "Sure hope the bossman doesn't mind me borrowing a few things."
msgstr "사장님이 내가 뭐 좀 빌려가도 상관 없어야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2"
msgid "Jackpot!"
msgstr "심봤다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Now I can track down the bossman's loot!"
msgstr "이제 사장님 보물을 찾아낼 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "I'd love to know the specs for those specs! Ha!"
msgstr "사양 좀 알 수 있으면 사양 않을 텐데! 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "Who's that good-looking gal!"
msgstr "이 이쁜이는 또 누구야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP"
msgid "That stuff can't be good for your health."
msgstr "몸에 좋을 리가 없을 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE"
msgid "Now I've got to clean all this up!"
msgstr "이제 이거 다 치워야 하게 생겼네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "The sweet taste of good planning."
msgstr "훌륭한 계획의 달콤함이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "I would eat them all in one sitting."
msgstr "싹 다 먹어버려야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE"
msgid "Folks underestimate how much good stuff you can find in a scrap pile."
msgstr "사람들이 고철더미에서 뭔 대단한 걸 찾느냐 하는데 모르고 하는 소리야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Hey, those are blueprints up there."
msgstr "잠깐만, 저 위에 저거 청사진이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC"
msgid "Who's in charge here? Someone could get hurt!"
msgstr "이거 누가 이래놨어? 사람 다치면 어쩌려고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
msgid "Nice and simple."
msgstr "간단하고 맛있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Now that's my kind of cooking."
msgstr "이런 게 내 취향의 요리지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "I'll try anything once."
msgstr "난 뭐든 먹어는 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "I'll stick with my bandana, thanks."
msgstr "마음은 고마운데, 난 그냥 내 반다나 쓸래."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "Well, that's not how I would have prepared it."
msgstr "음, 나 같으면 그렇게 조리하진 않을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "I kinda like the stuff!"
msgstr "이거 은근 마음에 드네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "Stay back, bug!"
msgstr "저리 가, 이 벌레 녀석!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "You can just calm right down."
msgstr "진정이나 좀 하셔 그래."

