msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "Back off, you lumbering lumber!"
msgstr "물러서, 이 나무-늘보야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "Not to my lichen. Ha!"
msgstr "소름 이끼 치는걸. 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "I've never taken a sick day in my life."
msgstr "난 살면서 병가 낸 적이 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "Not at all like the lightbulbs I'm used to."
msgstr "내가 알던 전구처럼은 전혀 안 생겼는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "I guess crabs can glow now, huh?"
msgstr "이젠 게도 빛이 난단 말이야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Neat little gizmo there."
msgstr "훌륭한 소도구네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "Doesn't even need a battery!"
msgstr "배터리도 필요 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Electrifying! Ha!"
msgstr "짜릿하네! 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "You and I are gonna get along."
msgstr "우린 잘 지낼 수 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "It's even more interesting up close."
msgstr "가까이서 보니 더 흥미로운데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "All charged up and nowhere to go."
msgstr "전기가 가득 모여 있는데 나갈 곳은 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "That's one way to get electricity."
msgstr "전기를 얻는 한 가지 방법이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "Nice kilt."
msgstr "킬트 멋진데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "Stop looking at me like that."
msgstr "그렇게 쳐다보지 마."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "Did that tree just move?"
msgstr "방금 나무가 움직인 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Oh hey! There's a little stick in there."
msgstr "이거 보소! 웬 작대기가 꽂혀 있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "Keep growin' little guy! I'm gonna decorate you."
msgstr "무럭무럭 자라라 꼬마야! 나중에 널 꾸며줄게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "Hey Warly? Can you just keep makin' this forever?"
msgstr "저기, 왈리? 이거 맨날 만들어 주면 안 될까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "That's some pretty fancy lookin' grub!"
msgstr "되게 화려하게 생긴 음식이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "I coulda built something with that."
msgstr "저걸로 뭔가 만들 수 있었을 텐데."

