msgstr "부자 좀 돼 봤으면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "You're alright for an axe."
msgstr "너 꽤 쓸만한 도끼네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
