msgstr "어떻게 여기까지 왔는지는 모르겠지만 잘했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "Hop along now, lil' freakshow."
msgstr "절로 가라, 이 괴물딱지야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "It should keep my noggin' nice and safe."
msgstr "내 머리통을 안전하게 지켜줄 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "That's tough stuff!"
msgstr "이거 되게 튼튼하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "Never hurts to keep a repair kit handy."
msgstr "편리한 수리 도구 좀 있으면 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "It's about the prettiest tripping hazard you'll ever see."
msgstr "뭔가 최고로 예쁜 낙상 위험물이라고 해야 하나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "That tear's a bit beyond what my trusty tape can fix."
msgstr "내 테이프로는 고치기 힘든 수준의 균열이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "It thinks this is its turf!"
msgstr "여기가 지 땅인 줄 아네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "You think you wanna tangle with me?"
msgstr "날 묶고 싶어서 안달인가 보지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
