msgstr "전혀 괜찮아 보이지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
