msgstr "이 대리석은 정말 화려한 걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
