msgstr "아주 작은 식물이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
