msgstr "그래, 더럽게 귀엽네 참."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Lots of excavation work around here."
msgstr "굴착 현장이 참 많군 그래."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING"
msgid "Guess it wasn't structurally sound."
msgstr "안정적인 구조가 아니었던 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Welp."
msgstr "이런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "How'd they build these with no thumbs?"
msgstr "엄지손가락도 없는데 어떻게 저런 걸 만든거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN"
msgid "It must play a thumpin' tune."
msgstr "뭔가 '묘'한 소리가 나겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST"
msgid "Mighty kind of them rabbits."
msgstr "저 토끼 녀석들 꽤나 대단한데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "Must be somethin' in the carrots."
msgstr "어디 당근을 잘못 먹었나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR"
msgid "Never thought of makin' weapons out of rabbit parts."
msgstr "토끼의 신체로 무기를 만든다는 건 생각도 못 했네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
msgid "What is your problem, rabbit?!"
msgstr "또 뭐가 문제인데, 이 토깽이야?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY"
msgid "Gotta catch me that rabbit!"
msgstr "저 토끼를 잡아야겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "Friendly lil' fella ain't he?"
msgstr "거 참 친근한 녀석이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT"
msgid "Very practical."
msgstr "아주 실용적이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT"
msgid "Dry as a daisy. That's the phrase, right?"
msgstr "복숭아꽃처럼 보송보송하게. 운율 좋지, 그치?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Must fire take everything I love?"
msgstr "내가 좋아하는 건 왜 다 불이 가져가는 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a mighty fine gadget."
msgstr "아주 훌륭한 장치네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
