msgstr "도구 좀 더 챙긴다고 나쁠 거 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD"
msgid "Just plain unsettlin'."
msgstr "께름찍하기 짝이 없네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO"
msgid "That's just plain fun!"
msgstr "그냥 재밌기만 하네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST"
