msgstr "춤 좀 춰 보실까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE"
msgid "She's a doozy."
msgstr "이거 명곡이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK"
msgid "Rather somber, ain't it?"
msgstr "노래가 좀 칙칙한데?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS"
msgid "Here we go."
msgstr "춤 좀 춰 보실까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END"
msgid "Not my cupa."
msgstr "딱히 내 스타일 아냐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS"
msgid "Gives me the heebie jeebies."
msgstr "소름이 돋는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN"
msgid "Here we go."
msgstr "춤 좀 춰 보실까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE"
