msgstr "이제 하나 더 만들어야겠네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
