msgstr "보수 좀 해야겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
