msgstr "언제쯤 먹는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Whoops! That doesn't go here."
msgstr "이런! 여기 놓는 게 아니네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Gotta keep your tools organized!"
msgstr "연장은 잘 정리해둬야 해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "Hey! This will come in real handy next time I go fishin'!"
msgstr "이야! 다음 번 낚시 갈 때 아주 도움이 되겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "Need the right tool for the job!"
msgstr "작업에 맞는 도구가 필요해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "Proper treats stick to your teeth."
msgstr "맛 좋은 간식은 이빨에 착착 붙는 법이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
