msgstr "넌 살았다! 볼프강이 구했다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED"
