msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH"
msgid "What is wrong, hair beast? Feeling not-so-mighty?"
msgstr "왜 그러니, 털소야? 어디 아프니?"

