msgstr "볼프강은 밥 먹고 낮잠 잔다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP"
