msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT"
msgid "Wolfgang will fall if try to open on top of hair cow!"
msgstr "털소 위에서 열려고 하다가는 볼프강 떨어진다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA"
