msgstr "안돼! 볼프강의 호박이!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NORMALTOMIGHTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NORMALTOMIGHTY"
