msgstr "밝은 빛이 있으면 볼프강 못 잔다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE"
