msgstr "자기에 너무 더워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE"
