msgstr "연습이었다! 볼프강 이제 실전이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY"
msgid "Seems no fish stew for dinner."
msgstr "저녁에 생선 스튜는 못 먹겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1"
msgid "Wolfgang can wait!"
msgstr "볼프강 기다릴 수 있다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2"
msgid "Wolfgang can wait a little longer."
msgstr "볼프강 좀 더 기다릴 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3"
msgid "Wolfgang getting bored."
msgstr "볼프강 이젠 좀 심심하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4"
msgid "Wolfgang would like fish to go on hook now."
msgstr "볼프강은 이제 물고기가 바늘에 걸렸으면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP"
