msgstr "물고기가 약한 실에 비해 너무 강력했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE"
