#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS"
