#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD"
msgid "Hat broke apart into tiny bits."
msgstr "모자를 작은 조각으로 부쉈다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED"
msgid "Old man brought big fancy thingamobob with him!"
msgstr "영감이 크고 멋진 뭔가를 가져왔어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD"
msgid "Is dead so quickly!"
msgstr "너무 빨리 죽었다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC"
msgid "Ha! Wolfgang's punches are mighty enough to shatter stone!"
msgstr "하! 볼프강의 주먹은 돌도 가루 만들 만큼 강력하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "Big tough ball back for more Wolfgang punches?"
msgstr "크고 튼튼한 공 녀석 볼프강한테 더 혼나려고 돌아왔나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT"
msgid "It is the prettiest of all!"
msgstr "제일 예쁜 녀석이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD"
msgid "Wolfgang has bad feeling..."
msgstr "볼프강 나쁜 예감 든다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC"
msgid "Sky stone is back from dead!"
msgstr "하늘 돌이 죽었다 살아났다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE"
msgid "Spiky wall can't stop Wolfgang!"
msgstr "뾰족한 벽은 볼프강을 막을 수 없다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3"
msgid "Sky stone is very mad!"
msgstr "하늘 돌이 정말 화났다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD"
msgid "Hmm... Wolfgang will smash it, just to be sure."
msgstr "흠... 볼프강은 이거 부술 거다. 혹시 모르니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB"
msgid "Old man should be careful, sky stone might wake up!"
msgstr "영감 조심해야 한다, 하늘 돌이 다시 깨어날지 모른다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP"
msgid "Wolfgang will smash sleepy stones!"
msgstr "볼프강은 졸린 돌을 부술 거다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "It is lot for Wolfgang to process!"
msgstr "저건 볼프강한테도 버겁다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "Is very pretty."
msgstr "엄청 예쁘다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR"
msgid "Is good for weightlift. Build muscle."
msgstr "쇠질할 때 좋다. 근육 생긴다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Is for making big boat weight."
msgstr "커다란 배 아령 만드는 데 쓰는 거다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM"
msgid "Even Wolfgang's mighty jaw can't bite into funny rock-fruit."
msgstr "이상하게 생긴 돌 과일은 볼프강의 강력한 턱으로도 베어물 수가 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION"
msgid "Eeep!"
msgstr "히이익!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED"
msgid "Is less gross, but still not look yummy."
msgstr "덜 징그럽지만 그래도 맛있어 보이진 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Rocky tree have big strong trunk like Wolfgang."
msgstr "돌나무 줄기는 볼프강처럼 크고 강하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP"
msgid "You give to us everything."
msgstr "아낌없이 주는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC"
msgid "Tree give Wolfgang sad feelings."
msgstr "볼프강 기분 우울하게 만든다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP"
msgid "Much better."
msgstr "훨씬 낫다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Little tree, grow mighty like Wolfgang!"
msgstr "작은 나무야, 볼프강처럼 강하게 자라렴!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "Maybe try again later, little one."
msgstr "나중에도 괜찮아, 꼬마야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "Little one don't like it here?"
msgstr "꼬마 여기 마음에 안 들어?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "Don't worry, little tree. Wolfgang find good home for you."
msgstr "걱정 마, 꼬마 나무야. 볼프강이 좋은 집 찾아줄게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED"
msgid "What does little seed want to be when it grow up?"
msgstr "작은 씨앗은 자라서 뭐가 되고 싶을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR"
msgid "Is nasty, creepy altar."
msgstr "징그럽고 소름돋는 제단이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN"
msgid "Is broken altar."
msgstr "망가진 제단이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK"
msgid "Too much violence for Wolfgang."
msgstr "볼프강한테도 너무 사납다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE"
msgid "Ugly, ugly, ugly."
msgstr "추해, 추해, 추해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK"
msgid "Animal went this way."
msgstr "동물이 이 길로 갔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES"
msgid "Is little squirmy sea bug."
msgstr "작고 꿈틀거리는 바다벌레다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC"
msgid "Scary monster is friend?"
msgstr "무서운 괴물이 친구야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY"
msgid "Monster is looking very scary!"
msgstr "괴물 무지 무서워 보인다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
