msgid "Is very pretty pillow."
msgstr "아주 예쁜 베개다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Is good thing Wolfgang has tough skin."
msgstr "볼프강 피부가 튼튼해서 다행이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Boom!"
msgstr "콰광!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD"
msgid "Ha! Little leafy green friend has made it better!"
msgstr "하! 작은 풀잎 친구가 더 좋게 만들었다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "Wolfgang crush into even smaller bones!"
msgstr "볼프강이 더 작은 뼈로 부숴버린다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP"
msgid "Wolfgang will be so mighty!"
msgstr "볼프강 엄청 강력해질 거다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "Is stew full of strong meat."
msgstr "튼튼한 고기가 가득한 스튜다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT"
msgid "Wolfgang will help brainlady build another!"
msgstr "볼프강이 똑똑한 여자 도와서 하나 더 만들게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Makes brainlady happy, Wolfgang will protect it!"
msgstr "똑똑한 여자 행복하게 한다. 볼프강이 지키겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES"
msgid "Is true, Wolfgang does not know much of ape culture."
msgstr "맞아, 볼프강은 양은 알아도 봉은 몰라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "Book is for the birds!"
msgstr "새들을 위한 책이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "Tiny book scares Wolfgang!"
msgstr "볼프강 작은 책 무섭다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "Wolfgang does not understand little letters."
msgstr "볼프강 작은 글자 못 읽는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE"
msgid "Wolfgang hopes is not explained in more big words..."
msgstr "볼프강 더 큰 말로 설명 안 했으면 좋겠다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH"
msgid "Pictures of fish make Wolfgang's belly rumble."
msgstr "물고기 그림 보니 볼프강 배 꼬르륵거린다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "Is look very hard to read."
msgstr "읽기 어려워 보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "Wolfgang rather grow muscle than flowers."
msgstr "볼프강 꽃보다는 근육을 키우고 싶다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE"
msgid "Little book makes food grow for Wolfgang."
msgstr "작은 책 볼프강에게 음식 길러준다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED"
msgid "Will thicker book grow thicker vegetables?"
msgstr "책이 두꺼우면 야채도 굵게 자라나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT"
msgid "Wolfgang likes the book light."
msgstr "볼프강은 책 등불 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
msgid "Wolfgang is starting to find liking for books."
msgstr "볼프강 점점 책이 좋아지는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON"
msgid "Wolfgang doesn't need book to know where moon is."
msgstr "볼프강은 달이 어딨는지 책 없어도 안다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN"
msgid "Wolfgang will keep umbrella, just in case."
msgstr "혹시 모르니까 우산 챙겨 다녀야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION"
msgid "Hmm, is heavy book, maybe good for lifting."
msgstr "흐음, 무거운 책이다. 운동할 때 좋을지도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE"
msgid "Wolfgang rather grow muscle than flowers."
msgstr "볼프강은 꽃보다 근육을 키우고 싶다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "Wolfgang's eyes feel heavy like dumbbells."
msgstr "볼프강 눈꺼풀이 아령처럼 무겁다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE"
msgid "But Wolfgang needs to feel the burn!"
msgstr "하지만 볼프강 열 올라야 해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "Wolfgang wants many foes to fight!"
msgstr "볼프강은 싸울 적 많았으면 좋겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB"
msgid "Eep!!"
msgstr "히익!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "Boom! A rang! Ha!"
msgstr "붐! 에랑! 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG"
msgid "Is not Wolfgang's size."
msgstr "볼프강한테 안 맞는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM"
