#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Is pretty flutterby!"
