msgstr "창조부 새야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING"
