msgstr "볼프강은 날카로운 식물을 좋아하지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
