msgstr "악! 작은 대포가 볼프강 놀래켰다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "Is time for celebration!"
msgstr "축하할 시간이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT"
msgid "Ah... reminds Wolfgang of circus days."
msgstr "아... 볼프강 서커스 시절 생각난다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER"
msgid "Is catching light? Wolfgang hopes it will share."
msgstr "빛을 모은다고? 볼프강한테도 나눠줬으면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT"
msgid "Ha! Is tiny and easy to make."
msgstr "하! 작고 만들기 쉽다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE"
msgid "Little egg ride."
msgstr "작은 달걀 달린다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT"
msgid "Ha! Is tiny and easy to make."
msgstr "하! 작고 만들기 쉽다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, is tiny statue!"
msgstr "아, 쬐끄만 조각상이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE"
msgid "Very special, this one."
msgstr "특별한 거다, 이거."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON"
msgid "Wolfgang has not seen many like it!"
msgstr "볼프강 이런 거 자주 못 봤다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT"
msgid "What is in tiny secret box?"
msgstr "작은 비밀상자에 뭐가 들었지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
