#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH"
