msgstr "낚시 도구 넣어두기 좋은 곳이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
