msgstr "새를 기다리고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
