msgstr "좋은 모자군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
