msgstr "단백질을 꽉꽉 채운 파이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
