msgstr "친구 데려오는 기계다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
