msgstr "얜 풀어줄 걸 그랬네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
