msgstr "이걸론 택도 없다 야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "I need to put something there."
msgstr "여기 뭔가 넣어야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
