msgstr "이건 진짜 내 소관 아니다, 미안."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "Careful now, don't burn it."
msgstr "조심해, 태워먹지 말고."

