msgstr "비었잖아? 나중에 다시 해 봐야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
