msgstr "안 되는데. 차라리 잘됐네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt ""
"STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "It's not polite to cut in line."
msgstr "새치기하는 건 예의가 아니지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
