msgstr "버섯 포자가 필요하구만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "I don't think they're suited to this environment."
msgstr "환경에 적응을 못 하는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL"
msgid "I don't think that one'll work here."
msgstr "이걸론 안 될 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "Looks like it doesn't work in the caves, eh."
msgstr "동굴에선 안 되는 모양이구만 그래."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY"
msgid "Slow down there bud, I can't understand a word you're sayin'."
msgstr "야야, 진정해 봐라, 뭔 말인지 못 알아먹겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "That doesn't seem smart."
msgstr "현명한 일은 아닌 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "That doesn't look like a magic rock to me."
msgstr "마법의 돌이 아닌 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "I'd prefer wood, personally."
msgstr "난 나무 깎는 게 더 좋은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "Nah. Something long and thin goes there, but not this."
msgstr "아냐. 뭔가 길고 가는 건데, 아무튼 이건 아냐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
