msgstr "지금은 안 돼. 금방 해 진다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY"
