msgstr "저 안에 작은 나무가 다시 자랄 때까지 기다려야겠구만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE"
msgid "That ain't gonna cut it, eh?"
