msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43"
msgid "There's something unnatural aboot that thing... wouldn't ya say, Luce?"
msgstr "이거 느낌이 뭔가 쎄한데... 너도 그렇지, 루시?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7"
msgid "There's something unnatural aboot that thing... wouldn't ya say, Luce?"
msgstr "이거 느낌이 뭔가 쎄한데... 너도 그렇지, 루시?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "I could use a bit of luck."
msgstr "복 좀 들어왔으면 하는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "I love Lucy!"
msgstr "난 루시가 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "Shucks, I'm gonna have to chop it again."
msgstr "에라이, 또 베어내야 하겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "They glow now, eh? Alrighty then."
msgstr "이젠 빛이 난단 말야? 그래 뭐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "It's got me feelin' a bit light-headed."
msgstr "뭔가 머리가 빛이 나는 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "That could be good for somethin'."
msgstr "어디 쓸데가 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "That should patch things up easy enough, eh?"
msgstr "이거면 꽤 쉽게 고칠 수 있겠는데?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "Glitterin' like icicles on a winter morning."
msgstr "겨울 아침의 고드름처럼 반짝거려."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "It's givin' me goosebumps... I hate goosebumps."
msgstr "닭살 소름이 다 돋네... 닭살 싫은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "Looks like an invasive species to me."
msgstr "외래종인 것 같은 모양인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "I think it's time you and Lucy got acquainted."
msgstr "너한테 루시를 좀 소개해 줘야겠구만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "How aboot we get this furnace going, eh Luce?"
msgstr "풀무질 한 번 해 볼까, 루시?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "Still needs some setting up."
msgstr "손을 좀 더 써야겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "It's a sneaky one... better keep my distance."
msgstr "교활한 녀석이야... 가까이 하지 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED"
msgid "We sure topped'em, eh Luce?"
msgstr "우리가 녀석을 완전 박살냈지, 루시?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "Is that meat?"
msgstr "저거 고기 아냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "It's warm and lumpy."
msgstr "따뜻하고 울퉁불퉁해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "Weird, it almost tastes like salmon."
msgstr "이상하네, 연어 비슷한 맛이 나잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "I prefer simpler things."
msgstr "난 단순한 게 좋은데 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "It sure beats international shipping."
msgstr "해외수송보다 훨씬 낫네."

