msgstr "공동 텃밭에서 난 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED"
