msgstr "열정이 샘솟는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END"
msgid "This gets me all fired up."
msgstr "열정이 샘솟는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS"
