msgstr "노래 되게 좋네, 그치 루시?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE"
