"[LoadEmpathyModLibraryExW().......ERROR_DATA_PATH_NOT_FOUND] } and Robert "
"Wagstaff. The experiment turned out to be a [RESOUNDING SUCCESS], but "
"Wagstaff was [A SHORT-SIGHTED FOOL, AFRAID OF PROGRESS] and decided to put a"
" stop to further tests. Adamant that the process that created them could "
"still be perfected, WX refused to give up, continuing their experiments in "
"secret. When Wagstaff finally discovered what they had been doing, there was"
" a heated argument and01110100 01101111 01101111 00100000 01101100 01100001 "
