#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr"
msgid ""
"*Battle cries increase nearby allies' next attack damage by 25%\n"
"*Gains less aggro when attacking\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Melee, Darts"
msgstr ""
"*전투의 함성으로 근처 동료들의 다음 공격 데미지를 25% 증가시켜 줍니다\n"
"*공격 중에는 주목을 덜 끕니다\n"
"\n"
"특화:\n"
"근접 무기, 다트"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell"
msgid ""
"*Summons Shadow Duelists after focusing attacks on a single target\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Books, Staves"
msgstr ""
"*한 대상을 여러 번 공격하면 그림자 투사를 소환합니다\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"특화:\n"
"책, 지팡이"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber"
msgid ""
"*Accompanied by itsy bitsy spiders\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Darts"
msgstr ""
"*자그마한 거미들과 동행합니다\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"특화:\n"
"다트"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy"
msgid ""
"*Protected by her twin sister, Abigail\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Darts, Staves"
msgstr ""
"*쌍둥이 자매, 아비게일의 보호를 받습니다\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"특화:\n"
"다트, 지팡이"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes"
msgid ""
"*Can be revived twice as quickly\n"
"*Gains minimal aggro when attacking\n"
"*Less likely to lose aggro once drawn\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Melee, Darts, Staves"
msgstr ""
"*2배 빨리 부활합니다\n"
"*공격 중에 주목을 최소로 끕니다\n"
"*주목을 한 번 끌면 잘 놓치지 않습니다\n"
"\n"
"특화 :\n"
"근접 무기, 다트, 지팡이"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom"
msgid ""
"*Gains a buff after dealing sufficient damage, amplifying her next spell\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Books, Staves"
msgstr ""
"*데미지를 일정량 입히면 다음 주문 효과가 증폭됩니다\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"특화: \n"
"책, 지팡이"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.willow
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.willow"
msgid ""
"*Protected by Bernie the Bear\n"
"*Fire and Explosive attack damage increased by 10%\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Darts, Staves"
msgstr ""
"*곰인형 버니의 보호를 받습니다\n"
"*불과 폭발 공격 데미지가 10% 증가합니다\n"
"\n"
"특화:\n"
"다트, 지팡이"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson"
msgid ""
"*Revives allies twice as quickly\n"
"*Restores three times more health when reviving allies\n"
"\n"
"Expertise:\n"
"Melee, Darts, Staves"
msgstr ""
"*동료를 2배 빨리 부활시킵니다\n"
"*부활시킬 때 3배로 체력을 회복시켜 줍니다\n"
"\n"
"특화:\n"
"근접 무기, 다트, 지팡이"

