#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WILLOW.WILLOW_BURNINGBERNIE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WILLOW.WILLOW_BURNINGBERNIE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Igniting Bernie will give him a firey aura for a short time.\n"
"Enemies that attack an ignited Bernie will take damage back."
msgstr ""
"버니에게 불을 붙이면 잠시 동안 화염 오라가 둘러집니다.\n"
