msgstr "스킬 12개를 습득하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC"
msgid ""
"The Cryptic Founder will reward your curiosity by blocking the moon's "
"ability to trigger your curse."
msgstr "비밀스러운 창립자가 당신의 호기심에 대한 보답으로 보름달에 저주가 발동되는 것을 막아줍니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Renegade"
msgstr "월광의 반항아"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_DESC"
msgid ""
"The Queen will reward your loyalty by calling off her shadow creatures.\n"
"(But only when you're in a were-form.)"
msgstr ""
"여왕이 당신의 충성에 대한 보답으로 그림자 괴물들을 물러나게 합니다.\n"
"(변신 중일 때 한정.)"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE"
msgid "Shadow Wrangler"
msgstr "그림자 조련사"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_1_DESC"
msgid "Mine faster in your Werebeaver form."
msgstr "비버인간 상태일 때 채광이 더욱 빨라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_1_TITLE"
msgid "The Werebeaver I"
msgstr "비버인간 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_2_DESC"
msgid "Chop faster in your Werebeaver form."
msgstr "비버인간 상태일 때 벌목이 더욱 빨라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_2_TITLE"
msgid "The Werebeaver II"
msgstr "비버인간 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_3_DESC"
msgid "Chop, mine and break hard materials in your Werebeaver form."
msgstr "비버인간 상태일 때 벌목과 채광은 물론 단단한 물건을 부술 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_3_TITLE"
msgid "The Werebeaver III"
msgstr "비버인간 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_BEAVER_LOCK_DESC"
msgid "Only one were-form can be fully mastered. Choose wisely."
msgstr "한 번에 한 변신만 완전히 마스터할 수 있습니다. 신중히 선택하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_BEAVER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_BEAVER_DESC"
msgid ""
"The Werebeaver learns to smack the ground with his tail, destroying "
"everything around him."
msgstr "비버인간 상태에서 꼬리로 바닥을 내리쳐 주변을 초토화할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_BEAVER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_BEAVER_TITLE"
msgid "Werebeaver Mastery"
msgstr "비버인간 마스터리"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_GOOSE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_GOOSE_DESC"
msgid ""
"The Weregoose learns to fly around to explore the world, but it's a little "
"out of control."
msgstr "거위인간 상태에서 비행하여 세계를 탐험할 수 있습니다. 단, 제어가 좀 안 됩니다 "

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_GOOSE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_GOOSE_TITLE"
msgid "Weregoose Mastery"
msgstr "거위인간 마스터리"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_MOOSE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_MOOSE_DESC"
msgid ""
"The Weremoose learns to throw a strong planar punch on every 3rd hit, and "
"gains a natural defense against planar damage."
msgstr "사슴인간 상태에서 3타마다 강력한 차원 피해를 입히고, 차원 피해에 대한 기본 저항이 생깁니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_MOOSE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_EPIC_MOOSE_TITLE"
msgid "Weremoose Mastery"
msgstr "사슴인간 마스터리"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_1_DESC"
msgid "Run faster in your Weregoose form."
msgstr "거위인간 상태에서 더욱 빠르게 달립니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_1_TITLE"
msgid "The Weregoose I"
msgstr "거위인간 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_2_DESC"
msgid "Become completely waterproof in Weregoose form."
msgstr "거위인간 상태에서 완전 방수가 됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_2_TITLE"
msgid "The Weregoose II"
msgstr "거위인간 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_3_DESC"
msgid "Occasionally dodge an incoming attack in Weregoose form."
msgstr "거위인간 상태에서 일정 확률로 적의 공격을 회피합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_3_TITLE"
msgid "The Weregoose III"
msgstr "거위인간 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_GOOSE_LOCK_DESC"
msgid "Only one were-form can be fully mastered. Choose wisely."
msgstr "한 번에 한 변신만 완전히 마스터할 수 있습니다. 신중히 선택하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MASTER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MASTER_DESC"
msgid ""
"Suffer no health or sanity penalties for eating Kitschy Idols.\n"
"Return to human form without having an empty stomach."
msgstr ""
"미숙한 우상을 먹어도 체력이나 정신력이 감소하지 않습니다.\n"
"인간으로 돌아와도 허기가 완전히 비지 않게 됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MASTER_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MASTER_LOCK_DESC"
msgid "Learn 6 Curse skills to unlock."
msgstr "저주 스킬 6개를 습득하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MASTER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MASTER_TITLE"
msgid "Curse Embracer"
msgstr "저주를 받아들이다"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Your Weremoose form is more resistant to hitting obstacles and walks a "
"little faster."
msgstr "사슴인간 상태에서 장애물과의 충돌에 좀 더 잘 버티고 조금 더 빨리 걷습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_1_TITLE"
msgid "The Weremoose I"
msgstr "사슴인간 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_2_DESC"
msgid "Gain slow health regeneration in your Weremoose form."
msgstr "사슴인간 상태일 때 천천히 체력이 회복됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_2_TITLE"
msgid "The Weremoose II"
msgstr "사슴인간 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_3_DESC"
msgid "You can stop mid-charge in your Weremoose form."
msgstr "사슴인간 상태에서 돌격 도중 멈출 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_3_TITLE"
msgid "The Weremoose III"
msgstr "사슴인간 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_MOOSE_LOCK_DESC"
msgid "Only one were-form can be fully mastered. Choose wisely."
msgstr "한 번에 한 변신만 완전히 마스터할 수 있습니다. 신중히 선택하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_1_DESC"
msgid "Were-forms last a little longer."
msgstr "변신 상태가 좀 더 오래 갑니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_1_TITLE"
msgid "Transformation Timer I"
msgstr "변신 타이머 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_2_DESC"
msgid "Were-forms last a fair amount longer."
msgstr "변신 상태가 상당히 더 오래 갑니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_2_TITLE"
msgid "Transformation Timer II"
msgstr "변신 타이머 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_3_DESC"
msgid "Were-forms last much longer."
msgstr "변신 상태가 훨씬 더 오래 갑니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_CURSE_WEREMETER_3_TITLE"
msgid "Transformation Timer III"
msgstr "변신 타이머 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_1_DESC"
msgid "Use Lucy to carve boards more efficiently."
msgstr "루시를 이용해 나무 판자를 더 효율적으로 만듭니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_1_TITLE"
msgid "Woodworker"
msgstr "목수"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_2_DESC"
msgid "Use Lucy to carve a nice Hardwood Hat for protection."
msgstr "루시를 이용해 멋과 보호력을 챙긴 안전나모를 만듭니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_2_TITLE"
msgid "Hat Carving"
msgstr "모자 깎기"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_3_DESC"
msgid "Use Lucy to carve a Wooden Walking Stick for easy mobility."
msgstr "루시를 이용해 이동에 도움이 되는 나무 지팡이를 만듭니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_LUCY_3_TITLE"
msgid "Cane Carving"
msgstr "지팡이 깎기"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_1_DESC"
msgid "Collect stuff a little faster."
msgstr "채집이 조금 빨라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_1_TITLE"
msgid "Quick Picker I"
msgstr "빠른 손놀림 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_2_DESC"
msgid "Collect stuff a fair amount faster."
msgstr "채집이 상당히 빨라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_2_TITLE"
msgid "Quick Picker II"
msgstr "빠른 손놀림 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_3_DESC"
msgid "Collect stuff much faster."
msgstr "채집이 엄청 빨라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_QUICKPICKER_3_TITLE"
msgid "Quick Picker III"
msgstr "빠른 손놀림 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_1_DESC"
msgid "Deal a fair amount more damage to Treeguards."
msgstr "트리가드에게 추가 피해를 입힙니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_1_TITLE"
msgid "Treeguard Feller I"
msgstr "트리가드 벌목꾼 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_2_DESC"
msgid "Deal much more damage to Treeguards."
msgstr "트리가드에게 큰 추가 피해를 입힙니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_2_TITLE"
msgid "Treeguard Feller II"
msgstr "트리가드 벌목꾼 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_MAX_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_MAX_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft the Treeguard Idol, an extremely burnable effigy.\n"
"Attracts Treeguards when burned."
msgstr ""
"불에 매우 잘 타는 '트리가드 우상'을 제작할 수 있습니다.\n"
"태우면 트리가드가 나타납니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_MAX_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WOODIE.WOODIE_HUMAN_TREEGUARD_MAX_TITLE"
msgid "Treeguard Feller III"
msgstr "트리가드 벌목꾼 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.ARMOR_BRAMBLE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.ARMOR_BRAMBLE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Every three-hit attack streak you land without taking damage triggers a "
"burst of spikes from your Bramble Husk."
msgstr "피해를 받지 않은 상태에서 매 3타 공격 시마다 가시덤불 거죽에서 가시를 발사합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.ARMOR_BRAMBLE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.ARMOR_BRAMBLE_TITLE"
msgid "Bramble Husk Specialist"
msgstr "가시덤불 거죽 전문가"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_DESC"
msgid "Sacrifice health to craft Berry Bushes."
msgstr "체력을 소모하여 베리 덤불을 제작합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_TITLE"
msgid "Berry Bush Crafting"
msgstr "베리 덤불 제작"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_FARMRANGE1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_FARMRANGE1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Tend farm plants within a larger range while full bloom.\n"
"Harvest farm plants faster."
msgstr ""
"만개 상태일 때 더 넓은 범위의 작물을 돌봅니다.\n"
"작물을 더 빠르게 수확합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_FARMRANGE1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_FARMRANGE1_TITLE"
msgid "Farmhand"
msgstr "농사꾼"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_MAX_UPGRADE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_MAX_UPGRADE_DESC"
msgid "Fertilization of Wormwood is boosted 30%."
msgstr "웜우드의 개화가 30% 빠르게 진행됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_MAX_UPGRADE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_MAX_UPGRADE_TITLE"
msgid "Flower Power"
msgstr "화-력"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_OVERHEATPROTECTION_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_OVERHEATPROTECTION_DESC"
msgid "Gain increased protection from overheating when in full bloom."
msgstr "만개 상태일 때 방서 효과를 얻습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_OVERHEATPROTECTION_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_OVERHEATPROTECTION_TITLE"
msgid "Shade Plant"
msgstr "정자나무"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_PHOTOSYNTHESIS_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_PHOTOSYNTHESIS_DESC"
msgid "Slowly regenerate health when exposed to daylight in full bloom."
msgstr "만개 상태에서 햇빛을 받으면 서서히 체력이 재생됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_PHOTOSYNTHESIS_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_PHOTOSYNTHESIS_TITLE"
msgid "Photosynthesis"
msgstr "광합성"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED1_DESC"
msgid "Reach full bloom a bit quicker."
msgstr "만개 상태에 조금 더 빠르게 도달합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED1_TITLE"
msgid "Growth Spurt I"
msgstr "성장 가속 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED2_DESC"
msgid "Reach full bloom much quicker."
msgstr "만개 상태에 훨씬 더 빠르게 도달합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_SPEED2_TITLE"
msgid "Growth Spurt II"
msgstr "성장 가속 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_TRAPBRAMBLE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_TRAPBRAMBLE_DESC"
msgid "Reset nearby Bramble Traps while in full bloom."
msgstr "만개 상태일 때 근처의 가시덤불 덫이 자동으로 초기화됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_TRAPBRAMBLE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_TRAPBRAMBLE_TITLE"
msgid "Bramble Trap Specialist"
msgstr "가시덤불 덫 전문가"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUGS_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUGS_DESC"
msgid "Bees and Butterflies will tolerate Wormwood, unless provoked."
msgstr "먼저 공격하지 않는 한, 벌과 나비가 웜우드를 적대하지 않습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUGS_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUGS_TITLE"
msgid "Bee Kind"
msgstr "벌벗"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUTTERFLY_FRIEND_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUTTERFLY_FRIEND_DESC"
msgid "Butterflies will no longer fly away from you."
msgstr "나비가 도망가지 않습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUTTERFLY_FRIEND_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BUTTERFLY_FRIEND_TITLE"
msgid "Butterfly Friend"
msgstr "나비의 벗"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.COUNT_LOCK_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.COUNT_LOCK_1_DESC"
msgid "Learn enough left-branch skills to unlock."
msgstr "왼쪽 가지 스킬을 충분히 습득하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.COUNT_LOCK_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.COUNT_LOCK_2_DESC"
msgid "Learn enough right-branch skills to unlock."
msgstr "오른쪽 가지 스킬을 충분히 습득하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.IDENTIFY_PLANTS_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.IDENTIFY_PLANTS_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to identify seeds that have just been planted, to determine what they "
"will grow into."
msgstr "방금 심은 씨앗을 식별하여, 자라서 무엇이 될지를 알아낼 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.IDENTIFY_PLANTS_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.IDENTIFY_PLANTS_TITLE"
msgid "Seed Sleuth"
msgstr "씨앗 탐정"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.JUICYBERRYBUSHCRAFTING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.JUICYBERRYBUSHCRAFTING_DESC"
msgid "Sacrifice health to craft Juicy Berry Bushes."
msgstr "체력을 소모하여 즙 많은 베리 덤불을 제작합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.JUICYBERRYBUSHCRAFTING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.JUICYBERRYBUSHCRAFTING_TITLE"
msgid "Juicy Berry Bush Crafting"
msgstr "즙 많은 베리 덤불 제작"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Seize foes and keep them rooted in place while wearing Brightshade Armor.\n"
"Fuse Bramble Husks with Brightshade armor to create Brambleshade armor."
msgstr ""
"빛말풀 갑옷을 입으면 적을 뿌리로 묶을 수 있습니다.\n"
"가시덤불 거죽을 빛말풀 갑옷과 합쳐 빛가시 갑옷을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_1_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Guardian I"
msgstr "월광의 수호자 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Summon vines to join the fray while attacking with Brightshade melee "
"weapons."
msgstr "빛말풀 계열 근접무기로 공격하면 적을 공격해주는 덩굴을 소환합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_GEAR_2_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Guardian II"
msgstr "월광의 수호자 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Tap into your lunar roots to transform Carrots into Carrats.\n"
"Carrats you've created will retrieve food they find on the ground."
msgstr ""
"달의 뿌리를 활용하여 당근을 당근이쥐로 변형합니다.\n"
"생성된 당근이쥐는 땅에 떨어진 음식을 찾아 가져다줍니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_1_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Cultivator I"
msgstr "월광의 경작자 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Tap into your lunar roots to transform Lightbulbs into Bulbous Lightbugs.\n"
"Bulbous Lightbugs you've created will follow you around.\n"
"The more Lightbugs grouped together, the larger their light will glow."
msgstr ""
"달의 뿌리를 활용하여 전구근을 전구벌레로 변형합니다.\n"
"생성된 전구벌레는 주인 곁을 따라다닙니다.\n"
"전구벌레는 많을수록 더 밝은 빛을 냅니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_2_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Cultivator II"
msgstr "월광의 경작자 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Tap into your lunar roots to transform Dragon Fruit into Saladmanders.\n"
"Saladmanders you've created will attack things you do.\n"
"Transforming maximum Saladmanders gives them a health boost."
msgstr ""
"달의 뿌리를 활용하여 용과를 샐러도마뱀으로 변형합니다.\n"
"생성된 샐러도마뱀은 적을 함께 공격해 줍니다.\n"
"샐러도마뱀은 최대 수량만큼 생성하면 최대 체력이 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUNAR_MUTATIONS_3_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Cultivator III"
msgstr "월광의 경작자 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUREPLANTCRAFTING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUREPLANTCRAFTING_DESC"
msgid "Sacrifice health to craft Lureplants."
msgstr "체력을 소모하여 미끼식물을 제작합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUREPLANTCRAFTING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.LUREPLANTCRAFTING_TITLE"
msgid "Lureplant Crafting"
msgstr "미끼식물 제작"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MOON_CAP_EATING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MOON_CAP_EATING_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn how to plant Moon Shrooms in Mushroom Planters, and release sleep-"
"inducing spores when eating them."
msgstr "버섯 재배기에 달버섯을 심을 수 있습니다. 또한 달버섯을 먹으면 수면 포자를 방출합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MOON_CAP_EATING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MOON_CAP_EATING_TITLE"
msgid "Moon Shroom Cloud"
msgstr "달버섯구름"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_1_DESC"
msgid "Mushrooms planted in a Mushroom Planter grow a little faster."
msgstr "버섯 재배기에 심은 버섯이 조금 더 빨리 자랍니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_1_TITLE"
msgid "Mushroom Mastery I"
msgstr "버섯 마스터리 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_2_DESC"
msgid "Mushrooms planted in a Mushroom Planter grow much faster."
msgstr "버섯 재배기에 심은 버섯이 훨씬 더 빨리 자랍니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_RATEBONUS_2_TITLE"
msgid "Mushroom Mastery II"
msgstr "버섯 마스터리 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_UPGRADE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_UPGRADE_DESC"
msgid "Mushrooms planted in a Mushroom Planter produce a higher yield."
msgstr "버섯 재배기에 심은 버섯의 수확량이 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_UPGRADE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.MUSHROOMPLANTER_UPGRADE_TITLE"
msgid "Mushroom Multiplier"
msgstr "버섯 복사"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.QUICK_SELFFERTILIZER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.QUICK_SELFFERTILIZER_DESC"
msgid "Heal faster with Compost Wraps."
msgstr "퇴비쌈 사용 속도가 빨라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.QUICK_SELFFERTILIZER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.QUICK_SELFFERTILIZER_TITLE"
msgid "Compost Care"
msgstr "돌봐두엄"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.REEDSCRAFTING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.REEDSCRAFTING_DESC"
msgid "Sacrifice health to craft Monkeytails."
msgstr "체력을 소모하여 원숭이꼬리풀을 제작합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.REEDSCRAFTING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.REEDSCRAFTING_TITLE"
msgid "Monkeytail Crafting"
msgstr "원숭이꼬리풀 제작"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SAPLINGCRAFTING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SAPLINGCRAFTING_DESC"
msgid "Sacrifice health to craft Lunar Saplings."
msgstr "체력을 소모하여 달 묘목을 제작합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SAPLINGCRAFTING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SAPLINGCRAFTING_TITLE"
msgid "Sapling Crafting"
msgstr "묘목 제작"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SYRUPCRAFTING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SYRUPCRAFTING_DESC"
msgid "Learn to craft Ipecaca Syrup to induce pooping in other creatures."
msgstr "다른 생물의 배변을 촉진하는 '토근 시럽'을 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SYRUPCRAFTING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.SYRUPCRAFTING_TITLE"
msgid "Poor Sap"
msgstr "불쌍한 수액기"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC"
msgid ""
"The Cryptic Founder will reward your curiosity by showing you power from "
"wearing a Brightshade Helm or Brightshade Armor. Souls waiting to be freed "
"in a Soul Echo will absorb incoming damage, and expire the timer."
msgstr ""
"비밀스러운 창립자가 당신의 호기심에 대한 보답으로 빛말풀 방어구를 입었을 때 얻는 힘에 대해 가르쳐줍니다. 잔영 도약이 가능할 때 피해를"
" 입으면 피해를 흡수하고 잔영 도약 기회가 사라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Swindler"
msgstr "월광의 협잡꾼"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_DESC"
msgid ""
"The Queen will reward your loyalty by unlocking power from wielding a Shadow"
" Reaper. Souls waiting to be freed in a Soul Echo will cause damage dealt to"
" spread out to close enemies or hit one target twice, and expire the timer."
msgstr ""
"여왕이 당신의 충성에 대한 보답으로 그림자 수확자를 사용할 때 얻는 힘을 깨우쳐줍니다. 잔영 도약이 가능할 때 공격하면 주변 적에게 "
"피해를 나눠서 입히거나 단일 대상을 두 번 공격하고 잔영 도약 기회가 사라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE"
msgid "Shadow Harvester"
msgstr "그림자 추수꾼"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_METER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_METER_DESC"
msgid ""
"Based off of how many Nice or Naughty skills selected, you will find "
"yourself leaning towards a certain inclination. Choosing an affinity skews "
"the scales and you will find your inclination coming sooner."
msgstr ""
"선행 스킬과 악행 스킬을 배운 개수에 따라 성향이 한 쪽으로 기울어지게 됩니다. 진영 스킬을 배우면 저울이 왜곡되면서 한쪽 성향으로 더욱"
" 쉽게 기웁니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_METER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_METER_TITLE"
msgid "The Scales"
msgstr "저울"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NAUGHTY_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NAUGHTY_DESC"
msgid ""
"Your greed stops you from overloading of Soul power, for a moment.\n"
"Eating or releasing Souls will no longer change sanity. Souls heal you for less."
msgstr ""
"탐욕의 힘으로 영력의 과부하를 잠시 동안 막을 수 있게 됩니다.\n"
"영혼을 먹거나 풀어주었을 때의 정신력 증감이 사라집니다. 당신이 영혼으로 받는 치유량이 감소합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NAUGHTY_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NAUGHTY_TITLE"
msgid "Naughty Inclination"
msgstr "악 성향"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NICE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NICE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Your kindness has made your monster side no longer stir up trouble.\n"
"Eating or releasing Souls will change sanity at an increased amount."
msgstr ""
"선한 마음 덕분에 더 이상 괴물 취급 받지 않습니다.\n"
"영혼을 먹거나 풀어주었을 때의 정신력 증감폭이 커집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NICE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_INCLINATION_NICE_TITLE"
msgid "Nice Inclination"
msgstr "선 성향"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn how to channel Souls into a Twintailed Heart, a creation used to "
"revive ghostly friends."
msgstr "영혼을 모아 '쌍꼬리 심장'을 빚을 수 있습니다. '쌍꼬리 심장'은 유령이 된 친구를 부활시키는 데에 사용할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_1_TITLE"
msgid "Lifebringer I"
msgstr "소생자 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Your ghostly friends will no longer suffer health penalties when you revive "
"them with a Twintailed Heart."
msgstr "유령이 된 친구를 쌍꼬리 심장으로 부활시킬 때 체력 페널티가 발생하지 않습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_2_TITLE"
msgid "Lifebringer II"
msgstr "소생자 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Allow the Twintailed Heart to be used by another which will pull them to you from near or afar.\n"
"Using it yourself will free the Souls inside."
msgstr ""
"다른 사람이 쌍꼬리 심장을 사용하면 당신의 위치로 이동할 수 있게 됩니다.\n"
"스스로 사용하면 심장에 묶인 영혼이 풀려납니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFEBRINGER_3_TITLE"
msgid "Lifebringer III"
msgstr "소생자 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Souls waiting to be freed in a Soul Echo will enhance your movement speed."
msgstr "잔영 도약 기회가 있을 때 이동속도가 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_1_TITLE"
msgid "Lifted Spirits I"
msgstr "정신 고양 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_2_DESC"
msgid "Soul Echo duration is increased."
msgstr "잔영 도약 기회가 더 오래 지속됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_2_TITLE"
msgid "Lifted Spirits II"
msgstr "정신 고양 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Soul Echo will happen a second time.\n"
"This does not decrease Soul Hop costs from the Map."
msgstr ""
"잔영 도약을 2번까지 사용할 수 있습니다.\n"
"지도 상에서 장거리 도약을 할 때의 비용은 감소하지 않습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_3_TITLE"
msgid "Reverberation"
msgstr "반향"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_4_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_4_DESC"
msgid ""
"Soul Hop cost from the Map will be reduced by how much of the current "
"world's land has been explored."
msgstr "현재 세계의 지도를 많이 밝힐수록 장거리 영혼 도약의 비용이 감소합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_4_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_LIFTEDSPIRITS_4_TITLE"
msgid "Capricious Movement"
msgstr "변덕스런 발걸음"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NABBAG_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NABBAG_DESC"
msgid ""
"You've hung around Krampus enough to create a Knabsack for your own item "
"stealing desires. Packs a punch depending on how full your inventory is."
msgstr ""
"크람푸스와 어울려 논 결과 도벽을 해소하기 위한 '날치기 보따리'를 만들 수 있게 됩니다. 인벤토리가 얼마나 많이 차 있는지에 따라 "
"공격력이 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NABBAG_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NABBAG_TITLE"
msgid "Knabsacker"
msgstr "날치기범"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NAUGHTY_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NAUGHTY_LOCK_DESC"
msgid ""
"Requires the skill below and 5 total Naughty and/or Neutral skills to "
"unlock."
msgstr "아래의 스킬 및 악행/중립 스킬 총합 5개 습득 시 해금"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NICE_LOCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_NICE_LOCK_DESC"
msgid ""
"Requires the skill below and 5 total Nice and/or Neutral skills to unlock."
msgstr "아래의 스킬 및 선행/중립 스킬 총합 5개 습득 시 해금"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_FORGET_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_FORGET_DESC"
msgid ""
"Things waking up after your Pan Flute playing will not be able to become "
"hostile towards you for a moment."
msgstr "당신이 팬플룻으로 잠재운 적이 깨어났을 때 잠시 동안 당신을 적대하지 않습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_FORGET_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_FORGET_TITLE"
msgid "Cloudy Carmen"
msgstr "흐릿한 카르멘"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_PLAYING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_PLAYING_DESC"
msgid ""
"You periodically feel a musical pull to play your flute. Pan Flutes will not"
" lose durability one time when feeling this urge to play."
msgstr ""
"팬플룻을 가지고 있을 때 주기적으로 팬플룻이 불고 싶어집니다. 팬플룻이 불고 싶어졌을 때 팬플룻을 연주하면 내구도 소모 없이 1번 연주할"
" 수 있습니다. "

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_PLAYING_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_PLAYING_TITLE"
msgid "Impromptu Flautist"
msgstr "플룻 즉흥곡"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_SOULCALLER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_SOULCALLER_DESC"
msgid ""
"Playing your Pan Flute with such pleasing notes will bring lost Souls around"
" for a listen."
msgstr "팬플룻을 연주하면 아름다운 선율에 이끌려 주변의 길 잃은 영혼들이 다가옵니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_SOULCALLER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_PANFLUTE_SOULCALLER_TITLE"
msgid "Pleasant Pastorale"
msgstr "즐거운 목가"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Soul Hopping creates a Soul Decoy to draw the attention of attacking "
"creatures that possess Souls. It will not create one for a Soul Echo."
msgstr "영혼 도약이 영혼을 가진 적의 주의를 돌리는 '영혼 미끼'를 생성합니다. 잔영 도약 시에는 미끼가 생성되지 않습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_1_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Decoy I"
msgstr "영혼 미끼 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Soul Decoys will stay around for a bit longer if they are unharmed, and "
"damage the thing that hit the Decoy."
msgstr "영혼 미끼가 공격받지 않을 때 더 오래 지속됩니다. 또한 영혼 미끼가 미끼를 공격한 대상에게 피해를 줍니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_2_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Decoy II"
msgstr "영혼 미끼 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Soul Decoys will now explode and inflict damage on things lured by it or "
"attacking you upon expiration."
msgstr "영혼 미끼가 사라질 때 폭발하여 미끼에 이끌리거나 당신을 공격하는 적에게 피해를 입힙니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULDECOY_3_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Decoy III"
msgstr "영혼 미끼 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn how to craft and use a Soul Jar to store Souls for later use.\n"
"Soul Jars will leak Souls over time when not in your inventory."
msgstr ""
"영혼을 저장해 두었다 나중에 쓸 수 있는 '영혼 단지'를 제작할 수 있습니다.\n"
"인벤토리에 넣어두지 않은 영혼 단지는 서서히 영혼이 새어나갑니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_1_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Jar"
msgstr "영혼 단지"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Holding Soul Jars increases your maximum Souls allowed to be held at once by"
" 5 each, stopping you from overloading of Soul power."
msgstr "영혼 단지를 들고 있으면 영혼 단지가 영력이 흘러넘치는 것을 막아주어 1개당 영혼 소지 한도가 5개씩 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_2_TITLE"
msgid "Overflowing Greed"
msgstr "넘치는 탐욕"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Held Souls and Souls inside of Soul Jars increases both the damage of the "
"Knabsack and the damage of Souls, up to 100 total Souls collected."
msgstr ""
"소지한 영혼과 영혼 단지에 저장된 영혼 수의 총합에 따라 날치기 보따리의 공격력이 상승합니다. 영혼이 100개 이상일 때 최대 효과를 "
"받습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULJAR_3_TITLE"
msgid "Covetous Collector"
msgstr "욕심쟁이 수집가"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_1_DESC"
msgid "Dropped Souls will heal at an increased range."
msgstr "영혼을 내려놓았을 때 치유 효과의 범위가 넓어집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_1_TITLE"
msgid "Reaching Souls I"
msgstr "영혼의 손길 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Dropped Souls will move towards hurt players, and heal at an increased "
"range."
msgstr "영혼을 내려놓았을 때, 영혼이 피해를 입은 플레이어를 향해 이동합니다. 또한 치유 효과의 범위가 넓어집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_2_TITLE"
msgid "Reaching Souls II"
msgstr "영혼의 손길 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Dropped Souls will do a second healing wave for a lower amount after a "
"delay."
msgstr "내려놓은 영혼이 한 번 치유하고 잠시 뒤 적은 양의 체력을 추가로 치유합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_3_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Bastion I"
msgstr "영혼 수호자 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_4_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_4_DESC"
msgid ""
"Dropped Souls will move faster towards hurt players, the second healing wave"
" will happen quicker, and Souls are more efficient at healing multiple "
"players."
msgstr ""
"영혼을 내려놓았을 때, 영혼이 피해를 입은 플레이어를 향해 더욱 빨리 이동합니다. 또한 추가 치유가 더 빨리 발동되고, 영혼으로 여러 "
"명을 치료할 때의 효율이 상승합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_4_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_SOULPROTECTOR_4_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Bastion II"
msgstr "영혼 수호자 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_1_DESC"
msgid "Souls are created and attracted to you from further away."
msgstr "영혼이 생성되는 범위와 끌려오는 범위가 늘어납니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_1_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Thief I"
msgstr "영혼 도둑 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_2_DESC"
msgid "Souls will last longer while being attracted to you."
msgstr "끌려오는 영혼이 더 오래 지속됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_2_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Thief II"
msgstr "영혼 도둑 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Souls attracted to you will hurt other creatures with Souls along its path."
msgstr "끌려오는 영혼이 경로 상의 다른 생물을 공격합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_3_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Pierce I"
msgstr "꿰뚫는 영혼 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_4_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_4_DESC"
msgid ""
"Souls attracted to you will repel away initially before coming towards you."
msgstr "영혼이 끌려오기 전에 잠시 멀어졌다가 다시 돌아옵니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_4_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORTOX.WORTOX_THIEF_4_TITLE"
msgid "Soul Pierce II"
msgstr "꿰뚫는 영혼 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_ALLEGIANCE_LOCK_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_ALLEGIANCE_LOCK_1_DESC"
msgid "Learn 12 skills to unlock."
msgstr "스킬 12개를 습득하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Slowly regenerate health when wet. The more wet you are, the more health you"
" regenerate."
msgstr "몸이 젖어 있을 때 체력이 천천히 회복됩니다. 몸이 많이 젖어있을수록 많이 회복됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_1_TITLE"
msgid "Hydrous Healing I"
msgstr "수성 치료 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Regenerate health when wet more effectively. It also make you slowly get wet"
" as you step through the corrupted or mutated marsh turfs."
msgstr ""
"몸이 젖어 있을 때 체력이 회복되는 속도가 증가합니다. 또한 오염된/변이된 늪 바닥 위에 서 있으면 습기가 천천히 차오릅니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_HEALING_2_TITLE"
msgid "Hydrous Healing II"
msgstr "수성 치료 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Restore some sanity over time when wet. The more wet you are, the more "
"sanity you restore."
msgstr "몸이 젖어 있을 때 정신력이 천천히 회복됩니다. 몸이 많이 젖어있을수록 많이 회복됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_1_TITLE"
msgid "Mental Fluidity I"
msgstr "유동적인 정신 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_2_DESC"
msgid "Restore a fair amount of sanity over time when wet."
msgstr "몸이 젖어 있을 때 정신력을 꽤 많이 회복합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_SANITY_2_TITLE"
msgid "Mental Fluidity II"
msgstr "유동적인 정신 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_TEMPERATURE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_TEMPERATURE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Greatly reduce the effect of wetness on body temperature. It also fairly "
"reduces wetness loss due to heat sources."
msgstr "습기가 체온에 미치는 영향이 크게 줄어듭니다. 열원으로 인해 습기가 줄어드는 속도도 상당히 느려집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_TEMPERATURE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_TEMPERATURE_TITLE"
msgid "All-Weather Scales"
msgstr "전천후 비늘"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Use wetness as protection. Damage will consume wetness instead of health."
msgstr "습기가 곧 갑옷이 됩니다. 피해를 입으면 체력 대신 습기가 줄어듭니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_1_TITLE"
msgid "Slippery Hide I"
msgstr "미끈한 가죽 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Use wetness as protection more effectively. It also make you slowly get wet "
"as you step through the corrupted or mutated marsh turfs."
msgstr "습기에 의한 피해 흡수의 효율이 높아집니다. 또한 오염된/변이된 늪 바닥 위에 서 있으면 습기가 천천히 차오릅니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_AMPHIBIAN_THICKSKIN_2_TITLE"
msgid "Slippery Hide II"
msgstr "미끈한 가죽 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft the Superior Communal Kelp Dish, it holds more kelp for even "
"faster merm growth and calling in merms for action."
msgstr ""
"더 많은 다시마를 담아 어인의 재생성을 더욱 가속하고 어인들을 불러 동원할 수 있는 '상급 공용 다시마 그릇'을 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_2_TITLE"
msgid "Community Feeder II"
msgstr "공동체의 밥줄 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft the Communal Kelp Dish to entice faster merm growth and to "
"call in merms for action."
msgstr "어인의 재생성을 가속하고 어인들을 불러 동원할 수 있는 '공용 다시마 그릇'을 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_1_TITLE"
msgid "Community Feeder I"
msgstr "공동체의 밥줄 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft the Slightly Less Shoddy Tool shed, it provides Slightly Less"
" Shoddy Tools."
msgstr "어인 일꾼들에게 '덜 조잡한 도구'를 제공하는 '덜 조잡한 도구함'을 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_2_TITLE"
msgid "Industrious Merm II"
msgstr "근면한 어인 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft the Shoddy Tool Shed to equip your merm workers with Shoddy "
"Tools."
msgstr "어인 일꾼들에게 '조잡한 도구'를 제공하는 '조잡한 도구함'을 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_2_TITLE"
msgid "Industrious Merm I"
msgstr "근면한 어인 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft the Superior Armermry, it provides Swamp Warrior Helmets."
msgstr "어인 근위병들에게 '늪 전사의 투구'를 제공하는 '상급 무기곯'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_2_TITLE"
msgid "Hardheaded II"
msgstr "돌머리 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft the Armermry to equip your Loyal Merm Guards with Swamp "
"Brawler Helmets."
msgstr "어인 근위병들에게 '늪 싸움꾼 투구'를 제공하는 '무기곯'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_CIV_3_TITLE"
msgid "Hardheaded I"
msgstr "돌머리 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Grant your loyal merms the wondrous gift of Lunar mutation by feeding them Moon Shards.\n"
"Empower your mutant merms with Planar power using Pure Brilliance."
msgstr ""
"당신을 따르는 어인에게 달 파편을 먹여서 놀라운 달 변이의 축복을 선사합니다.\n"
"순수한 광휘를 사용하여 변이된 어인에게 차원의 힘을 부여합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_1_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Mutated Merm"
msgstr "달 변이 어인"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_2_DESC"
msgid "Morph any piece of land into sweet sweet Marsh."
msgstr "원하는 곳의 땅을 종류에 상관없이 늪지대로 바꿉니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_2_TITLE"
msgid "Terra Mutation"
msgstr "대지 변이"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGCROWN_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGCROWN_DESC"
msgid ""
"Gift him a crown worn by kings long passed, and your merms will fight "
"smarter so their lives may last."
msgstr "왕에게 머나먼 시대의 왕관을 씌워라, 그대의 어인들은 지혜로이 싸워 명운이 길어질지니."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGCROWN_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGCROWN_TITLE"
msgid "The King's Crown Quest"
msgstr "왕관을 찾아서"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGSHOULDERS_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGSHOULDERS_DESC"
msgid ""
"Add stony armor to the King's statuesque shoulders for greater stoutness in "
"your merm soldiers."
msgstr "왕의 조각 같은 어깨에 돌 갑옷을, 그리하여 그대의 어인 병사들에게는 더 큰 굳셈을."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGSHOULDERS_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGSHOULDERS_TITLE"
msgid "The King's Pauldron Quest"
msgstr "왕의 견갑을 찾아서"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGTRIDENT_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGTRIDENT_DESC"
msgid ""
"Offer this weapon best wielded at sea, and your merms will attack with the "
"deftness of three."
msgstr "왕의 손에 바다 위에서 강해지는 무기를 쥐어줄 때 그대의 어인들은 세 배로 능숙히 공격하리라."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGTRIDENT_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERMKINGTRIDENT_TITLE"
msgid "The King's Trident Quest"
msgstr "왕의 삼지창을 찾아서"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_FLEE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_FLEE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Merm Guards will retreat from combat when low on health, and wait to be "
"healed."
msgstr "어인 근위병들이 체력이 낮아지면 후퇴하여 치유를 기다립니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_FLEE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_FLEE_TITLE"
msgid "Sensible Swamp Fighter"
msgstr "합리적인 늪 싸움꾼"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_1_DESC"
msgid "Increase the Merm King's maximum hunger."
msgstr "어인왕의 허기 최대치가 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_1_TITLE"
msgid "Sated Sovereign I"
msgstr "배부른 군주 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_2_DESC"
msgid "Increase the Merm King's maximum hunger even more."
msgstr "어인왕의 허기 최대치가 더욱 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_2_TITLE"
msgid "Sated Sovereign II"
msgstr "배부른 군주 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_3_DESC"
msgid "Slow the Merm King's digestion, so he takes longer to get hungry."
msgstr "어인왕의 소화 속도가 느려져 허기 감소 속도가 줄어듭니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MERM_KING_HUNGER_3_TITLE"
msgid "Sated Sovereign III"
msgstr "배부른 군주 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_1_DESC"
msgid "Learn to craft a cuddly buddy making Mosquitoes neutral to you."
msgstr "모기가 당신에게 중립화되도록 하는 인형 친구를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_1_TITLE"
msgid "Mosquito Incognito"
msgstr "모기는 모르지"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft Mosquito based items: Skeeter Bomb, Fertilizzzer and Blood "
"Shot."
msgstr "모기로 제작하는 아이템인 '목이탄', '왱비료', '피주사'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_2_TITLE"
msgid "Itchcraft I"
msgstr "모기공예 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_3_DESC"
msgid ""
"Master the use of the Mosquito based items.\n"
"\n"
"With the help of Lil' Itchy, catch mosquitos right from the air."
msgstr ""
"모기로 만드는 아이템을 더욱 능숙하게 사용합니다.\n"
"\n"
"따끔이를 들고 있으면 날아다니는 모기를 생포할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_MOSQUITO_CRAFT_3_TITLE"
msgid "Itchcraft II"
msgstr "모기공예 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_PATHFINDER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_PATHFINDER_DESC"
msgid "Survivors near Wurt will move like her through the Marsh."
msgstr "워트 주위의 생존자들이 워트처럼 늪지에서 빨라집니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_PATHFINDER_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_PATHFINDER_TITLE"
msgid "Swamp Pathfinder"
msgstr "늪의 길잡이"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Your merm followers may die, but their shadows live on.\n"
"Infuse fallen merms' shadows with Planar power using Pure Horror."
msgstr ""
"당신을 따르는 어인들이 죽어서도 그림자로서 살아갑니다.\n"
"순수한 공포를 사용해 그림자 어인에게 차원의 힘을 부여합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_1_TITLE"
msgid "Shadow Resurrection Merm"
msgstr "그림자 소생체 어인"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"No land shall be safe from the dark and beautiful corruption of the Marsh."
msgstr "그 어떤 땅도 어둡고도 아름다운 늪으로의 타락을 피할 수는 없습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WURT.WURT_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_2_TITLE"
msgid "Terra Corruption"
msgstr "대지 오염"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_DESC"
msgid ""
"Using \"borrowed\" technology from the Cryptic Founder, allow Gestalts to "
"possess your Backup Chassis and become your spectrobotic minions."
msgstr "비밀스러운 창립자에게서 \"빌려온\" 기술을 이용해 게슈탈트를 예비 동체에 빙의하게 하여 심령 로봇 하수인으로 부립니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_LUNAR_TITLE"
msgid "Lunar Vessel"
msgstr "월광의 그릇"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_DESC"
msgid ""
"Allows insertion of select shadow components into your circuitry, granting "
"your Chassis various abilities in both inhabited and uninhabited states."
msgstr "회로에 제한된 종류의 그림자 부품을 삽입하여, 동체에 의식이 있을 때와 없을 때 각각 다양한 효과를 얻습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALLEGIANCE_SHADOW_TITLE"
msgid "Shadow Servitor"
msgstr "그림자의 종"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Processing Circuits gain a new effect in addition to their original effect. "
"Gastrogain Circuits are boosted."
msgstr "연산 회로에 새로운 기능이 추가됩니다. 소화기 확장 회로의 성능이 강화됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_TITLE"
msgid "Alpha Circuits Tinkering I"
msgstr "알파 회로 제조 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Hardy Circuits, Processing Circuits, and Beanbooster Circuit gain a new "
"effect in addition to their original effect. Gastrogain Circuits are "
"boosted."
msgstr "체력 증진 회로, 연산 회로, 빈부스터 회로에 새로운 기능이 추가됩니다. 소화기 확장 회로의 성능이 강화됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ALPHA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_TITLE"
msgid "Alpha Circuits Tinkering II"
msgstr "알파 회로 제조 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Thermal Circuit, Refrigerant Circuit, Optoelectronic Circuit, Chorusbox "
"Circuit, and Rangebooster Circuit gain a new effect in addition to their "
"original effect."
msgstr "발열 회로, 냉각 회로, 광전자 회로, 음악상자 회로, 범위 증폭 회로에 새로운 효과가 추가됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_TITLE"
msgid "Beta Circuits Tinkering I"
msgstr "베타 회로 제조 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Acceleration Circuits, Electrification Circuit, and Illumination Circuits "
"gain a new effect in addition to their original effect."
msgstr "가속 회로, 전격 회로, 조명 회로에 새로운 효과가 추가됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_TITLE"
msgid "Beta Circuits Tinkering II"
msgstr "베타 회로 제조 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_CHARGE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_CHARGE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Passive charge regeneration is much faster, and lose one less charge when "
"unplugging a charged circuit with two or more slots."
msgstr "전력 자연 재생이 훨씬 빨라집니다. 또한 슬롯을 2칸 이상 차지하는 회로를 뽑을 때 잃는 전력이 1 줄어듭니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_CHARGE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_CHARGE_TITLE"
msgid "Watts Up"
msgstr "잦은 교류"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_UNPLUG_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_UNPLUG_DESC"
msgid ""
"Gain the ability to unplug any circuit in the bar stack, and circuits will "
"lose half the usual amount of durability when unplugged."
msgstr "회로를 자유롭게 탈거할 수 있습니다. 또한 회로 제거 시의 내구도 소모가 원래의 절반으로 줄어듭니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_UNPLUG_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BETTER_UNPLUG_TITLE"
msgid "Right To Modify"
msgstr "개조할 권리"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BODYCIRCUITS_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BODYCIRCUITS_DESC"
msgid "Backup Chassis keep their Beta Circuits active even when powered down."
msgstr "예비 동체 전원이 꺼져 있어도 베타 회로가 작동합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BODYCIRCUITS_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_BODYCIRCUITS_TITLE"
msgid "Warm Standby"
msgstr "웜 스탠바이"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_CIRCUITRY_SLOT_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_CIRCUITRY_SLOT_1_DESC"
msgid "Grant an additional slot to all of your circuit bars."
msgstr "모든 회로 바에 슬롯이 1개 추가됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_CIRCUITRY_SLOT_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_CIRCUITRY_SLOT_1_TITLE"
msgid "Off By One"
msgstr "슬롯 오프셋"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Learn to craft a Portable Storage Unit to send items to any mapped location."
msgstr "지정된 지도 위치로 물건을 배송할 수 있는 '휴대용 저장 장치'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_1_TITLE"
msgid "Transport I"
msgstr "운송기 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_2_DESC"
msgid "Learn to craft a larger Portable Storage Unit."
msgstr "더 큰 '휴대용 저장 장치'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_DELIVERYDRONE_2_TITLE"
msgid "Transport II"
msgstr "운송기 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_1_DESC"
msgid "Learn to craft a reliable Backup Chassis."
msgstr "믿음직한 '예비 동체'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_1_TITLE"
msgid "Cold Standby I"
msgstr "콜드 스탠바이 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_2_DESC"
msgid "Build up to two Backup Chassis."
msgstr "예비 동체를 최대 2기 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_2_TITLE"
msgid "Cold Standby II"
msgstr "콜드 스탠바이 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_3_DESC"
msgid "Build up to three Backup Chassis."
msgstr "예비 동체를 최대 3기 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRABODY_3_TITLE"
msgid "Cold Standby III"
msgstr "콜드 스탠바이 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRADRONERANGE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRADRONERANGE_DESC"
msgid ""
"Expands the Bio Scanalyzer's scan radius, and extends the range of the Roto-"
"Mapper, Zaptrocuter, Auto-Grabber, and Exploiterator."
msgstr "생체 스캔 분석기 스캔, 회전익 탐사기, 자동 회수기, 취약점 분석기의 범위가 증가합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRADRONERANGE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_EXTRADRONERANGE_TITLE"
msgid "Signal Booster"
msgstr "신호 증폭기"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Chessmaster Circuit, Redigestion Circuit, and Sonic-Invoker Circuit gain a "
"new effect in addition to their original effect."
msgstr "체스마스터 회로, 재소화 회로, 음파 발진 회로에 새로운 효과가 추가됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_1_TITLE"
msgid "Gamma Circuits Tinkering I"
msgstr "감마 회로 제조 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"Blocking Circuit and Spin-Cycle Circuit gain a new effect in addition to "
"their original effect."
msgstr "방어 회로와 회전기 회로에 새로운 효과가 추가됩니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GAMMA_CIRCUIT_BUFFS_2_TITLE"
msgid "Gamma Circuits Tinkering II"
msgstr "감마 회로 제조 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Haunting a Backup Chassis transfers your consciousness into it, consuming "
"all of the chassis' charge units."
msgstr "예비 동체에 빙의하면 예비 동체의 전력을 모두 소모하고 의식을 해당 예비 동체로 이전합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_1_TITLE"
msgid "Inhabited Machine I"
msgstr "거주하는 기계 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_2_DESC"
msgid ""
"If you die with full charge and have not yet reached your maximum number of "
"Backup Chassis, one is left behind."
msgstr "전력이 가득 찬 상태에서 죽었을 때, 예비 동체 한도에 여유가 있으면 예비 동체를 하나 설치합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_2_TITLE"
msgid "Inhabited Machine II"
msgstr "거주하는 기계 II"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_3_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_3_DESC"
msgid "Reviving with a Backup Chassis fully restores your health."
msgstr "예비 동체에서 부활 시 모든 체력을 회복합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_3_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_GHOSTREVIVE_3_TITLE"
msgid "Inhabited Machine III"
msgstr "거주하는 기계 III"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_LOCK_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_LUNAR_ALLEGIANCE_LOCK_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Find and defeat the Celestial Champion.\n"
"Have no shadow affinity.\n"
"Be able to craft a Backup Chassis."
msgstr ""
"천상의 대변자를 찾아 쓰러뜨리세요.\n"
"그림자 진영 스킬을 배우지 마세요.\n"
"예비 동체 제작법을 보유하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_REMOTEBODYSWAP_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_REMOTEBODYSWAP_DESC"
msgid "Remotely Transfer Consciousness to any Backup Chassis on the map."
msgstr "지도상에서 예비 동체에 원격으로 의식을 이전할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_REMOTEBODYSWAP_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_REMOTEBODYSWAP_TITLE"
msgid "Remote Transfer"
msgstr "원격 전송"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_SCOUTDRONE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_SCOUTDRONE_1_DESC"
msgid "Learn to craft a Roto-Mapper to explore and map unknown areas."
msgstr "미지의 영역을 탐사하고 기록할 수 있는 '회전익 탐사기'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_SCOUTDRONE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_SCOUTDRONE_1_TITLE"
msgid "Field Survey"
msgstr "현장 조사"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_LOCK_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_SHADOW_ALLEGIANCE_LOCK_1_DESC"
msgid ""
"Find and defeat the Ancient Fuelweaver.\n"
"Have no lunar affinity.\n"
"Be able to craft a Backup Chassis."
msgstr ""
"고대의 연료직공을 찾아 쓰러뜨리세요.\n"
"달 진영 스킬을 배우지 마세요.\n"
"예비 동체 제작법을 보유하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_1_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_1_DESC"
msgid "Learn to craft a Zaptrocuter to zap enemies remotely."
msgstr "적을 원격으로 감전시키는 '찌릿콥터'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_1_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_1_TITLE"
msgid "Telemechanical Enthusiast I"
msgstr "원격 조종 애호가 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_2_DESC"
msgid "Learn to craft a Zaptrocuter with greater capacity."
msgstr "범위와 배터리 용량이 향상된 '찌릿콥터'를 제작할 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_2_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WX78.WX78_ZAPDRONE_2_TITLE"
msgid "Telemechanical Enthusiast II"
msgstr "원격 조종 애호가 II"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.abigail_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.abigail_ancient"
msgid "Flowers smell sweetest at Midsummer."
msgstr "하지의 꽃이야말로 가장 향기롭습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.abigail_creepy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.abigail_creepy"
msgid "Legend says this flower is haunted by the spirit of a young girl."
msgstr "전설에 따르면 이 꽃에는 어린 소녀의 영혼이 씌어 있다 합니다."

