"Wearing this 'follicle yellow' colored shirt makes you feel like the cat's "
"pajamas."
msgstr "조금 촌스러워 보이는 '개기름 노랑' 색상의 셔츠."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_blue_snowbird
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_blue_snowbird"
msgid ""
"An 'electrolytic blue' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. "
"Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "최상급 비팔로 털로 만든 '전해질 파랑' 색상의 조끼. 안타깝게도 별로 따뜻하지는 않아요."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_brown_beaver
