#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_abigail
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_abigail"
msgid ""
"Add a dash of color to the conversation.\n"
"\n"
"Type :abigail: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr ""
"대화에 색채를 더해보세요.\n"
"\n"
"채팅창에 :abigail:을 입력하여 이모티콘을 사용하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_alchemyengine
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_alchemyengine"
msgid ""
"Add a little science to everyone's day.\n"
"\n"
"Type :alchemyengine: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr ""
"일상에 약간의 과학을 더해보세요.\n"
"\n"
"채팅창에 :alchemyengine:을 입력하여 이모티콘을 사용하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_arcane
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_arcane"
msgid ""
"Make chatting a little more magical.\n"
"\n"
