msgstr "저들에게 자비를 베풀지 마세요."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_wizard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_wizard"
msgid ""
"Your enemies are usually slain before the curse can take effect. A pity, "
