#. STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.ANY
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.ANY"
msgid "You're, like, laidback and flexible, man. Any world is good with you."
msgstr "뭐랄까, 태평하고 유연한 분이시군요. 어떤 세계든지 잘 어울릴 겁니다."

#. STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.COMPETITIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.COMPETITIVE"
msgid ""
"You'll show your opponents exactly what you're made of by playing smarter, "
"harder, faster and coming out on top!"
msgstr "근성 있고 지능적이고 효율적인 플레이로 상대에게 격차라는 것을 보여주세요!"

#. STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.COOPERATIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.COOPERATIVE"
msgid ""
"Teamwork is your guiding principal. It's not enough to just not starve, you "
"have to not starve... Together!"
msgstr "팀워크가 곧 행동 규율입니다. 혼자 굶지 않는 걸로는 부족합니다. 바로... 다함께 굶지 말아야죠!"

#. STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.MADNESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.MADNESS"
msgid ""
"Who knows what'll happen next? Mass fighting, crazy dance parties, pits "
"filled with carnivorous spiders... it's pure madness!"
msgstr "한치 앞을 누가 알 수 있을까요? 패싸움, 광란의 댄스 파티, 식인 거미가 가득한 세상... 광기 그 자체입니다!"

#. STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.SOCIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SERVERLISTINGSCREEN.INTENTION_DESC.SOCIAL"
msgid ""
"You want to hang out, make friends, and play for fun. You don't care so much"
" if you win or lose, as long as everyone's having a good time!"
msgstr ""
"다른 사람들과 어울리고, 친구를 사귀고, 재미있게 플레이하기를 원하시군요. 모두가 즐거워만 한다면 이기든 지든 상관 없으시고요!"

